  <para style="h">Bɔfo Ɔmɛ</para>
  <para style="toc1">Bɔfo Ɔmɛ A Ni Tsumi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Bɔfo Ɔmɛ</para>
  <para style="toc3">Bɔf</para>
  <para style="mt1">Bɔfo Ɔmɛ A Ni Tsumi</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ACT 1" />
  <para style="s1">Kekle kaseli ɔmɛ a ni tsumi kɔ sɔmɔmi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 1:1" />Ye suɔlɔ kpakpa Tiofilo, i de mo ngɛ ye kekle womi nɛ i ngma mo ɔ mi, nihi nɛ kɔɔ Yesu wami kɛ e ni tsɔɔmi ɔmɛ a he, <verse eid="ACT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 1:2" />kɛ sɛ nɛ je Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ ngɔ nɛ e kɛ ha e kaseli ɔmɛ loko e kpale kɛ ho hiɔwe ya a. <verse eid="ACT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 1:3" />Benɛ a sɛu Yesu nɛ e te si se ɔ, e hi si hɛ kalɔ ligbi nyingmi eywiɛ sɔuu, nɛ e je e he si si abɔ kɛ tsɔɔ e bɔfo ɔmɛ ngɛ he lo mi kaa lɛ i, nɛ e kɛ mɛ sɛɛ Mawu Matsɛyemi ɔ he ni.<verse eid="ACT 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu hiɔwe yami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 1:4" />Ligbi ko nɛ e ba a ngɔ ɔ, e de mɛ ke a mlɛ ngɛ Yerusalem ma a mi kɛ ya si be nɛ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ maa ba a nɔ kaa bɔ nɛ e de mɛ momo ngɛ Tsɛ ɔ si womi nya a.<verse eid="ACT 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 1:5" />E ya nɔ nɛ e kai mɛ ke, “Yohane baptisi nyɛ kɛ nyu, se ngɛ ligbi bɔɔ se ɔ, a maa baptisi nyɛ kɛ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ.”<verse eid="ACT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 1:6" />Be kpa ko hu nɛ e je e he si kɛ tsɔɔ mɛ ɔ, a bi lɛ ke, “Nutsɔ, anɛ o ngɛ Israel kpɔe, amlɔ nɛ ɔ nɛ o pee wɔ ma nɛ ngɛ e he yee ɔ lo?”<verse eid="ACT 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 1:7" />Nɛ e ha mɛ heto ke, “Tsɛ ɔ to jamɛ a be ɔmɛ, se e pi nyɛ blɔ nya kaa nyɛɛ le. <verse eid="ACT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 1:8" />Se ke Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ ba nyɛ nɔ ɔ, e maa wo nyɛ he wami kɛ fiɛ Manye Munyu ɔ nɛ kɔɔ ye gbenɔ kɛ ye si temi ɔ he ngɛ Yerusalem kɛ Yudea zugba a tsuo nɔ kɛ Samaria kɛ ya si zugba a nyagbe hehi.”<verse eid="ACT 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 1:9" />Nɛ e ba mi kaa benɛ e de mɛ enɛ ɔ se ɔ, a ngɔ lɛ kɛ ho hiɔwe ya, nɛ e laa mɛ ngɛ bɔ kuu ɔ mi. <verse eid="ACT 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 1:10" />Benɛ a pee yaa kɛ ngɛ hiɔwe hyɛe gaa a, nyumuhi enuɔ nɛ wo tade futa ba da a kpɛti tlukaa, <verse eid="ACT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 1:11" />nɛ a de mɛ ke, “Galilea bi, mɛni he je nɛ nyɛ daa si ngɛ hiɔwe hyɛe gaa kikɛ ɔ? Yesu ɔ je kɛ ho hiɔwe ya, nɛ bɔ nɛ e plɛ kɛ je ɔ, e maa kpale kɛ ba ja a nɔuu ligbi ko.”<verse eid="ACT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 1:12" />Enɛ ɔ ba mi ngɛ Nuyoku ɔ nɛ kɛ Yerusalem kɛmi maa pee si tomi he fa a; lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, a kpale a se kɛ ba Yerusalem, <verse eid="ACT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 1:13" />nɛ a ba pee sɔlemi kpe ngɛ hiɔwe tsu ko mi ngɛ we ɔ mi he nɛ a ba to ɔ.<verse eid="ACT 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 1:14" />Nihi nɛ ngɛ lejɛ ɔ ji: Petro, Yohane, Yakobo, Andrea, Filipo, Toma, Bartolomeo, Mateo, Yakobo nɛ ji Alfeo bi ɔ kɛ Simon nɛ a tsɛɛ lɛ ke Zelote ɔ kɛ Yuda, Yakobo bi ɔ kɛ Yesu nyɛminyumu ɔmɛ. Yihi fuu nɛ Yesu nyɛ hu piɛ a he ɔ ngɛ lejɛ ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 1:15" />Sɔlemi kpe nɛ ɔ ya nɔ ligbi babauu. Se ligbi ko benɛ a ngɛ kpe ɔ mi, nɛ nimli maa pee lafa kɛ nyingmi enyɔ ngɛ lejɛ ɔ, Petro te si da si ngɛ a kpɛti nɛ e de mɛ ke,<verse eid="ACT 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 1:16" />“Anyɛmimɛ, e sa kaa nɔ́ nɛ a ngma nɛ kɔɔ Yuda he, nɔ nɛ tsɔɔ Yesu se blɔ nɛ a gbe lɛ ɔ, e ba mi kaa bɔ nɛ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ wo si momo kɛ gu Matsɛ David nɔ ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 1:17" />Yuda ji wa ti nɔ kake nɛ a hla lɛ ngɔ pee bɔfo kaa bɔ nɛ wɔ hu wa ngɛ ɔ nɔuu. <verse eid="ACT 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 1:18" />Se e ya he abɔɔ kɛ yayami nɛ e pee ɔ mi sika, nɛ e plɛ e yi kɛ ma si ngɛ lejɛ ɔ, nɛ e mi mi pɛ nɛ e muklii mi níhi tsuo je pue si. <verse eid="ACT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 1:19" />A nu e gbenɔ ɔ he ngɛ Yesuralem tsuo, nɛ a wo he nɛ e gbo ngɛ ɔ biɛ ke ‘Muɔ Abɔɔ’. <verse eid="ACT 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 1:20" />Si nɛ Matsɛ David wo ngɛ enɛ ɔ he ɔ ngɛ La womi ɔ mi, Lejɛ ɔ nɛ e de ngɛ ke, ‘Ha nɛ e we ɔ nɛ pee we doku nɛ nɔ ko ko hi mi; nɛ a ngɔ e ni tsumi ɔ kɛ ha nɔ kpa nɛ e tsu.’<verse eid="ACT 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 1:21" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, e sa nɛ waa hla nɔ ko nɛ e kɛ wɔ kɛ Nutsɔ ɔ je sisi <verse eid="ACT 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 1:22" />kɛ je benɛ Yohane baptisi lɛ kɛ ya si benɛ a ngɔ lɛ kɛ ho hiɔwe ya a, kɛ to Yuda nane mi konɛ e piɛ wa he kɛ ye e si temi ɔ he odase.”<verse eid="ACT 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 1:23" />Nɛ kpe ɔ gbɔ nyumuhi enyɔ a he tso. Mɛ ji Yosef Yusto nɛ a tsɛɛ lɛ ke Barsaba kɛ Matia. <verse eid="ACT 1:23" /><verse number="24-25" style="v" sid="ACT 1:24-25" />Kɛkɛ nɛ mɛ tsuo a sɔle konɛ Mawu nɛ hla nɔ́ nɛ sa ha mɛ. Bɔ nɛ a sɔle nɛ a de ji, “Nutsɔ, mo nɛ o le adesa fɛɛ adesa tsui mi. Moo tsɔɔ wɔ nimli enyɔ nɛ ɔmɛ a ti nɔ nɛ o hla kaa bɔfo ngɛ Yuda, nɔ se blɔ tsɔɔlɔ nɛ ho sihi he nɛ sa lɛ ɔ ya a nane mi.”<verse eid="ACT 1:24-25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 1:26" />Kɛkɛ nɛ a fɔ sɔ nɛ e ya nɔ Matia nɔ, nɛ a hla lɛ kaa bɔfo kɛ piɛ nimli nyɔngma kɛ kake ɔmɛ a he.<verse eid="ACT 1:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ACT 2" />
  <para style="s1">Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ bami ligbi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 2:1" />Benɛ Pentekoste ligbi ɔ su ngɛ otsi kpaago nɛ nyɛɛ Yesu gbenɔ kɛ e si temi ɔ se ɔ, Kristo se nyɛɛli ɔmɛ ya bua a he nya jamɛ a ligbi ɔ ngɛ he kake. <verse eid="ACT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 2:2" />Si kake too ɔ, a nu pɛmi ko he kɛ je hiɔwe kaa bɔ nɛ kɔɔhiɔ nɛ nya wa fiaa a, nɛ e yi we ɔ mi he nɛ a kpe ngɛ ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 2:3" />Kɛkɛ nɛ nɔ́ ko kaa la lilɛhi ba ma a yi mi. <verse eid="ACT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 2:4" />Nɛ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ ba a ti nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɔ, nɛ e ha a bɔni gbi kpahi nɛ a li tumi.<verse eid="ACT 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 2:5" />Jamɛ a ligbi ɔ Yuda bi Mawu jali babauu je mahi fuu a mi kɛ ba Yerusalem ngɛ Pentekoste ligbi ɔ yemi he. <verse eid="ACT 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 2:6" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, benɛ a nu pɛmi ɔ he ngɛ hiɔwe ngɛ jamɛ a we ɔ yi mi ɔ, nihi fuu wo fo kɛ ba lejɛ ɔ nɛ a ba hyɛ nɔ́ nɛ ba. Nɛ benɛ a nu nɛ kaseli ɔmɛ ngɛ mɛ nitsɛmɛ a gbihi tue ɔ, a nya kpɛ a he saminya.<verse eid="ACT 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 2:7" />Nɛ a kpa ngmlaa nɛ a bi a he ke, “Kɛ e ba kɛɛ? Ejakaa Galilea bi ji ni nɛ ɔmɛ, <verse eid="ACT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 2:8" />se a ngɛ wa zugba a nɔ gbi ɔmɛ tsuo tue kaa lejɛ ɔmɛ nɛ a fɔ mɛ ngɛ. <verse eid="ACT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 2:9" />Nyɛɛ hyɛ Partia bi kɛ Media bi kɛ Elam bi kɛ nihi nɛ je Mesopotamia kɛ Yudea kɛ Kapadokia, Ponto kɛ Asia, <verse eid="ACT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 2:10" />Frigia kɛ Pamfilia, Mizraim kɛ Kirene ngɛ Libia zugba a nɔ́ kɛ nibwɔhi nɛ je Roma, Yuda bi kɛ nihi nɛ plɛ Yuda bi, <verse eid="ACT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 2:11" />Kreta bi kɛ Arabia bi ji mɛ se wɔ tsuo wa ngɛ nue nɛ a ngɛ Mawu nyakpɛ ni agbohi jajee kɛ ngɛ wɔ dee ngɛ wɔ nitsɛmɛ wa gbi ɔmɛ a mi.”<verse eid="ACT 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 2:12" />Nɛ mɛ tsuo a nya kpɛ a he nɛ a pee yaa kɛ daa si, nɛ a bi a he ke, “Enɛ ɔ sisi nɛɛ?”<verse eid="ACT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 2:13" />Se ni komɛ hu ye a he fɛu nɛ a de ke, “Da nɛ a de.”<verse eid="ACT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 2:14" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Petro kɛ bɔfo nyɔngma kɛ kake ɔ te si, nɛ Petro wo e gbi nɔ nɛ e de asafo ɔ ke, “Yerusalem bi kɛ nibwɔhi, nyɛ tsuo nyɛɛ bu tue. <verse eid="ACT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 2:15" />Pi da nɛ ni nɛ ɔmɛ de kaa bɔ nɛ nyɛ ti ni komɛ ngɛ dee ɔ. E be mi, ejakaa je nɛ, nɛ nɔ ko di da mɔtu ngmlɛ nɛɛ mi. <verse eid="ACT 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 2:16" />Se mohu nɔ́ nɛ he je mɔtu nɛ ɔ ji nɔ́ ko nɛ Gbalɔ Yoel gba momoomo ke, <verse eid="ACT 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 2:17" />Mawu de ke, ‘Ngɛ nyagbe ligbi ɔ nɔ ɔ, i ma nɛ ye Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ ngɔ pue he lo tsuaa he lo nɔ, nɛ nyɛ binyumu ɔmɛ kɛ nyɛ biyi ɔmɛ maa gba, nihewi ɔmɛ maa na ni namihi, nɛ nikɔtɔma amɛ maa nla nlamihi. <verse eid="ACT 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 2:18" />Ye Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ maa ba ye sɔmɔli nyumu ɔmɛ kɛ yi ɔmɛ tsuo a nɔ nɛ a maa gba. <verse eid="ACT 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 2:19" />Ma pee nyakpɛ okadihi ngɛ hiɔwe kɛ zugba a nɔ, nɛ a maa na muɔ kɛ la kɛ la su ku nɛ wo kaa bɔ kuu. <verse eid="ACT 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 2:20" />Pu maa wo diblii, nɛ nyɔhiɔ ma plɛ muɔ loko Nutsɔ ɔ Ligbi nɛ he ngɛ gbeye ɔ maa su. <verse eid="ACT 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 2:21" />Nɛ e maa ba mi kaa nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ ma tsɛ Nutsɔ ɔ biɛ ke e na lɛ mɔbɔ ɔ, a ma he e yi wami.’<verse eid="ACT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 2:22" />Nyɛɛ bu tue, Israel bi! Mawu ye Yesu Nazaret no ɔ he odase ngɛ nyakpɛ okadi agbohi nɛ e pee kɛ gu e nɔ ɔ mi, kaa bɔ nɛ nyɛ nitsɛmɛ nyɛ le momo ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 2:23" />Se ngɛ Mawu blɔ nya tomi nya a, e ngmɛ blɔ nɛ nyɛ gu Roma nɔ yemi ɔ nɔ kɛ sɛu lɛ nɛ nyɛ gbe lɛ. <verse eid="ACT 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 2:24" />Se Mawu kpɔ lɛ kɛ je gbenɔ dɛ nɛ e tle lɛ si kɛ ba wami mi ekohu, ejakaa gbenɔ nyɛ we e nɔ nɛ e ye.<verse eid="ACT 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 2:25" />Matsɛ David kɛ Yesu de ke, ‘I le kaa Nutsɔ ɔ kɛ mi ngɛ daa. E yeɔ kɛ buaa mi nɛ e he wami ɔ hɛɛ ye mi.<verse eid="ACT 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 2:26" />Lɔ ɔ he je nɛ ye tsui mi hyi tɔ kɛ bua jɔmi, nɛ i jeɔ e yi ɔ nɛ, ejakaa i le kaa ke i gbo ɔ, i be laae.<verse eid="ACT 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 2:27" />Ejakaa o be ye klaa he ngmɛɛe ngɛ gbeje, nɛ o be hae nɛ o Bi Klɔuklɔu ɔ nɔmlɔ tso ɔ maa sa hulɔ.<verse eid="ACT 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 2:28" />O ma tle mi si kɛ ba wami mi ekohu, nɛ ma na bua jɔmi babauu ngɛ o hɛ mi.’<verse eid="ACT 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 2:29" />Anyɛmimɛ suɔli, nyɛ ha nɛ wa susu munyu nɛ ɔ he. Pi David nitsɛ e he nɛ e ngɛ susue benɛ e tu munyu nɛ ɔmɛ, ejakaa lɛ nitsɛ e gbo nɛ a pu lɛ nɛ e yɔkɔ ngɛ hiɛmɛ nɛ ɔ amlɔ nɛ ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 2:30" />Se gbalɔ ji lɛ nɛ e le klɛdɛɛ kaa Mawu ka kita kɛ wo si kaa David bimɛ nɛ maa ba ngɛ e se ɔ, a ti nɔ ko ma ba hi David matsɛ sɛ ɔ nɔ. <verse eid="ACT 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 2:31" />David na níhi nɛ maa ba hwɔɔ se ɔ nɛ e tu Mesia a si temi ɔ he munyu nɛ e de ke, e klaa be gbeje tlɔe, nɛ e nɔmlɔ tso hu be sae. <verse eid="ACT 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 2:32" />Yesu he munyu nɛ e ngɛ tue, nɛ wɔ tsuo wa yeɔ he odase kaa Yesu te si kɛ je gbeje niinɛ.<verse eid="ACT 2:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 2:33" />Amlɔ nɛ ɔ, e hii si ngɛ anunyami matsɛ sɛ ɔ nɔ ngɛ hiɔwe ngɛ Mawu hiɔ nine nɔ. Nɛ kaa bɔ nɛ e wo si ɔ, Tsɛ ɔ tsɔ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ kɛ ba, nɛ Mumi ɔ ni tsumihi ji níhi nɛ nyɛ ngɛ nae kɛ níhi nɛ nyɛ ngɛ nue mwɔnɛ ɔ nɛ.<verse eid="ACT 2:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 2:34" />Pi David nitsɛ e he munyu nɛ e ngɛ tue, ejakaa e yɛ hiɔwe hyɛ. Nɛ e de hu ke; ‘Mawu de ye Nutsɔ Mesia a ke, hii si ngɛ ye hiɔ nine nɔ <verse eid="ACT 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 2:35" />kɛ ya si be nɛ ma ye o he nyɛli ɔmɛ a nɔ kunimi.’<verse eid="ACT 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 2:36" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, i ngɛ hae nɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ ngɛ Israel nɛ le kaa Mawu pee Yesu nɛ nyɛ sɛu lɛ ɔ Nutsɔ kɛ Yiwamihelɔ.”<verse eid="ACT 2:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 2:37" />Munyu nɛ ɔmɛ nɛ Petro tu ɔ ta a tsui mi nɛ a bi lɛ kɛ bɔfo kpa amɛ ke, “Anyɛmimɛ, kɛ wa maa pee kɛɛ?”<verse eid="ACT 2:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 2:38" />Nɛ Petro ha mɛ heto nɛ e de ke, “Nyɛ ti nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ e tsake e tsui nɛ e kpale kɛ ba Mawu ngɔ nɛ e ha nɛ a baptisi lɛ ngɛ Yesu Kristo biɛ mi, konɛ a ngɔ e he yayami kɛ ke lɛ; nɛ e nine maa su Mumi Klɔuklɔu nɔ́ke nɔ ɔ nɔ. <verse eid="ACT 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 2:39" />Ejakaa Kristo wo si ke e kɛ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ ma ha nyɛ nihi nɛ Nutsɔ wa Mawu ɔ tsɛ ɔ, kɛ nyɛ bimɛ, kɛ hehi nɛ kɛ lokoo tsɛmɛ tete.”<verse eid="ACT 2:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 2:40" />Enɛ ɔ se ɔ, Petro fiɛ fiɛmi gaga ko nɛ e de e tue buli ɔmɛ níhi nɛ kɔɔ Yesu he. E ya nɔ nɛ e slɔ mɛ kaa a je a he kɛ je a ma a yayami peemi ɔmɛ a mi. <verse eid="ACT 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 2:41" />Nihi maa pee akpe etɛ nɛ he Petro ye ɔ, a baptisi mɛ. <verse eid="ACT 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 2:42" />Nɛ a piɛ nihi nɛ he ye momo ɔmɛ a he kɛ buɔ bɔfo ɔmɛ a ni tsɔɔmi ɔmɛ tue daa, nɛ a yeɔ Nutsɔ Niye ni nɛ a kɛ mɛ peeɔ kpe kɛ peeɔ sɔlemi. <verse eid="ACT 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 2:43" />Se gbeye nu mɛ tsuo, nɛ bɔfo ɔmɛ pee nyakpɛ okadihi fuu.<verse eid="ACT 2:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 2:44" />Nihi nɛ he ye ɔ buaa a he nya be fɛɛ be ngɛ he kake, nɛ a yeɔ kɛ buaa a he. <verse eid="ACT 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 2:45" />A ti nihi nɛ ngɛ nɔ́ ko ɔ, a ya juaa nɛ a kɛ yeɔ kɛ buaa ni nɛmɛ nɛ be nɔ́ ko ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 2:46" />A kpee kɛ jaa Mawu daa ngɛ Sɔlemi We ɔ; nɛ a buaa a he nya bɔɔbɔɔ ngɛ wehi a mi kɛ yeɔ Nutsɔ Niye ni. A dlaa a niye ni ɔmɛ nɛ mɛ tsuo a yeɔ kɛ bua jɔmi babauu kɛ si nami <verse eid="ACT 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 2:47" />kɛ Mawu yi jemi. A hɛ mi ba nyami ngɛ ma a mi, nɛ Mawu ngɔɔ nihi nɛ a he a yi wami ɔ kɛ piɛɔ a he daa ligbi.<verse eid="ACT 2:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ACT 3" />
  <para style="s1">Petro kɛ Yohane tsa akpaketsɛ ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 3:1" />Piani mi ɔ, Petro kɛ Yohane pue nɔ kɛ ho Sɔlemi We ɔ he nɛ a kpeɔ ngɛ daa ngmlɛ etɛ kɛ peeɔ sɔlemi ɔ ya. <verse eid="ACT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 3:2" />Se benɛ a ya su Sɔlemi We ɔ he ɔ, a na nyumu akpaketsɛ ko, nɛ ja a ji bɔ nɛ a fɔ lɛ. A kata lɛ kɛ ba fɔ Sɔlemi We ɔ agbo nɛ a tsɛɔ ke Agbo Fini ɔ nya kaa bɔ nɛ a pɔɔ peemi daa a, konɛ e ba ni ngɛ nihi nɛ baa Sɔlemi We ɔ a dɛ. <verse eid="ACT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 3:3" />Benɛ e na nɛ Petro kɛ Yohane yaa Sɔlemi We ɔ, e bi mɛ nɛ a ke lɛ sika.<verse eid="ACT 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 3:4" />Se a hyɛ lɛ too, nɛ Petro de lɛ ke, “Hyɛ wa hɛ mi!”<verse eid="ACT 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 3:5" />Kɛkɛ nɛ akpaketsɛ ɔ wo e hɛ mi nɔ nɛ e hyɛ mɛ gaa kaa a ma ha lɛ nɔ́ ko lo.<verse eid="ACT 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 3:6" />Petro de lɛ ke, “Wa be sika nɛ wa ma ha mo. Se ma ha mo nɔ kpa ko. I ngɛ mo fae ngɛ Yesu Kristo Nazaret no ɔ biɛ mi ke, moo te si nɛ o nyɛɛ!”<verse eid="ACT 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 3:7" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Petro pɛtɛ e nine mi nɛ e wo e nɔ kɛ da si, nɛ he wami ba e nane ɔmɛ kɛ e nakutso ɔmɛ a mi amlɔ ɔ nɔuu. <verse eid="ACT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 3:8" />Nɛ e tu kɛ da si nɛ e bɔni nyɛɛmi kɛ tuumi kɛ Mawu yi jemi, nɛ e kɛ mɛ sɛ Sɔlemi We ɔ kɛ bua jɔmi.<verse eid="ACT 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 3:9" />Benɛ asafo nɛ ngɛ Sɔlemi We ɔ na nɛ e ngɛ nyɛɛe nɛ e ngɛ Mawu yi jee ɔ, <verse eid="ACT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 3:10" />a yo kaa lɛ ji nɔ́ balɔ nɛ a naa daa ngɛ Agbo Fini ɔ nya a nɛ, nɛ a nya kpɛ a he. <verse eid="ACT 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 3:11" />Akɛnɛ akpaketsɛ ɔ nɛ a tsa lɛ ɔ pɛtɛ Petro kɛ Yohane he he je ɔ, ni ɔmɛ tsuo tu fo kɛ ya bua a he nya ngɛ lejɛ ɔ ngɛ Salomo Ablanaa a nɔ nɛ a pee yaa ngɛ nɔ́ nɛ ba a he. <verse eid="ACT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 3:12" />Petro da enɛ ɔ nɔ nɛ e de asafo ɔ ke, “Israel bi, mɛni he je nɛ enɛ ɔ ngɛ nyɛ nyakpɛ pee? Mɛni he je nɛ nyɛ ngɛ wɔ hyɛe gaa kikɛ ɔ, kaa nɔ́ nɛ wɔ nitsɛ wa he wami kɛ wa dami nya nɛ wa ha nɛ nyumu nɛ ɔ ngɛ nyɛɛe ɔ? <verse eid="ACT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 3:13" />Abraham kɛ Isak kɛ Yakob kɛ wa nɛmɛ a Mawu ɔ nɛ e tsu ni nɛ ɔ kɛ wo Yesu hɛ mi nyami. Yesu, nɔ nɛ nyɛ kua lɛ ngɛ Pilato hɛ mi benɛ Pilato pee e juɛmi kaa e maa ngmɛɛ e he ɔ he munyu nɛ i ngɛ tue ɔ nɛ. <verse eid="ACT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 3:14" />Nyɛ sume kaa a ngmɛɛ nɔmlɔ klɔuklɔu kɛ dalɔ nɛ ɔ he, nɛ nyɛ bi ke a ngmɛɛ nɔ gbelɔ ɔ mohu he ha nyɛ. <verse eid="ACT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 3:15" />Nɛ nyɛ gbe nɔmlɔ yi wami helɔ ɔ, se Mawu tle lɛ si ekohu. Ami kɛ Yohane wa yeɔ e si temi ɔ he odase, ejakaa benɛ nyɛ gbe lɛ se ɔ, wa na lɛ hɛ kalɔ ekohu.<verse eid="ACT 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 3:16" />Nyɛ le kaa akpaketsɛ ji nyumu nɛ ɔ, se a tsa lɛ ngɛ Yesu biɛ ɔ hemi kɛ yemi nya.<verse eid="ACT 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 3:17" />Anyɛmimɛ suɔli, i le kaa nɔ́ nɛ nyɛ pee Yesu ɔ, pe nyɛ li nɛ nyɛ pee, kaa nyɛ nikɔtɔma amɛ nɔuu. <verse eid="ACT 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 3:18" />Se mohu, si nɛ Mawu wo kɛ gu gbali ɔmɛ a nɔ kaa Mesia a maa na amanehlu nɛ ɔmɛ ɔ, lɔ ɔ nɛ ha e ba mi ja a nɛ. <verse eid="ACT 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 3:19" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, nyɛ tsake nyɛ tsui jehanɛ, nɛ nyɛɛ kpale ngɛ nyɛ yayami ɔmɛ a se kɛ ba Mawu ngɔ nɛ e maa tsukɔ nyɛ he, nɛ e ma ha nyɛ he jɔmi nɛ je Nutsɔ ɔ ngɔ ɔ, <verse eid="ACT 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 3:20" />konɛ e tsɔ Yesu, nyɛ Mesia a kɛ ba nyɛ ngɔ ekohu. <verse eid="ACT 3:20" /><verse number="21-22" style="v" sid="ACT 3:21-22" />Ejakaa e sa nɛ e hi si ngɛ hiɔwe kɛ ya si be nɛ yayami tsuaa yayami se maa po kaa bɔ nɛ blema gbali ɔmɛ gba a. Nɛ e maa ba mi kaa bɔ nɛ Mose gba momoomo nɛ e de ke, ‘Nutsɔ Mawu ɔ ma tle gbalɔ ko si kaa ami kɛ je nyɛ kpɛti kɛ ha nyɛ. Nyɛɛ bu lɛ tue saminya. <verse eid="ACT 3:21-22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 3:23" />Ejakaa a ma kpata nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ be lɛ tue bue ɔ hɛ mi.’<verse eid="ACT 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 3:24" />Gbali nɛ gba kɛ je Samuel yi nɔ, kɛ gbali nɛ nyɛɛ e se ɔ tsuo tsi níhi nɛ ngɛ nɔ yae mwɔnɛ ɔ nɔ ta. <verse eid="ACT 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 3:25" />Jamɛ a gbali ɔmɛ a bimɛ ji nyɛ, nɛ nyɛ piɛ si womi nɛ Mawu wo nyɛ nɛmɛ ɔ he, benɛ e de Abraham ke, a maa gbaa je ɔ tsuo kɛ gu Yuda bi ɔmɛ a nɔ ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 3:26" />Enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, benɛ Mawu tle e tsɔlɔ ɔ si kɛ je gbeje ɔ, e tsɔ lɛ kɛ ba nyɛ Israel bi ɔmɛ nyɛ ngɔ kekle konɛ e ba jɔɔ nyɛ nɛ e kpale nyɛ kɛ je nyɛ yayami ɔmɛ a se.”<verse eid="ACT 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ACT 4" />
  <para style="s1">A nu Petro ke Yohane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 4:1" />Benɛ Yohane kɛ Petro ngɛ munyu ɔ tue kɛ ngɛ ni ɔmɛ tsɔɔe ɔ, osɔfo nikɔtɔma amɛ kɛ Sɔlemi We Asafoatsɛ ɔ kɛ Saduki bi komɛ ba na mɛ <verse eid="ACT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 4:2" />kɛ abofu, ejakaa a ngɛ dee ke Yesu te si kɛ je gbeje. <verse eid="ACT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 4:3" />A nu mɛ, nɛ akɛnɛ je jɔ he je ɔ, a ya wo mɛ tsu kɛ ya si je na. <verse eid="ACT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 4:4" />Se nihi nɛ nu a fiɛmi ɔ, a ti nihi fuu he ye, nɛ nihi nɛ he ye jehanɛ ɔ maa su akpe enuɔ. <verse eid="ACT 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 4:5" />Nɛ e ba mi kaa benɛ je na a, Yuda bi ɔmɛ a nikɔtɔma amɛ tsuo ba bua a he nya ngɛ Yerusalem, <verse eid="ACT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 4:6" />nɛ Osɔfo Nɔkɔtɔma Anas kɛ Kaiafa kɛ Yohane kɛ Aleksandro kɛ ni kpahi nɛ je Osɔfo Nɔkɔtɔma a weku ɔ mi ɔ ba piɛ a he ngɛ lejɛ ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 4:7" />Kɛkɛ nɛ a kpaka kaseli enyɔ ɔmɛ kɛ ba da si ngɛ a hɛ mi nɛ a bi mɛ ke, “Mɛni he wami nyɛ ngɛ aloo mɛnɔ ji nɔ nɛ ha nyɛ he blɔ nɛ nyɛ kɛ tsu kikɛmɛ a nɔ́ nɛ ɔ?”<verse eid="ACT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 4:8" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Petro nɛ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ hyi lɛ tɔ ɔ ha mɛ heto ke, “Wa nimeli kɛ ma hɛ mi nyɛɛli, <verse eid="ACT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 4:9" />ke nɔ́ kpakpa nɛ a pee kɛ ha akpaketsɛ ɔ, kɛ bɔ nɛ a pee kɛ tsa lɛ ɔ he je nɛ a nu wɔ ngɛ ɔ, <verse eid="ACT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 4:10" />lɛɛ i ngɛ hae nɛ nyɛ kɛ Israel ma a kulaa nɛ le kaa Yesu Nazaret no nɛ ji Mesia a nɛ nyɛ sɛu lɛ, nɛ Mawu tle lɛ si kɛ je gbeje ɔ biɛ mi, kɛ he wami nya nɛ wa tsa nyumu nɛ daa si nɛ ɔ ngɛ. <verse eid="ACT 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 4:11" />Ejakaa Yesu, Mesia a ji tɛ ɔ nɛ a tu he munyu ngɛ Ngmami ɔ mi ke tsu fiali ɔmɛ sake ngɔ fɔ he, se lɛ nɔuu e ba plɛ kɔ nya tɛ ɔ nɛ. <verse eid="ACT 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 4:12" />A be yi wami hemi nae kɛ je nɔ kpa ko dɛ, nɛ biɛ kpa ko hu be hiɔwe nɛ a maa gu nɔ kɛ he nimli a yi wami.”<verse eid="ACT 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 4:13" />Benɛ kpe ɔ na ka nɛ Petro kɛ Yohane hɛɛ ɔ, nɛ a na le kaa a li womi mi nɛ a ji nimli gu komɛ kɛkɛ ɔ, a nya kpɛ a he nɛ a kɔ se kaa a ji nihi nɛ a kɛ Yesu hi si. <verse eid="ACT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 4:14" />Akɛnɛ nɔ nɛ a tsa a hu daa si ngɛ lejɛ ɔ he je ɔ, a nyɛ we nɛ a gbe e tsami ɔ he guɛ. <verse eid="ACT 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 4:15" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, a je mɛ kpo nɛ a ya a he dami.<verse eid="ACT 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 4:16" />Nɛ a bi a he ngɛ dami ɔ ke, “Kɛ wa maa pee nimli nɛ ɔmɛ kɛɛ? Ejakaa nɔ tsuaa nɔ ngɛ Yerusalem ɔ na le okadi agbo nɛ a pee nɛ ɔ, nɛ wa be nyɛe ma de ke e be mi. <verse eid="ACT 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 4:17" />Se bɔ nɛ pee nɛ a ko gbɛ a ni tsɔɔmi ɔ kɛ fia ngɛ ma a mi he je ɔ, nyɛ ha nɛ waa wo a he gbeye konɛ a ko pee nɔ́ ko kaa kikɛ ɔ hu.” <verse eid="ACT 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 4:18" />Nɛ a tsɛ mɛ kɛ ba ekohu nɛ a bɔ mɛ kɔkɔ ke a ko tu Yesu he munyu ko kulaa hu.<verse eid="ACT 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 4:19" />Se Petro kɛ Yohane he nɔ nɛ a de mɛ ke, “Ke e sa ngɛ Mawu hɛ mi kaa waa bu nyɛ mohu tue pe Mawu ɔ, lɛɛ nyɛɛ kojo. <verse eid="ACT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 4:20" />Ejakaa wɔɔ lɛɛ wa be kɔ nyɛe maa pee kaa ja wa de nyakpɛ níhi nɛ Yesu pee kɛ níhi nɛ wa nu ngɛ e nya a.”<verse eid="ACT 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 4:21" />Kɛkɛ nɛ a wo a he gbeye ekohu nɛ a ngmɛɛ a he, ejakaa ke a gbla a tue ɔ, gidigidi maa ba ma a mi; ejakaa nɔ tsuaa nɔ ngɛ Mawu yi jee <verse eid="ACT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 4:22" />ngɛ nyakpɛ tsami nɛ a tsa akpaketsɛ nɛ nyɛɛ we jeha nyingmi eywiɛ sɔuu ɔ he.<verse eid="ACT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 4:23" />Benɛ a ngmɛɛ a he ɔ, Petro kɛ Yohane ba kaseli kpa amɛ a ngɔ nɛ a ba bɔ mɛ nɔ́ nɛ osɔfo nikɔtɔma amɛ kɛ ma mi nikɔtɔma amɛ de mɛ ɔ.<verse eid="ACT 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Asafo ɔ sɔle kɛ yi jemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 4:24" />Benɛ Yesu se nyɛɛli ɔmɛ nu nɔ́ nɛ ba Petro kɛ Yohane nɔ ɔ, mɛ tsuo a sɔle kɛ gbi kake nɛ a de ke, “Nutsɔ, Hiɔwe kɛ Zugba kɛ Wo kɛ nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ nɛ ngɛ a mi ɔ Bɔlɔ, <verse eid="ACT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 4:25" />mo nɛ o tu munyu ngɛ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ mi kɛ gu wa nɛ Matsɛ David o tsɔlɔ ɔ nɔ nɛ o de ke, ‘Mɛni he je nɛ wɔ jali na Nutsɔ ɔ he abofu, nɛ mahi hu te si kɛ wo Mawu Ope ɔ yaka gu? <verse eid="ACT 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 4:26" />Nɛ zugba a nɔ matsɛmɛ hu pee kake kɛ te si kɛ si Mawu kɛ e Bi nɛ e pɔ lɛ nu ɔ.’<verse eid="ACT 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 4:27" />Enɛ ɔ ji nɔ́ nɛ ngɛ nɔ yae ngɛ ma nɛ ɔ mi amlɔ nɛ ɔ. Ejakaa Matsɛ Herode kɛ Pontio Pilato nɛ ji amlaalo ɔ kɛ Roma bi kɛ Israel ma a tsuo pee kake kɛ wo o tsɔlɔ nɛ ji o Bi Klɔuklɔu Yesu nɛ o pɔ lɛ nu ɔ he. <verse eid="ACT 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 4:28" />Nɛ a be kpae kaa ja a pee nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ nɛ o de kɛ to ngɛ o nile kɛ o he wami nya kaa a pee ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 4:29" />Nutsɔ, moo hyɛ bɔ nɛ a ngɛ wa he gbeye woe ha. Moo wo o tsɔɔli ɔmɛ ka nɛ a kɛ fiɛ o Manye Munyu ɔ, <verse eid="ACT 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 4:30" />nɛ o ha wɔ hiɔ tsami he wami, nɛ o ha waa pee okadihi kɛ nyakpɛ níhi babauu ngɛ Yesu o Bi Klɔuklɔu ɔ biɛ mi.”<verse eid="ACT 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 4:31" />Benɛ a gbe sɔlemi nɛ ɔ nya pɛ nɛ tsu ɔ mi he nɛ a kpe ngɛ ɔ tsuo hoso nɛ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ ba hyi mɛ tɔ nɛ a fiɛ Mawu Munyu ɔ kɛ ka.<verse eid="ACT 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Asafo ɔ pee kake kɛ hi si</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 4:32" />Nɛ nihi nɛ he ye ɔmɛ tsuo pee kake kɛ hi si nɛ a ti nɔ ko pee we e he kaa níhi nɛ e ngɛ ɔ, lɛ nitsɛ e nɔ́ i. Se mohu a ngɔ kulaa ngɔ pee kake nɛ a dla kɛ ha nɔ tsuaa nɔ. <verse eid="ACT 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 4:33" />Nɛ bɔfo ɔmɛ fiɛ Manye Munyu ɔ kɛ he wami nɛ a ye Nutsɔ Yesu si temi ɔ he odase, nɛ mɛ nihi nɛ a he ye ɔ na a bi a he bua jɔmi babauu. <verse eid="ACT 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 4:34" />A ti nɔ ko yí ohia, ejakaa a ti nihi nɛ ngɛ zugba loo wehi ɔ, a ho ya jua mɛ <verse eid="ACT 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 4:35" />nɛ a ngɔ sika a kɛ ba ha bɔfo ɔmɛ nɛ a gba kɛ ha a ti nihi nɛ be nɔ́ ko ɔmɛ.<verse eid="ACT 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 4:36" />E ba mi kaa Yosef nɛ ji Levi no ko nɛ je Kipro wo kpɔ ɔ nɔ ɔ, nɛ bɔfo ɔmɛ wo lɛ biɛ ke Barnaba a hu <verse eid="ACT 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 4:37" />piɛ nihi nɛ ya jua a zugbahi nɛ a kɛ sika a ba ha bɔfo ɔmɛ nɛ a dla kɛ ha ohiafo ɔmɛ ɔ a he.<verse eid="ACT 4:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ACT 5" />
  <para style="s1">Anania kɛ Safira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 5:1" />Se nyumu ko nɛ a tsɛɛ lɛ ke Anania kɛ e yo hu ya jua a weto nɔ́ ko <verse eid="ACT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 5:2" />nɛ a ngɔ sika a fa kɛ ba nɛ a ba de bɔfo ɔmɛ ke sika a kulaa nɛ a kɛ ba a nɛ.<verse eid="ACT 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 5:3" />Se Petro bi Anania ke, “Anania, mɛni he je nɛ Abosiami sɛ o mi nɛ o ngɛ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ lakpa yee ke sika a kulaa ji nɛ ɔ? <verse eid="ACT 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 5:4" />Weto nɔ́ ɔ, mo nitsɛ o nɔ́ i, nɛ o jua lɛ bɔ nɛ o suɔ. Ja a nɔuu o ma nyɛ ke bɔ nɛ o suɔ. Mɛni he je nɛ o ngɛ lakpa yee mɔ? Mawu nɛ o ngɛ sisie se pi wɔ.”<verse eid="ACT 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 5:5" />Petro nya nɔɛ si nɛ Anania nɔ si ngɛ zugba nɛ e gbo amlɔ ɔ nɔuu. Nɔ tsuaa nɔ tsui po, nɛ a ye gbeye. <verse eid="ACT 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 5:6" />Kɛkɛ nɛ nihewi komɛ nɛ ngɛ lejɛ ɔ ba dla gbogboe ɔ nɛ a wo lɛ ya pu.<verse eid="ACT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 5:7" />Safira li nɔ nɛ ba e huno ɔ nɔ. Maa pee ngmlɛfia etɛ se ɔ, lɛ hu e ba lejɛ ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 5:8" />Nɛ Petro bi lɛ ke, “Anɛ bɔ nɛ nyɛ jua nyɛ zugba a ha ji nɛ ɔ lo?” E ha lɛ heto ke, “Ee, ja a nɛ wa jua lɛ.” <verse eid="ACT 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 5:9" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Petro bi lɛ ke, “Mɛni he je nɛ o kɛ o huno ɔ pee kake kɛ ngɛ Mawu Mumi ɔ kae kaa e le nɔ́ nɛ ngɛ nɔ yae ɔ lo? Nihi nɛ ya pu o huno ɔ, mɛ nɛ a daa si ngɛ sinya a se ɔ nɛ, nɛ a ma wo mo hu kɛ ho piɔ.”<verse eid="ACT 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 5:10" />Oya a nɔuu nɛ e nɔ si nɛ e gbo. Benɛ nihewi ɔmɛ ba ba na kaa e gbo ɔ, a wo lɛ nɛ a ya pu lɛ ngɛ e huno ɔ kasa mi. <verse eid="ACT 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 5:11" />Asafo ɔ kɛ nihi kulaa nɛ nu nɔ́ nɛ ba a he ɔ ye gbeye saminya.<verse eid="ACT 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 5:12" />Jamɛ a be ɔ mi ɔ, bɔfo ɔmɛ ya kpee daa ngɛ Salomo Ablanaa a nɔ ngɛ Sɔlemi We ɔ, nɛ a tsuɔ nyakpɛ níhi nɛ a peeɔ okadi nguahi ngɛ ma a mi. <verse eid="ACT 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 5:13" />Nihi nɛ be asafo ɔ mi nɛ be a ngɔ tete po buu mɛ saminya ngɛ ma a mi. <verse eid="ACT 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 5:14" />Se nihi babauu nɛ ji nyumuhi kɛ yihi tsuo nɛ he Nutsɔ ɔ nɔ ye ɔ ba piɛ a he. <verse eid="ACT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 5:15" />Nɛ a wo hiɔtsɛhi kɛ ba gbɛjegbɛ ɔmɛ a tue ngɛ sahi a nɔ nɛ a ngɛ mlɛe konɛ ke Petro bee ɔ, e nini nɛ pue a nɔ. <verse eid="ACT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 5:16" />Nihi babauu je Yerusalem kɔpe ɔmɛ a mi nɛ a wo hiɔtsɛhi kɛ nihi nɛ mumi yayami ngɛ a mi kɛ ba a ngɔ nɛ a tsa a ti nɔ tsuaa nɔ.<verse eid="ACT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">A nu bɔfo ɔmɛ ekomɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17-18" style="v" sid="ACT 5:17-18" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Osɔfo Nɔkɔtɔma a kɛ e wekuli kɛ e huɛmɛ nɛ ngɛ Saduki bi ɔmɛ a kpɛti ɔ hɛ dɔ nɛ a ba nu bɔfo ɔmɛ kɛ ya wo tsu. <verse eid="ACT 5:17-18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 5:19" />Se Nutsɔ ɔ bɔfo ko ba bli tsu ɔ nya ha mɛ nyɔ mi kpɛti nɛ e je mɛ kpo, nɛ e de mɛ ke, <verse eid="ACT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 5:20" />“Nyɛɛ ya Sɔlemi We ɔ nɛ nyɛ ya fiɛ Wami nɛ ɔ he sane kɛ tsɔɔ ma a.”<verse eid="ACT 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 5:21" />A pue nɔ kɛ ho Sɔlemi We ɔ ya. A ya su lejɛ ɔ benɛ je mi ngɛ tsɔe nɛ a bɔni fiɛmi nɔuu. Pee se ɔ, Osɔfo Nɔkɔtɔma a kɛ e se nyɛɛli ɔmɛ ba Sɔlemi We ɔ jamɛ a mɔtu ɔ nɛ a tsɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ a nikɔtɔma amɛ ngɛ ma a mi kpe; nɛ a tsɔ ke a ya kpaka bɔfo ɔmɛ kɛ ba nɛ a kojo mɛ. <verse eid="ACT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 5:22" />Se benɛ tsɔli ɔmɛ ba he nɛ a wo mɛ tsu ngɛ ɔ, a na kaa bɔfo ɔmɛ be tsu ɔ mi, lɔ ɔ he je ɔ a kpale ya bɔ kpe ɔ amaniɛ ke, <verse eid="ACT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 5:23" />“A ngmɛ tsu ɔmɛ a nya kpɛii nɛ buli ɔmɛ hu daa si ngɛ agbo ɔmɛ a nya pɛpɛɛpɛ. Se benɛ wa bli tsu ɔmɛ a nya a, wa nɛ nɔ ko ngɛ a mi.”<verse eid="ACT 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 5:24" />Benɛ tsɔli ɔmɛ bɔ mɛ nɔ́ nɛ a ya na a, polisi ɔmɛ a nyatsɛ ɔ kɛ osɔfo nikɔtɔma amɛ pee yaa nɛ a bɔni nɔ́ nɛ maa ba kɛ e nyagbe ɔ he susumi. <verse eid="ACT 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 5:25" />Kɛkɛ nɛ nɔ ko ba ba de mɛ ke ni ɔmɛ nɛ a wo tsu ɔ, a je kpo nɛ a ya ngɛ fiɛe ha ni ɔmɛ ngɛ Sɔlemi We ɔ.<verse eid="ACT 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26-27" style="v" sid="ACT 5:26-27" />Nɛ polisi ɔmɛ a nyatsɛ ɔ kɛ e we bi ɔmɛ ho ya kpaka mɛ blɛuu kɛ ba kpe ɔ hɛ mi. A pee we mɛ basabasa, ejakaa a ngɛ gbeye yee kaa ke a pee mɛ jamɛ a nɔ ko ɔ, ma mi bi ɔmɛ maa gbe mɛ.<verse eid="ACT 5:26-27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 5:28" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Osɔfo Nɔkɔtɔma a bi mɛ ke, “Anɛ wa bɔɛ nyɛ kɔkɔ ke nyɛ ko fiɛ ngɛ Yesu biɛ mi ngɛ ma nɛ ɔ mi hu lo? Nyɛ ha nɛ Yerusalem tsuo hyi tɔ kɛ nyɛ ni tsɔɔmi ɔ; nɛ nyɛ ngɛ hlae nɛ nyɛ pia wɔ ngɛ nyumu nɛ ɔ gbenɔ ɔ he.”<verse eid="ACT 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 5:29" />Se Petro kɛ bɔfo ɔmɛ he nɔ nɛ a de mɛ ke, “E sa kaa waa bu Mawu tue pe nimli. <verse eid="ACT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 5:30" />Wa nɛmɛ a Mawu ɔ nɛ tle Yesu si kɛ je gbeje benɛ nyɛ sɛu lɛ ngɛ sɛumi tso nɔ nɛ e gbo ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 5:31" />Nɛ Mawu wo e nɔ gojoo kɛ he wami, nɛ e pee lɛ Matsɛ bi kɛ Yiwamihelɔ konɛ Israel bi ɔmɛ a na he blɔ nɛ a tsake a tsui nɛ a ngɔ a he yayami kɛ ke mɛ. <verse eid="ACT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 5:32" />Wɔ ji kikɛmɛ a ní nɛ ɔmɛ a he odase yeli, kaa bɔ nɛ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ nɛ Mawu kɛ haa nihi nɛ buu lɛ tue ɔ hu yeɔ he odase ɔ.”<verse eid="ACT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 5:33" />Petro munyu ɔ heto ɔ ha kpe ɔ na abofu wawɛɛ nɛ a pee a juɛmi kaa a maa gbe mɛ. <verse eid="ACT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 5:34" />Se Farisi no mlaa tsɔɔlɔ ko nɛ a tsɛɛ lɛ ke Gamaliel, nɛ a buu lɛ ngɛ ma a mi ɔ, te si da si nɛ e de kpe ɔ ke a ha nɛ bɔfo ɔmɛ a je kpo bɔɔ. Ejakaa e maa suɔ nɛ e kɛ kpe ɔ nɛ na ni sɛɛmi.<verse eid="ACT 5:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 5:35" />Benɛ bɔfo ɔmɛ je kpo se ɔ, Gamaliel de kpe ɔ ke, “Israel bi, nyɛɛ hyɛ nyɛ he nɛ hi ngɛ nɔ́ nɛ nyɛ ngɛ hlae nɛ nyɛɛ pee nimli nɛ ɔmɛ ɔ he. <verse eid="ACT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 5:36" />Nyɛ kai kaa be ko nɛ be ɔ, nyumu ko nɛ a tsɛɛ lɛ ke Teuda a te si nɛ e pee e he kaa nɔ ko ji lɛ nɛ nihi maa pee lafa eywiɛ nyɛɛ e se; se a gbe lɛ, nɛ e se nyɛɛli ɔmɛ gbɛ fia nɛ nɔ́ ko be.<verse eid="ACT 5:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 5:37" />Ngɛ nyumu nɛ ɔ se ɔ, Galilea no ko nɛ a tsɛɛ lɛ ke Yuda hu ba te si benɛ a ngɛ nimli a yi bɔ kanee ɔ. Ni komɛ nyɛɛ e se kaa e kaseli, se lɛ hu a gbe lɛ nɛ e se nyɛɛli ɔmɛ gbɛ fia.<verse eid="ACT 5:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 5:38" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, i ngɛ nyɛ slɔe kaa nyɛɛ ngmɛɛ nimli nɛ ɔmɛ a he, nɛ nyɛ ko di mɛ. Ejakaa ke mɛ nitsɛmɛ a yi mi tomi he ni nɛ a ngɛ tsue ɔ, e be kɛe nɛ e se maa po. <verse eid="ACT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 5:39" />Se ke Mawu ni tsumi nɛ a ngɛ tsue ɔ, lɛɛ nyɛ be a nya nyɛe maa tsi, nɛ e maa ba mi kaa nyɛɛ kɛ Mawu ngɛ ta hwue.”<verse eid="ACT 5:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 5:40" />Kpe ɔ bu lɛ tue, nɛ a tsɛ bɔfo ɔmɛ kɛ ba a hɛ mi ekohu. A fiaa mɛ kpa nɛ a bɔ mɛ kɔkɔ ke a ko tu munyu ngɛ Yesu biɛ mi hu; kɛkɛ nɛ a ngmɛɛ a he ke a ho. <verse eid="ACT 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 5:41" />Nɛ a je a ngɔ kɛ bua jɔmi kaa Mawu bu mɛ nimli nɛ sa nɛ a bɔ mɛ ahlua ngɛ e biɛ ɔ he. <verse eid="ACT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 5:42" />A ya nɔ nɛ a tsɔɔ ni, nɛ a fiɛ ngɛ Sɔlemi We ɔ kɛ Ngmami ɔ kasemi hehi ngɛ a wehi a mi daa ligbi ke Yesu ji Mesia a nɛ.<verse eid="ACT 5:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ACT 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 6:1" />Nɛ e ba mi kaa benɛ nihi nɛ he ye ɔmɛ a he bɔni hiɛmi ɔ, munyu hwitihwiti ba te si ngɛ Hebri bi ɔmɛ kɛ Hela bi ɔmɛ a kpɛti. Kikɛmɛ a pɛ nɛ ɔ ba a kpɛti, ejakaa Hela bi ɔmɛ na kaa a ha we a kpɛti yihi nɛ a hunohi gbo ɔmɛ a daa niye ni ɔ kaa bɔ nɛ a haa Hebri bi ɔmɛ. Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, a bua jɔɛ. <verse eid="ACT 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 6:2" />Enɛ ɔ ha bɔfo nyɔngma kɛ enyɔ ɔ mi tsɛ kaseli asafo ɔ tsuo kpe nɛ a de mɛ ke, “E sɛ kaa waa ngmɛɛ Manye Munyu ɔ fiɛmi ɔ he nɛ wa ya gba niye ni. <verse eid="ACT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 6:3" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, anyɛmimɛ suɔli; nyɛɛ hyɛ nyɛ kpɛti nɛ nyɛɛ hla ni leli kpaago nɛ a ngɛ biɛ kpakpa, nɛ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ hyi mɛ tɔ ɔ, konɛ waa kɛ mɛ nɛ to kikɛmɛ a ni tsumi nɛ ɔ nya; <verse eid="ACT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 6:4" />bɔ nɛ pee nɛ wa na be kɛ ha sɔlemi kɛ Manye Munyu ɔ fiɛmi kɛ ni tsɔɔmi.”<verse eid="ACT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 6:5" />Munyu nɛ ɔ ngɔ asafo ɔ tsuo nya nɛ a hla Stefano, nyumu ko nɛ ngɛ hemi kɛ yemi nɛ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ hyi lɛ tɔ ɔ, kɛ Filipo kɛ Prokoro kɛ Nikanora kɛ Timon kɛ Parmena kɛ ma je no ko nɛ ba plɛ Yuda no kɛ Kristo se nyɛɛlɔ, nɛ je Antiokia nɛ a tsɛɛ lɛ ke Nikolao ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 6:6" />A kɛ mɛ ba bɔfo ɔmɛ a hɛ mi nɛ a sɔle ha mɛ nɛ a kɛ a nine pue a nɔ nɛ a jɔɔ mɛ.<verse eid="ACT 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 6:7" />Mawu Munyu ɔ gbɛ fia ngɛ Yerusalem tsuo, nɛ kaseli ɔmɛ a yi bɔ ba hiɛ fuu, nɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ a osɔfo ɔmɛ tete a ti nihi babauu he ye. <verse eid="ACT 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 6:8" />Nɛ Stefano, nɔ nɛ ngɛ hemi kɛ yemi nɛ Mumi Klɔuklɔu he wami ɔ hyi lɛ tɔ ɔ, pee nyakpɛ níhi ngɛ ma a mi.<verse eid="ACT 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 6:9" />Ligbi ko ɔ, ni komɛ nɛ je Yuda bi ɔmɛ a kuu ko nɛ a tsɛɛ ke “Heyemi Bimɛ” ɔ a kpɛti ɔ ba e ngɔ nɛ a kɛ lɛ ba ngɛ nɔ́ ko he nya sae. E kɛ we nɛ Yuda bi komɛ nɛ je Kireene kɛ Aleksandria ngɛ Mizraim kɛ Kilikia kɛ Asia ba piɛ a he. <verse eid="ACT 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 6:10" />Se a ti nɔ ko nyɛ we Stefano nile kɛ e mumi nɛ e kɛ ngɛ munyu ɔ tue ɔ nya nɛ e da.<verse eid="ACT 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 6:11" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, a kɛ ni komɛ ba nɛ a ba po Stefano nya kaa a nu nɛ e ngɛ musu bɔmi munyu tue kɛ ngɛ Mose kɛ Mawu tete sie.<verse eid="ACT 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">A nu Stefano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 6:12" />Enɛ ɔ ha nɛ ma a tsuo na Stefano he abofu, nɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ a nikɔtɔma amɛ fa ke a ya nu lɛ kɛ ba a kpe ɔ hɛ mi. <verse eid="ACT 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 6:13" />Nɛ odase yeli ɔmɛ ba ye lakpa odase kɛ si lɛ nɛ a de ke a nuɔ nɛ e tuɔ musu bɔmi munyu kɛ siɔ Sɔlemi We ɔ kɛ Mose mlaa amɛ daa nɛ.<verse eid="ACT 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 6:14" />Aya nɔ nɛ a po e nya ke, “Wa nu nɛ e de ke Yesu Nazaret no ɔ maa ywia Sɔlemi We ɔ nɛ e ma tsake Mose mlaa amɛ.” <verse eid="ACT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 6:15" />Kɛkɛ nɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ ngɛ lejɛ ɔ na nɛ Stefano hɛ mi bɔni kpɛmi kaa Mawu bɔfo hɛ mi.<verse eid="ACT 6:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ACT 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 7:1" />Nɛ Osɔfo Nɔkɔtɔma a bi lɛ ke, “Anɛ kikɛmɛ a munyu nɛ ɔmɛ ngɛ mi lo?”<verse eid="ACT 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 7:2" />Stefano he nɔ nɛ e ha heto ke, “Ye tsɛmɛ kɛ ye nyɛmimɛ, nyɛɛ bu tue. Anunyami Mawu ɔ je e he kpo kɛ tsɔɔ wa nɛ Abraham benɛ e ngɛ Mesopotamia a loko e hia kɛ ho Haran ya; <verse eid="ACT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 7:3" />nɛ e de lɛ ke e si e ma a kɛ e wekuli kɛ ho ma nɔ he nɛ e maa tsɔɔ lɛ ɔ ya. <verse eid="ACT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 7:4" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Abraham si Kaldea bi ɔmɛ a zugba a nɔ nɛ e ya hi Haran ngɛ Siria zugba a nɔ, nɛ e hi lejɛ ɔ kɛ ya si benɛ e tsɛ si je mi, nɛ Mawu kɛ lɛ ba Israel zugba a nɔ. <verse eid="ACT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 7:5" />Se Mawu ha we lɛ weto ni loo zugba ko kaa lɛ nitsɛ e nɔ́. Jamɛ a be ɔ mi ɔ, Abraham be bi, se Mawu wo lɛ si kaa e maa ngɔ zugba a tsuo kɛ ha lɛ kɛ e nina nɛ maa ba ngɛ e se ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 7:6" />Mawu ya nɔ nɛ e de lɛ ke e nina hu ma si zugba a nɔ nɛ a ma ya ye nyɔguɛ ngɛ ma kpa nɔ jeha lafa eywiɛ. <verse eid="ACT 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 7:7" />E tsa nɔ nɛ e de lɛ ke, ‘Ma gbla ma nɛ maa ye nyɛ nyɔguɛ ɔ tue, nɛ lɔ ɔ se ɔ, ma kpale nyɛ kɛ ba Israel zugba a nɔ ekohu nɛ nyɛ ba ja mi ngɛ hiɛ ɔ.’<verse eid="ACT 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 7:8" />Nɛ Mawu to kusumi nɛ ji nɔ nyumu mi womi ɔ kaa kaimi nɔ́ ngɛ lɛ kɛ Abraham bimɛ a kpɛti. Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, Abraham wo e bi Isak nyumu mi benɛ a fɔ lɛ nɛ e ye ligbi kpaanyɔ ɔ. Nɛ Isak fɔ Yakob, nɛ Yakob fɔ bimɛ nyɔngma kɛ enyɔ. Mɛ ji Yuda bi ɔmɛ a wɛtso nyɔngma kɛ enyɔ ɔ nɛ. <verse eid="ACT 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 7:9" />Se Yakob bi ɔmɛ a hɛ kɔ a nyɛmi Yosef ɔ nɔ nɛ a jua lɛ kaa nyɔguɛ kɛ ho Mizraim ya. Se Mawu hɛ ji e nɔ, <verse eid="ACT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 7:10" />nɛ e je lɛ kɛ je amanehluhi a mi nɛ e ha nɛ e hɛ mi ba nyami ngɛ Mizraim Matsɛ Farao hɛ mi, nɛ a pee lɛ Mizraim zugba a tsuo nɔ hyɛlɔ kɛ lɛ nitsɛ e matsɛ yemi ɔ mi nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ he blɔ nya tolɔ.<verse eid="ACT 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 7:11" />Nɛ e ba mi kaa hwɔ nɛ nya wa ko ba, nɛ e wo dengme kɛ ba wa nɛ ɔmɛ a nɔ ngɛ Mizraim kɛ Kanaan zugba a tsuo nɔ. <verse eid="ACT 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 7:12" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, benɛ a niye ni ta a, Yakob nu kaa niye ni ngɛ Mizraim, nɛ e tsɔ e bi ɔmɛ nɛ a ya he eko kɛ ba. <verse eid="ACT 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 7:13" />Se benɛ Yosef nyɛmimɛ ɔmɛ ya niye ni ɔ hemi si enyɔne ɔ, e je e he si kɛ ha mɛ nɛ e kɛ mɛ tsɔɔ Farao. <verse eid="ACT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 7:14" />Nɛ Yosef ha a ya wo e tsɛ Yakob kɛ e wekuli nɛ mɛ tsuo a peeɔ nyingmi kpaago kɛ enuɔ ɔ kɛ ba Mizraim. <verse eid="ACT 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 7:15" />Yakob kɛ e bi ɔmɛ gbo ngɛ Mizraim; <verse eid="ACT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 7:16" />nɛ a ya pu mɛ tsuo ngɛ Sekem ngɛ gɔ nɛ Abraham he ngɛ Sekem tsɛ Hamor bi ɔmɛ a dɛ ɔ mi.<verse eid="ACT 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 7:17" />Se benɛ si womi nɛ Mawu wo Abraham kaa e ma je e nina amɛ kɛ je nyɔguɛ yemi ɔ mi ɔ be ɔ ba su ɔ, Yuda bi ɔmɛ a he ba hiɛ fuu ngɛ Mizraim. <verse eid="ACT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 7:18" />Nɛ e ba mi kaa matsɛ kpa nɛ ba hi sɛ ɔ nɔ ɔ li Yosef he sane ko. <verse eid="ACT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 7:19" />Matsɛ nɛ ɔ kɛ wa nɛ ɔmɛ hi si ngɛ sisimi blɔ nɔ, nɛ e pee mɛ yayami. E haa nɛ fɔli ya jee a bimɛ a he ngɛ nga nɔ nɛ a gboɔ.<verse eid="ACT 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 7:20" />Jamɛ a be ɔ mi nɔuu nɛ a fɔ Mose. E ji bi ko nɛ he ngɛ fɛu ngɛ Mawu hɛ mi, nɛ e fɔli ɔmɛ ngɔ lɛ kɛ laa ngɛ a we ɔ mi hlami etɛ. <verse eid="ACT 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 7:21" />Se benɛ a na kaa a be lɛ nyɛe maa laa hu ɔ, a wo lɛ ya fɔ he. Kɛkɛ nɛ Farao biyo ko ya na lɛ nɛ e wo lɛ. E ya lɛ lɛ kaa lɛ nitsɛ e bi; <verse eid="ACT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 7:22" />nɛ e tsɔɔ lɛ Mizraim nile, nɛ e pee matsɛ bi agbo nɛ e nya mi tsɔ.<verse eid="ACT 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 7:23" />E ba mi kaa benɛ e piɛ bɔɔ nɛ e maa ye jeha nyingmi eywiɛ ɔ, e pee e juɛmi kaa e ma ya slaa e nyɛmimɛ Israel bi ɔmɛ. <verse eid="ACT 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 7:24" />Benɛ Mose ya e nyɛmi ɔmɛ slaami ɔ, e na nɛ Mizraim no ko ngɛ Israel no ko yi kpɛti wae, nɛ e gbe Mizraim no ɔ nɛ e gbo. <verse eid="ACT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 7:25" />Mose susu kaa e nyɛmi ɔmɛ ma yo kaa Mawu nɛ tsɔ lɛ nɛ e ba ye kɛ bua mɛ, se a yo we.<verse eid="ACT 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 7:26" />E nɔ jena benɛ e ya slaa mɛ ekohu ɔ, e na nɛ Israel bi enyɔ ngɛ kunɔ nɔe. E bɔ mɔde kaa e ma kpata mɛ, nɛ e de mɛ ke, ‘Anyɛmimɛ, nyɛ Sɔuu i, nɛ e sɛ kaa nyɛɛ hi kunɔ nɔe.’<verse eid="ACT 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 7:27" />Se a ti nɔ nɛ pee e nyɛmi yayami ɔ de Mose ke, e pi e he sane ko. Nɛ e bi Mose ke, ‘Mɛnɔ pee mo wa nɔ hyɛlɔ kɛ kojolɔ? <verse eid="ACT 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 7:28" />Anɛ o ngɛ hlae nɛ o gbe ami hu kaa bɔ nɛ o gbe Mizraim no ɔ hiɛ ɔ lo?’<verse eid="ACT 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 7:29" />Benɛ Mose nu munyu nɛ ɔ, e tsui po nɛ e tu fo kɛ je Mizraim nɛ e ya to nubwɔ ngɛ Midian zugba a nɔ; nɛ e ya fɔ binyumuwi enyɔ ngɛ lejɛ ɔ.<verse eid="ACT 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 7:30" />Jeha nyingmi eywiɛ se ɔ, benɛ Mose ngɛ nga nɔ ngɛ Sinai Yoku ɔ he ɔ, Mawu Bɔfo ba je e he kpo kɛ tsɔɔ lɛ kɛ gu la nɛ ngɛ tsoe ngɛ pu kpɔ ko mi ɔ mi. <verse eid="ACT 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 7:31" />Benɛ Mose na la a, e pee lɛ nyakpɛ. Se benɛ e wo fo ke e yaa nɛ e ya hyɛ ɔ, kɛkɛ nɛ Nutsɔ ɔ tsɛ lɛ nɛ e de lɛ ke, <verse eid="ACT 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 7:32" />‘Imi ji o nɛmɛ nɛ ji Abraham kɛ Isak kɛ Yakob a Mawu ɔ nɛ.’ Mose ye gbeye nɛ e nyɛ we lejɛ ɔ nɛ e hyɛ hu.<verse eid="ACT 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 7:33" />Nɛ Nutsɔ ɔ de lɛ ke, ‘Mo je tokota amɛ ngɛ o nane, ejakaa zugba klɔuklɔu nɔ nɛ o daa si ngɛ ɔ nɛ. <verse eid="ACT 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 7:34" />I na amanehlu nɛ ye nimli ɔmɛ ngɛ nae ngɛ Mizraim, nɛ i nu a ngmlaa kpami ɔmɛ hulɔ, nɛ i ba nɛ ma ba je mɛ. Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, ba nɛ ma tsɔ mo Mizraim.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 7:35" />Nɛ Mawu tsɔ Mose, nɔ nɛ e we bi ɔmɛ kua lɛ nɛ a bi lɛ ke, ‘Mɛnɔ pee mo wa nɔ́ hyɛlɔ kɛ kojolɔ lo?’ Lɛ nɔuu nɛ a tsɔ kaa e ya pee a nɔ hyɛlɔ kɛ a kpɔlɔ. <verse eid="ACT 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 7:36" />Nɛ kɛ gu nyakpɛ okadihi a nɔ ɔ, e kpaka mɛ kɛ je Mizraim kɛ po Wo Tsutsu ɔ nɛ e kɛ mɛ nyɛɛ nga a nɔ jeha nyingmi eywiɛ sɔuu.<verse eid="ACT 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 7:37" />Mose nitsɛ de Israel bi ɔmɛ ke, ‘Mawu ma tle Gbalɔ ko si kɛ ha nyɛ kaa ami nɔuu kɛ je nyɛ nyɛmi ɔmɛ a kpɛti.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 7:38" />Nɛ e bami ja a pɛpɛɛpɛ, ejakaa Mose ji nɔ nɛ da Israel bi ɔmɛ kɛ Mawu Bɔfo ɔ kpɛti ngɛ nga a nɔ, nɛ e he Mawu Mlaa nɛ ji Wami Munyu ɔ kɛ je Sinai Yoku ɔ nɔ kɛ ba ha mɛ.<verse eid="ACT 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 7:39" />Se wa tsɛ ɔmɛ kua Mose nɛ a hla kaa a maa kpale a se kɛ ho Mizraim ya ekohu. <verse eid="ACT 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 7:40" />Nɛ a de Aaron ke, ‘Moo pee amagahi kɛ ha wɔ nɛ a kpaka wɔ kɛ kpale kɛ ya Mizraim, ejakaa wa li nɔ́ nɛ ya ngɛ Mose nɛ kpaka wɔ kɛ je Mizraim ɔ pee.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 7:41" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, a puɛ na bi amaga nɛ a sã bɔ kɛ ha lɛ nɛ a bua jɔ a he.<verse eid="ACT 7:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 7:42" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Mawu ngmɛɛ a he nɛ e ha nɛ a bɔni pu kɛ nyɔhiɔ kɛ dodoehi jami kaa bɔ nɛ Mawu bi ngɛ Gbalɔ Amos womi ɔ mi ke, ‘Nyɛ Israel bi, anɛ ami nɛ nyɛ ngɛ bɔ sae ha ngɛ nga a nɔ jeha nyingmi eywiɛ ɔ lo? <verse eid="ACT 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 7:43" />Dabi, Molok kɛ Remfan dodoe wɔ ɔmɛ nɛ nyɛ ngɛ jae. Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, i ma ha nɛ nyɛ ya ye nyɔguɛ ngɛ Babilon se lokoo.’<verse eid="ACT 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 7:44" />Wa nɛ ɔmɛ tloo Bo Tsu kɛ nyɛɛ nga a nɔ. E ji tsu nɛ a pee kaa nɔ́ nɛ Bɔfo ɔ kɛ tsɔɔ Mose ɔ, nɛ e mi nɛ a to tɛhi nɛ a ngma Kita Nyɔngma a ngɛ nɔ ɔ ngɛ. <verse eid="ACT 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 7:45" />Jeha komɛ a se benɛ Yosua nyɛɛ a hɛ mi nɛ a kɛ ma je li ɔmɛ hwu ta ngɛ zugba nɛ Mawu ha mɛ ɔ nɔ ɔ, kikɛmɛ a Bo Tsu nɛ ɔ nɔuu nɛ a hɛɛ be fɛɛ be hluu kɛ ba su Matsɛ David yi nɔ.<verse eid="ACT 7:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 7:46" />Nɛ David hɛ mi ba nyami ngɛ Mawu hɛ mi nɛ Mawu jɔɔ lɛ babauu. E bi Mawu ke e ha lɛ he blɔ nɛ e ma Sɔlemi Tsu nitsɛ kɛ ha lɛ Yakob Mawu ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 7:47" />Se Salomo mohu ji nɔ nɛ ma Sɔlemi Tsu ɔ ngɔ ha Mawu. <verse eid="ACT 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 7:48" />Se kɛ ɔ, Mawu hí Sɔlemi Tsuhi nɛ a ma kɛ nine ɔ mi, kaa bɔ nɛ e de kɛ gu gbali ɔmɛ a nɔ ke, <verse eid="ACT 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 7:49" />‘Ye Matsɛ sɛ ji hiɔwe, nɛ ye nane si sɛ ji zugba a. Mɛni tsu kulaa nɛ nyɛ ma nyɛ ma kɛ ha mi? Anɛ ma hwɔ jamɛ a tsu ɔ mi lo? <verse eid="ACT 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 7:50" />Anɛ pi imi nɛ i bɔ hiɔwe kɛ zugba a lo?’<verse eid="ACT 7:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 7:51" />Oo, nyɛ wɔ jali nɛ nyɛ kuɛ mi ti! Anɛ nyɛ ma nyɛ ku Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ nya daa kaa bɔ nɛ nyɛ tsɛ ɔmɛ pee ɔ lo? <verse eid="ACT 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 7:52" />Gbali ɔmɛ a ti mɛnɔ nɛ nyɛ nɛ ɔmɛ wɛ lɛ yi mi? A gbe gbali ɔmɛ tete nɛ wo Dalɔ nɛ ji Yiwamihelɔ ɔ bami ɔ he si, nɔ nɛ nyɛ tsɔɔ e se blɔ nɛ nyɛ gbe lɛ ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="ACT 7:53" />Nɛ nyɛ je blɔ kpata Mawu mlaa amɛ nɛ bɔfo ɔmɛ kɛ ha nyɛ ɔ a hɛ mi.”<verse eid="ACT 7:53" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Stefano gbenɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="ACT 7:54" />Benɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ a nikɔtɔma amɛ nu munyu nɛ ɔmɛ nɛ Stefano tu mɛ ɔ, a mi mi fu nɛ a kpe a lungu nya. <verse eid="ACT 7:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="ACT 7:55" />Se Mumi Klɔuklɔu hyi Stefano tɔ nɛ e hyɛ hiɔwe gaa, nɛ e na Mawu anunyami ɔ kɛ Yesu nɛ daa si ngɛ Mawu hiɔ nɔ. <verse eid="ACT 7:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="ACT 7:56" />Kɛkɛ nɛ e de mɛ ke, “I na kaa hiɔwe nya bli nɛ Yesu nɛ ji Nɔmlɔ Bi ɔ daa si ngɛ Mawu hiɔ nɔ!”<verse eid="ACT 7:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="ACT 7:57" />Se a kpa ngmlaa wawɛɛ, nɛ a tsi a tuehi nɛ a ko nu nɔ́ nɛ Stefano ngɛ dee ɔ, nɛ a bu e nɔ si kake too; <verse eid="ACT 7:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="ACT 7:58" />nɛ a sa lɛ si kɛ je kpo ngɛ ma a mi nɛ a ya fiaa lɛ tɛ; nɛ nɔ gbeli ɔmɛ je a yi nɔ tade ɔmɛ ngɛ a he nɛ a ngɔ mɛ kɛ ba pue niheyo ko nɛ a tsɛɛ lɛ ke Saulo ɔ nane nya.<verse eid="ACT 7:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="ACT 7:59" />Se benɛ a ngɛ Stefano gbenɔ tɛ ɔmɛ fiae ɔ, e sɔle nɛ e de ke, “Nutsɔ Yesu, mo he ye mumi ɔ.” <verse eid="ACT 7:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="ACT 7:60" />Kɛkɛ nɛ e kpla si nɛ e kpa ngmlaa wawɛɛ ke, “Nutsɔ, mo ko bu yayami nɛ ɔ kɛ ha mɛ!” Kɛkɛ nɛ e ma e nya.<verse eid="ACT 7:60" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ACT 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 8:1" />Stefano gbenɔ ngɔ Saulo nya saminya. Nɛ kɛ je jamɛ a ligbi ɔ nɔuu nɔ ɔ, a bɔni asafo ɔ nɛ ngɛ Yerusalem ɔ yi mi wami. Enɛ ɔ ha nɛ mɛ tsuo a gbɛ fia ngɛ Yudea kɛ Samaria nɛ e piɛ bɔfo ɔmɛ pɛ. <verse eid="ACT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 8:2" />Mawu gbeye yeli komɛ kɛ aywilɛho ba wo Stefano gbogboe ɔ nɛ a ya pu. <verse eid="ACT 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 8:3" />Se Saulo hɛ tsu kɛ wo asafo ɔ he nɛ e ma kpata e hɛ mi. E yaa wehi a mi nɛ e ya saa nyumuhi kɛ yihi tsuo kɛ ya woɔ tsu.<verse eid="ACT 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Filipo ho Samaria ya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 8:4" />Se mohu asafo ɔ nɛ gbɛ fia a ya fiɛ Yesu he Manye Munyu ɔ ngɛ he fɛɛ he. <verse eid="ACT 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 8:5" />A ti nɔ kake nɛ a tsɛɛ lɛ ke Filipo ɔ je kɛ ho Samaria ma a mi ya nɛ e ya fiɛ Yesu he sane ɔ ngɛ lejɛ ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 8:6" />Nɛ nihi babauu bu lɛ tue saminya ngɛ nyakpɛ níhi nɛ e pee ɔ he. <verse eid="ACT 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 8:7" />E hia mumi yayamihi kɛ je nihi a mi kɛ ngmlaa, nɛ e tsa nihi nɛ ku pue si kɛ akpaketsɛhi, <verse eid="ACT 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 8:8" />nɛ lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, bua jɔmi ba jamɛ a ma a mi.<verse eid="ACT 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 8:9" />Wɔtsɛ ko ngɛ Samaria ma a mi nɛ a tsɛɛ lɛ ke Simon. Kɛ je blema a, e woɔ e he nɔ, <verse eid="ACT 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 8:10" />nɛ a buu lɛ kaa lɛ ji Yiwamihelɔ ɔ aloo nɔ ko nɛ hɛɛ Mawu he wami agbo ko, <verse eid="ACT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 8:11" />ejakaa e peeɔ nyakpɛ níhi. <verse eid="ACT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 8:12" />Se benɛ a nu Filipo fiɛmi ɔ kaa Yesu ji Yiwamihelɔ ɔ, nɛ a nu Mawu Matsɛyemi ɔ he Manye Munyu ɔ, a he ye nɛ a ti nyumuhi kɛ yihi fuu ha a baptisi mɛ. <verse eid="ACT 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 8:13" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Simon hu he ye nɛ a baptisi lɛ nɛ e bɔni Filipo se nyɛɛmi, nɛ e hɛ mi pee lɛ yaa ngɛ nyakpɛ nihi nɛ e ngɛ pee ɔmɛ a he.<verse eid="ACT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 8:14" />Benɛ Yerusalem bɔfo ɔmɛ nu kaa Samaria bi ɔmɛ he Mawu Munyu ɔ ye ɔ, a tsɔ Petro kɛ Yohane a ngɔ. <verse eid="ACT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 8:15" />Benɛ a ya su Samaria nɔuu pɛ nɛ a bɔni sɔlemi ha mɛ bɔ nɛ pee nɛ a na Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ; <verse eid="ACT 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 8:16" />ejakaa kɛ ba si jamɛ a be ɔ mi ɔ, e bɛ a ti nɔ ko nɔ lolo. Ejakaa Nutsɔ Yesu biɛ mi kɛkɛ nɛ a baptisi mɛ ngɛ. <verse eid="ACT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 8:17" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Petro kɛ Yohane kɛ nine pue a nɔ nɛ a na Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ.<verse eid="ACT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 8:18" />Se benɛ Simon na kaa Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ ba nihi a nɔ benɛ Petro kɛ Yohane wo nine kɛkɛ kɛ pue a nɔ ɔ, e je sika kpo ke e ma he he wami ɔ.<verse eid="ACT 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 8:19" />Nɛ e de mɛ ke, “Nyɛ ha ami hu kikɛmɛ a he wami nɛ ɔ eko konɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ i kɛ ye nine ma pue e nɔ ɔ, e na Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ.”<verse eid="ACT 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 8:20" />Se Petro de lɛ ke, “O kɛ o sika a kulaa hɛ mi ma kpata, ejakaa o susu kaa sika nɛ a kɛ heɔ Mawu nɔ́ke nɔ ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 8:21" />O be he blɔ ko ngɛ kikɛmɛ a ni tsumi nɛ ɔ mi, ejakaa o tsui mi tsɔ we ngɛ Mawu hɛ mi. <verse eid="ACT 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 8:22" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, moo kpale ngɛ o yayami ɔmɛ a se, nɛ o kpa Mawu pɛɛ kaa alinɔ, e kɛ o yayami ɔmɛ maa ke mo lo. <verse eid="ACT 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 8:23" />Ejakaa i na hɛ kɔ kɛ yayami ngɛ o tsui mi.”<verse eid="ACT 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 8:24" />Simon tsui po nɛ e kpa mɛ pɛɛ nɛ e de ke, “Nyɛɛ sɔle nɛ nyɛ kpa Mawu pɛɛ kɛ ha mi konɛ gbeye nɔ́ nɛ ɔmɛ nɛ nyɛ de ɔ nɛ a ko ba ye nɔ.”<verse eid="ACT 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 8:25" />Benɛ Petro kɛ Yohane ye odase nɛ ɔmɛ, nɛ a fiɛ Manye Munyu ɔ ngɛ Samaria a, a kpale a se nɛ a ya fiɛ ngɛ Samaria kɔpe ɔmɛ nɛ ngɛ blɔ he ɔ tsuo a mi loko ji a ba su Yerusalem ekohu.<verse eid="ACT 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 8:26" />Nɛ Mawu bɔfo ko ba de Filipo lɛɛ ke, “Mo sa o he nɛ o ya gbɛjegbɛ nɛ je Yerusalem kɛ yaa Gaza nga a nɔ ɔ, nɛ o ma ya su lejɛ ɔ kaa piani be.” <verse eid="ACT 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 8:27" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Filipo pue nɔ kɛ ho nɛ e ya na Etiopia bi a manye Kandake sɔmɔlɔ nɔkɔtɔma nɛ a ta lɛ ɔ, nɛ lɛ ji e sika nɔ hyɛlɔ nɛ a buu lɛ ɔ. E ya ja Mawu ngɛ Yerusalem Sɔlemi We ɔ, <verse eid="ACT 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 8:28" />nɛ e kpale e se nɛ e ngɛ trɔke mi kɛ yaa. Nɛ benɛ e yaa a, e nu nɛ e ngɛ Gbalɔ Yesaia womi ɔ kanee kɛ ngmlaa.<verse eid="ACT 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 8:29" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ de Filipo ke, “Yaa nɛ o ya nyɛɛ trɔke ɔ kasa nya.”<verse eid="ACT 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 8:30" />Benɛ Filipo ya su trɔke ɔ kasa nya nɛ e nu kaa Gbalɔ Yesaia womi ɔ nɛ e ngɛ kanee ɔ, e bi lɛ ke, “Anɛ o nu nɔ́ nɛ o ngɛ kanee ɔ sisi lo?”<verse eid="ACT 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 8:31" />Nɛ Etiopia no ɔ ha lɛ heto ke, “Dabi! I nui sisi ja nɔ ko tsɔɔ mi sisi.” Kɛkɛ nɛ e kpa Filipo pɛɛ nɛ e ba hi e kasa nya ngɛ trɔke ɔ mi.<verse eid="ACT 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 8:32" />Nɛ Ngmami Klɔuklɔu ɔ he nɛ e ngɛ kanee ɔ ji: “A kpaka lɛ kɛ ho kaa jijɔ nɛ a ya gbe lɛ, nɛ e kpɛ we e kuɛ si se e pee kpoo kaa bɔ nɛ jijɔ bi peeɔ kpoo ke a ngɛ e he bwɔmi nɔ sae ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 8:33" />Nɛ ngɛ e he si bami he je ɔ, a yi e sane ɔ ngɛ dami nya. Se mɛnɔ ma nyɛ jamɛ a yi nɔ bi ɔmɛ a yayami nɛ a pee ɔ ma de? Ejakaa a ngɔ e wami ɔ kɛ je zugba nɛ ɔ nɔ.”<verse eid="ACT 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 8:34" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Etiopia no ɔ bi Filipo kɛ he si bami ke, “Anɛ Gbalɔ Yesaia nitsɛ e he munyu nɛ e ngɛ tue aloo nɔ kpa ko?”<verse eid="ACT 8:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 8:35" />Nɛ Filipo je sisi kɛ Ngmami Klɔuklɔu ɔ he nɛ e kane ɔ nɔuu kɛ he kpa komɛ, nɛ e de lɛ Yesu he sane.<verse eid="ACT 8:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 8:36" />Nɛ benɛ a ma hluu ɔ, a ba su nyu ko he, nɛ Etiopia no ɔ bi Filipo ke, “O nɛ nyu. Mɛni ngɛ ye baptisimi nya tsie?”<verse eid="ACT 8:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 8:37" />Filipo he nɔ nɛ e de lɛ ke, “Ma nyɛ ma baptisi mo ke o he ye kɛ o tsui kulaa.” Nɛ e ha Filipo heto ke, “I he ye kaa Yesu Kristo ji Mawu Bi ɔ nɛ.”<verse eid="ACT 8:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 8:38" />E ha nɛ trɔke ɔ da si nɛ a sɛ nyu ɔ mi, nɛ Filipo ya baptisi lɛ. <verse eid="ACT 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 8:39" />E ba mi kaa benɛ a je kpo ngɛ nyu ɔ mi ɔ, Nutsɔ ɔ Mumi ɔ ba sa Filipo kɛ je nɛ e nɛ lɛ hu. Se e pue nɔ kɛ ho kɛ bua jɔmi. <verse eid="ACT 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 8:40" />Se Filipo ya je Azoto nɛ e fiɛ Manye Munyu ɔ ngɛ lejɛ ɔ ma amɛ a mi kɛ ba su Kaisarea.<verse eid="ACT 8:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ACT 9" />
  <para style="s1">Saulo nyakpɛ tsakemi ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 9:1" />Saulo fia pɛɛ si kaa e ma kpata Kristo se nyɛɛli ɔmɛ tsuo a hɛ mi. Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, e ho Osɔfo Nɔkɔtɔma a ngɔ ya ngɛ Yerusalem; <verse eid="ACT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 9:2" />nɛ e ya bi nɛ e ha lɛ womi nɛ e ma kɛ ya Damasko kpe he ɔmɛ nɛ e kɛ ya nuu asafo mi bi ɔmɛ, nyumuhi jio, yihi jio, nɛ e wo mɛ ga kɛ ba Yerusalem.<verse eid="ACT 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 9:3" />Se benɛ Saulo yaa ngɛ blɔ ɔ nɔ nɛ e piɛ bɔɔ nɛ e maa su Damasko ɔ, la ko kpɛ si kake too kɛ je hiɔwe kɛ ba bɔle lɛ. <verse eid="ACT 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 9:4" />E nɔ si; nɛ e nu gbi ko nɛ ngɛ lɛ dee ke, “Saulo! Saulo! Mɛni he je nɛ o ngɛ mi yi mi wae ɔ?”<verse eid="ACT 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 9:5" />Nɛ Saulo bi ke, “Mo mɛnɔ i, Nutsɔ?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:5">Nɛ gbi ɔ ha lɛ heto ke, “Imi Yesu, nɔ nɛ o ngɛ lɛ yi mi wae ɔ i. <verse eid="ACT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 9:6" />Moo te si nɛ o ho ma a mi ya nɛ i ma tsɔɔ mo nɔ́ nɛ o maa pee.”<verse eid="ACT 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 9:7" />Nihi nɛ a kɛ Saulo nyɛɛ ɔ plɛ mumuihi, nɛ a pee yaa, ejakaa a ngɛ gbi ɔ nue mohu se a nɛ nɔ ko. <verse eid="ACT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 9:8" />Nɛ e ba mi kaa benɛ Saulo te si ɔ, e na kaa e hɛ yu. A kpaka lɛ kɛ ho Damasko ya. <verse eid="ACT 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 9:9" />E ya hi lejɛ ɔ ligbi etɛ sɔuu nɛ e hɛ yu. E yi ni nɛ e nui nyu hulɔ.<verse eid="ACT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 9:10" />Jamɛ a be ɔ mi ɔ, kaselɔ ko hi Damasko nɛ a tsɛɛ lɛ ke Anania. Nutsɔ ɔ tsɛ lɛ ngɛ ni nami mi ke,<verse eid="ACT 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 9:11" />“Anania!” Nɛ e he nɔ ke, “Nutsɔ, o nɛ mi.” Nɛ Nutsɔ ɔ de lɛ ke, “Yaa he ko nɛ a tsɛɛ ke Gbɛjegbɛ Tlɔmɔɔ ɔ nɛ o ya bi Tarso nyumu ko nɛ a tsɛɛ lɛ ke Saulo ɔ si ngɛ Yuda we ɔ mi. E ngɛ sɔlee kɛ ngɛ mi tsɛe amlɔ nɛ ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 9:12" />I ha nɛ e na ngɛ ni nami mi kaa nyumu ko nɛ a tsɛɛ lɛ ke Anania a ma e ngɔ nɛ e kɛ e nine ba ta e he bɔ nɛ pee nɛ e hɛ ngmɛ nɛ bli ekohu.”<verse eid="ACT 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 9:13" />Se Anania he nɔ nɛ e de ke, “Nutsɔ, i nu awi nɛ nyumu nɛ ɔ ye kaseli ɔmɛ nɛ ngɛ Yerusalem ɔ he. <verse eid="ACT 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 9:14" />Nɛ wa nu kaa osɔfo nikɔtɔma amɛ ha lɛ he wami nɛ e ma kɛ ya nuu kaseli ɔmɛ ngɛ Damasko.”<verse eid="ACT 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 9:15" />Se Nutsɔ ɔ de lɛ ke, “Yaa nɛ o ya pee bɔ nɛ i de mo ɔ. Ejakaa Saulo ji ye tsɔlɔ nɛ i hla nɛ e ma wo ye munyu ɔ kɛ ya ha ma je li kɛ matsɛmɛ kɛ Israel bi ɔmɛ hu. <verse eid="ACT 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 9:16" />Nɛ ma tsɔɔ lɛ amanehlu abɔ nɛ e maa na ngɛ ye biɛ mi.”<verse eid="ACT 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 9:17" />Anania pue nɔ kɛ ho nɛ e ya na Saulo nɛ e kɛ e nine pue e nɔ, nɛ e de lɛ ke, “Anyɛmi Paulo, Nutsɔ Yesu, nɔ nɛ je e he si kɛ tsɔɔ mo ngɛ blɔ ɔ nɔ ɔ, e tsɔ mi o ngɔ bɔ nɛ pee nɛ o na Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ nɛ o hɛ ngmɛ ɔ nɛ bli nɛ o hyɛ nɔ́ ekohu.”<verse eid="ACT 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 9:18" />Kɛkɛ nɛ ni komɛ kaa lo totohi je e hɛ ngmɛ ɔmɛ a nɔ pue si amlɔ ɔ nɔuu nɛ e bɔni nɔ́ hyɛmi, nɛ a baptisi lɛ. <verse eid="ACT 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 9:19" />E ye ni, nɛ e na he wami nɛ e kɛ Damasko kaseli ɔmɛ hi si be saii, <verse eid="ACT 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 9:20" />nɛ e bɔni Yesu Manye Munyu ɔ fiɛmi amlɔ ɔ nɔuu ngɛ kpe he ɔmɛ kaa anɔkuale mi ɔ, Yesu ji Mawu Bi ɔ nɛ.<verse eid="ACT 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 9:21" />Nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ nu kaa Paulo ngɛ Manye Munyu ɔ fiɛe ɔ, a nya kpɛ a he nɛ a bi ke, “Anɛ tsa pi nyumu nɛ ɔ nɔuu nɛ wa kaseli ɔmɛ yi mi ngɛ Yerusalem ɔ lo? A ha nɛ wa le kaa e ba hiɛmɛ nɛ ɔ nɛ e ba nu kaseli ɔmɛ nɛ e wo mɛ ga kɛ ya ha osɔfo nikɔtɔma amɛ.”<verse eid="ACT 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 9:22" />Se mohu Paulo na he wami agbo ko kɛ ngɛ Manye Munyu ɔ fiɛe, nɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ nɛ ngɛ Damasko ɔ a nya kpɛ a he, ejakaa e ngɛ mɛ dee paa ke Yesu ji Yiwamihelɔ ɔ nɛ. <verse eid="ACT 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 9:23" />E ba mi kaa Yuda bi ɔmɛ a nikɔtɔma amɛ muɔ a yi mi kpɔ kaa a maa gbe lɛ. <verse eid="ACT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 9:24" />Se Paulo na le kaa a ngɛ ma a agbo ɔmɛ a nya bue nyɔ kɛ pia nɛ a maa gbe lɛ. <verse eid="ACT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 9:25" />Nɛ kaseli ɔmɛ ekomɛ wo lɛ kɛ wo kusii mi nyɔ mi kpɛti nɛ a kɛ lɛ gu gbogbo nɔ kɛ je kpo ngɛ ma a mi.<verse eid="ACT 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 9:26" />E ba mi kaa benɛ Paulo ya su Yerusalem ɔ, e bɔ mɔde kaa e maa piɛ kaseli ɔmɛ a he, se a ngɛ lɛ gbeye yee, ejakaa a he we lɛ yi kaa kaselɔ ji lɛ. <verse eid="ACT 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 9:27" />Se Barnaba nu e kɔni si kɛ ba bɔfo ɔmɛ a ngɔ nɛ e bɔ mɛ bɔ nɛ Nutsɔ ɔ je e he kpo kɛ tsɔɔ Paulo ngɛ Damasko blɔ ɔ nɔ kɛ nɔ nɛ Nutsɔ ɔ de lɛ, kɛ bɔ nɛ e ngɛ fiɛe ngɛ Damasko ngɛ Yesu biɛ mi ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 9:28" />Enɛ ɔ ha nɛ a he lɛ kɛ wo a kpɛti, <verse eid="ACT 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 9:29" />nɛ e fiɛ Munyu ɔ paa ngɛ Nutsɔ ɔ biɛ mi kɛ he wami. Se Hela bi komɛ nɛ e kɛ mɛ sa nya a, a pee a juɛmi kaa a maa gbe lɛ. <verse eid="ACT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 9:30" />Benɛ kaseli ɔmɛ nu awi nɛ a ngɛ hlae nɛ a ye lɛ ɔ he ɔ, a wo lɛ kɛ ho Kaisarea ya, nɛ a ya wo lɛ blɔ kɛ ho e ma mi ya ngɛ Tarso.<verse eid="ACT 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 9:31" />Jehanɛ ɔ, asafohi nɛ ngɛ Yudea kɛ Galilea kɛ Samaria a, a na tue mi jɔmi nɛ a nane nu si nɛ a he ba hiɛ fuu. A hi si ngɛ Mawu gbeye yemi mi, nɛ a na bua jɔmi ngɛ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ mi.<verse eid="ACT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyakpɛ okadihi enyɔ komɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 9:32" />E ba mi kaa benɛ Petro ngɛ ni klɔuklɔu ɔmɛ slaae ngɛ mahi a nɔ ɔ, e ba su Lida, <verse eid="ACT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 9:33" />nɛ e na nyumu ko nɛ a tsɛɛ lɛ ke Ainea nɛ e ku pue si, nɛ e nyɛɛ we jeha kpaanyɔ sɔuu. <verse eid="ACT 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 9:34" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Petro de lɛ ke, “Ainea, Yesu Kristo tsa mo! Tee si nɛ o dla o sa a!” Nɛ e te si amlɔ ɔ nɔuu. <verse eid="ACT 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 9:35" />Enɛ ɔ ha nɛ Lida kɛ Saron bi tsuo plɛ Kristo se nyɛɛli.<verse eid="ACT 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 9:36" />Se yo kaselɔ ko ngɛ Yopa nɛ a tsɛɛ lɛ ke Tabita nɛ e peeɔ kpakpa kɛ haa nihi, titli ɔ, ohiafohi. <verse eid="ACT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 9:37" />Nɛ e ba mi jamɛ a be ɔ mi kaa e wo hiɔ nɛ e gbo, nɛ a wluɔ e gbogboe ɔ si ngɛ hiɔwe tsu ko mi. <verse eid="ACT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 9:38" />Se benɛ a nu kaa Petro ngɛ Lida ngɛ a kasa nya a, a tsɔ nyumuhi enyɔ nɛ a ya kpa lɛ pɛɛ nɛ e kɛ mɛ nɛ ba Yopa nɔuu. <verse eid="ACT 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 9:39" />E ye a gbi ɔ nɔ nɛ e kɛ tsɔli ɔmɛ pue nɔ kɛ ba Yopa. Nɔuu nɛ a nyɛɛ e hɛ mi kɛ ho hiɔwe tsu mi he nɛ a wluɔ gbogboe ɔ si ngɛ ɔ ya. Tsu ɔ mi hyi kɛ yalɔyihi nɛ ngɛ ya foe. A ngɛ tadehi nɛ Tabita kpɛ ha mɛ ɔ tsɔɔe. <verse eid="ACT 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 9:40" />Se Petro fie mɛ tsuo ngɛ tsu ɔ mi nɛ e kpla si nɛ e sɔle. Kɛkɛ nɛ e sa kɛ su gbogboe ɔ he nɛ e de ke, “Tabita tee si!” Amlɔ ɔ nɔuu nɛ e bli e hɛ ngmɛ, nɛ benɛ e na Petro ɔ, e te si nɛ e hi si. <verse eid="ACT 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 9:41" />Petro wo e nɔ nɛ e tsɛ kaseli ɔmɛ kɛ yalɔyi ɔmɛ, nɛ e ngɔ Tabita kɛ wo a dɛ.<verse eid="ACT 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 9:42" />Sane nɛ ɔ gbɛ fia ngɛ Yopa ma a mi tsuo nɛ nihi fuu he Nutsɔ ɔ nɔ ye. <verse eid="ACT 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 9:43" />Nɛ Petro hi Simon, nɔ nɛ woɔ lohwe he womi tsopa a ngɔ be saii ngɛ Yopa.<verse eid="ACT 9:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ACT 10" />
  <para style="s1">Bɔfo je e he kpo kɛ tsɔɔ Kornelio</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 10:1" />Roma soja nɔkɔtɔma ko hi Kaisarea nɛ a tsɛɛ lɛ ke Kornelio; nɛ le ji Italia soja amɛ a asafoatsɛ. <verse eid="ACT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 10:2" />Kornelio jaa Mawu nɛ e kɛ e we ɔ tsuo yee Mawu gbeye. E mi mi jɔ nɛ e naa ohiafohi mɔbɔ, nɛ e sɔleɔ daa. <verse eid="ACT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 10:3" />Ligbi ko piani ngmlɛ etɛ mi ɔ, Kornelio na ngɛ nina mi paa kaa Mawu bɔfo ko nyɛɛ kɛ ma e ngɔ. Kɛkɛ nɛ e tsɛ lɛ ke, “Kornelio!”<verse eid="ACT 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 10:4" />Kornelio hyɛ bɔfo ɔ too nɛ e ye gbeye nɛ e bi lɛ ke, “Nutsɔ, mɛni o ngɛ hlae kaa ma pee ha mo?” Bɔfo ɔ de lɛ ke, “Mawu nu o sɔlemi ɔmɛ, nɛ e na kpakpa amɛ nɛ o ngɛ pee ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 10:5" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, moo tsɔ kɛ ya Yopa nɛ a ya tsɛ nyumu ko nɛ a tsɛɛ lɛ Simon Petro ɔ kɛ ba. <verse eid="ACT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 10:6" />E ya to Simon lohwe he womi tsopa wolɔ ɔ we ɔ mi ngɛ wo ɔ nya. Ke e ba a, e ma ba tsɔɔ mo nɔ́ nɛ sa nɛ o pee.”<verse eid="ACT 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 10:7" />Bɔfo ɔ kuɛ se mi laa we nɛ Kornelio tsɛ e sɔmɔli enyɔ kɛ e he buli ɔmɛ a ti nɔ kake nɛ yee Mawu gbeye ɔ; <verse eid="ACT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 10:8" />nɛ e bɔ mɛ nɔ́ nɛ e na a, nɛ e tsɔ mɛ Yopa.<verse eid="ACT 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 10:9" />E nɔ jena benɛ e piɛ bɔɔ nɛ tsɔli ɔmɛ maa su Yopa ma a mi ɔ, Petro ho e tsu yi mi ya nɛ e ya sɔle. Jamɛ a be ɔ mi ɔ, a fia piani ngmlɛ nyɔngma kɛ enyɔ. <verse eid="ACT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 10:10" />Hwɔ bɔni lɛ yemi, se a ngɛ niye ni hooe. Kɛkɛ ɔ, benɛ e piɛ bɔɔ nɛ a maa gbe niye ni ɔ nya a Petro pee kaa nɔ ko nɛ nɔ́ nɔ e nɔ. <verse eid="ACT 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 10:11" />Nɛ e na nɛ hiɔwe nya bli, nɛ a pɛtɛ nɔ́ ko nɛ ngɛ kaa bo ngua ko e kɔ nya eywiɛ ɔmɛ a he kɛ ma zugba. <verse eid="ACT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 10:12" />Nɛ e na je mi lohwehi slɔɔtohi, sinɔhi kɛ lohwe pɛlitsɛhi ngɛ jamɛ a bo ɔ mi. <verse eid="ACT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 10:13" />Kɛkɛ nɛ gbi ko de lɛ ke, “Petro, yaa gbe lohwe nɛ ɔmɛ a ti nɔ́ nɛ o suɔ nɛ o ye.”<verse eid="ACT 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 10:14" />Se Petro ha gbi ɔ heto ke, “Dabi, Nutsɔ, i yi lohwe nɛ ɔmɛ a ti eko hyɛ, ejakaa wɔ Yuda bi ɔmɛ wa mlaa ngmɛ blɔ kaa waa ye.”<verse eid="ACT 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 10:15" />Nɛ gbi ɔ de lɛ ekohu ke, “Mo ko je Mawu nguane, ejakaa ke e ke nɔ ko he tsɔ ɔ, e he tsɔ kɛ pi si.”<verse eid="ACT 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 10:16" />A je nina nɛ ɔ ngɔ tsɔɔ lɛ si etɛ, kɛkɛ nɛ a sa bo ɔ kɛ ho hiɔwe ya ekohu. <verse eid="ACT 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 10:17" />Jehanɛ ɔ, Petro pee yaa, ejakaa e nui nɔ́ nɛ e na a kɛ nɔ́ nɛ a ngɛ lɛ tsɔɔe ɔ sisi. Benɛ e ngɛ ní nɛ ɔmɛ a he susue ɔ, Kornelio tsɔli ɔmɛ ba su agbo ɔ nya, <verse eid="ACT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 10:18" />nɛ a ngɛ e si bie.<verse eid="ACT 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 10:19" />Petro ngɛ ni nami ɔ he susue nɛ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ de lɛ ke, “Nyumuhi etɛ komɛ ngɛ mo hlae. <verse eid="ACT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 10:20" />Mo kple si nɛ o ya na mɛ, nɛ o kɛ mɛ nɛ ya, ejakaa ami ji nɔ nɛ tsɔ mɛ.”<verse eid="ACT 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 10:21" />Petro kple si kɛ ba a ngɔ nɛ e de mɛ ke, “Ami ji nɔ nɛ nyɛ ngɛ hlae ɔ nɛ, mɛni sane he je?”<verse eid="ACT 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 10:22" />Tsɔli ɔmɛ de lɛ Roma Tatsɛ Kornelio sɛ ɔ; bɔ nɛ e ji Mawu jalɔ kɛ Nɔmlɔ kpakpa nɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ buu lɛ, kɛ bɔ nɛ Mawu bɔfo je e he kpo kɛ tsɔɔ lɛ, nɛ e de lɛ ke e tsɔ kɛ ba tsɛ lɛ nɛ e ba tsɔɔ lɛ nɔ́ nɛ Mawu ngɛ hlae nɛ e pee ɔ.<verse eid="ACT 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Petro ya slaa Kornelio</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 10:23" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Petro tsɛ mɛ kɛ ba we ɔ mi nɛ e pee mɛ nubwɔ nɛ e ha a hwɔ. Nɛ benɛ je na a, e kɛ tsɔli ɔmɛ kɛ kaseli ɔmɛ a ti ni komɛ nɛ je Yopa a pue nɔ kɛ ho Kaisarea ya.<verse eid="ACT 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 10:24" />Benɛ a ya su Kaisarea e nɔ jena a, e na kaa Kornelio kɛ e wekuli kɛ e suɔli tsuo bua a he nya kɛ ngɛ lɛ blɔ hyɛe. <verse eid="ACT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 10:25" />E ba mi kaa benɛ Petro sɛ we ɔ mi ɔ, Kornelio kpla si ngɛ e nane nya nɛ e ma ja lɛ.<verse eid="ACT 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 10:26" />Se Petro de lɛ ke, “Tee si! Tsa pi Mawu ji mi!”<verse eid="ACT 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 10:27" />Nɛ e te si nɛ e kɛ lɛ sɛɛ ni saii loko ji a ya sɛ we ɔ mi he nɛ nihi nɛ e kpee ɔmɛ bua a he nya ngɛ ɔ.<verse eid="ACT 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 10:28" />Nɛ Petro de mɛ ke, “Nyɛ le kaa Yuda bi ɔmɛ a mlaa amɛ ngmɛ we blɔ kaa ma ba ma kpa mi no ko we mi kaa kikɛ ɔ. Se Mawu tsɔɔ mi ngɛ ni nami mi kaa ma ko tsɛ nɔ ko ke yaka nɔmlɔ, aloo ma ko de ke e he tsɔ we. <verse eid="ACT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 10:29" />Enɛ ɔ ha nɛ i nyɛɛ nyɛ tsɛmi ɔ nɔ amlɔ ɔ nɔuu kɛ ba. Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, nyɛ de mi nɔ́ he je nɛ nyɛ ba tsɛ mi ngɛ.”<verse eid="ACT 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 10:30" />Nɛ Kornelio he nɔ nɛ e ha Petro heto ke, “Mwɔnɛ ɔ ji ligbi eywiɛ nɛ i ngɛ sɔlee kaa bɔ nɛ i pɔɔ peemi daa piani ngmlɛ etɛ mi ɔ. Nyumu ko nɛ wo tade nɛ ngɛ kpɛe ba da ye hɛ mi; <verse eid="ACT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 10:31" />nɛ e de mi ke, ‘Kornelio, Mawu nu o sɔlemi ɔmɛ, nɛ e na kpakpahi nɛ o ngɛ pee ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 10:32" />Enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, moo tsɔ nɛ a ya tsɛ Simon Petro kɛ ba. E ya to nubwɔ ngɛ Simon nɔ nɛ woɔ lohwe he womi tsopa a we ɔ mi ngɛ wo ɔ nya ngɛ Yopa ma a mi. Ke e ba a, e ma ba tsɔɔ mo nɔ́ nɛ o maa pee.’ <verse eid="ACT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 10:33" />Lɔ ɔ he je nɛ i tsɔ nɛ a ba tsɛ mo nɔuu ngɛ; nɛ mo hu o ye ye gbi ɔ nɔ. Enɛ ɔ he nɛ wa bua wa he nya ngɛ Nutsɔ ɔ hɛ mi ngɛ hiɛ ɔ ngɛ konɛ waa bu sɛ nɛ e kɛ ha mo ke o ba de wɔ ɔ tue.”<verse eid="ACT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 10:34" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Petro de ke, “I na paa kaa tsa pi Yuda bi ɔmɛ kɛkɛ nɛ Mawu suɔ. <verse eid="ACT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 10:35" />Se mohu e ngɛ nihi ngɛ ma tsuaa ma nɔ, nihi nɛ jaa lɛ nɛ peeɔ kpakpa nɛ a sa e hɛ mi. <verse eid="ACT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 10:36" />I he ye kaa nyɛ nu Manye Munyu ɔ nɛ a kɛ ba ha Israel bi ɔmɛ, kaa kɛ gu Yesu Yiwamihelɔ kɛ je ɔ tsuo Nutsɔ ɔ nɔ ɔ, a ma na Mawu dɛ mi he jɔmi ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 10:37" />Yohane Baptisilɔ nɛ je kikɛmɛ a munyu nɛ ɔ fiɛmi sisi kɛ je Galilea nɛ e gbɛ kɛ fia Yudea tsuo. <verse eid="ACT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 10:38" />I he ye kaa nyɛ le bɔ nɛ Mawu ngɔ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ kɛ he wami kɛ pɔ Yesu nɛ je Nazaret ɔ nu. E kpa si nɛ e pee kpakpa. E tsa nihi nɛ mumi yayami ngɛ a mi ɔmɛ, ejakaa Mawu kɛ lɛ ngɛ.<verse eid="ACT 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 10:39" />Nɛ wɔ bɔfo ɔmɛ ji odase yeli ngɛ nɔ́ fɛɛ nɔ nɛ e pee ɔ he, ngɛ Israel zugba a nɔ kɛ Yerusalem he nɛ a sɛu lɛ ngɛ ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 10:40" />Se Mawu tle lɛ si kɛ je gbeje ligbi etɛ se nɛ e je lɛ kpo ngɔ tsɔɔ, <verse eid="ACT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 10:41" />tsa pi ma a tsuo, se mohu odase yeli komɛ nɛ Mawu hla kɛ fɔ si nɛ ji wɔ nihi nɛ waa kɛ lɛ ye ni nɛ wa nu ni benɛ e te si kɛ je gbeje ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 10:42" />Nɛ e tsɔ wɔ nɛ wa ya fiɛ Manye Munyu ɔ ngɛ he fɛɛ he, nɛ waa ye odase nɛ wa de ke, Yesu ji nɔ nɛ Mawu to kojolɔ kɛ ha nɔ tsuaa nɔ, hɛ kali kɛ ni gbogboehi tsuo. <verse eid="ACT 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 10:43" />Nɛ gbali ɔmɛ tsuo ye e he odase ke, nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ ma he e nɔ maa ye ɔ, a kɛ e he yayami maa ke lɛ ngɛ e biɛ mi.”<verse eid="ACT 10:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 10:44" />Benɛ Petro ngɛ munyu nɛ ɔmɛ tue ɔ, Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ ba nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ ngɛ lɛ tue bue ɔ nɔ. <verse eid="ACT 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 10:45" />Enɛ ɔ ha nɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ nɛ piɛ Petro he ɔ a nya kpɛ a he kaa a ngɔ Mumi Klɔuklɔu nɔ́ke nɔ ɔ kɛ ha ma je li hulɔ. <verse eid="ACT 10:45" /><verse number="46-47" style="v" sid="ACT 10:46-47" />A ji he nguane, ejakaa a nu paa nɛ a ngɛ gbi slɔɔtohi tue nɛ a ngɛ Mawu yi jee. Kɛkɛ nɛ Petro bi ke, “Anɛ nɔ́ ko maa tsi mi blɔ ke ma ko baptisi nimli nɛ ɔmɛ nɛ na Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ kaa wɔ nɔuu ɔ lo?” <verse eid="ACT 10:46-47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 10:48" />Nɛ e baptisi mɛ ngɛ Yesu Yiwamihelɔ ɔ biɛ mi. Nɛ pee se ɔ, Kornelio kpa Petro pɛɛ ke e hi a ngɔ be bɔɔ ko.<verse eid="ACT 10:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ACT 11" />
  <para style="s1">Petro bɔ asafo ɔ amaniɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 11:1" />E yi be ko nɛ bɔfo ɔmɛ ke nyɛmi ɔmɛ nɛ ngɛ Yudea a nu kaa ma je li ɔmɛ hu he Manye Munyu ɔ ye. <verse eid="ACT 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 11:2" />Se benɛ Petro kpale kɛ ba Yerusalem ɔ, Yuda bi ɔmɛ nɛ ji nyɛmi ɔmɛ kɛ lɛ sa nya.<verse eid="ACT 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 11:3" />A po e nya nɛ a de ke, “O kɛ ma je li ɔmɛ ya bɔ huɛ nɛ o kɛ mɛ ye ni tete po.”<verse eid="ACT 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 11:4" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Petro je sisi nɛ e bɔ mɛ nɔ́ nɛ ba a tsuo. E de mɛ ke, <verse eid="ACT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 11:5" />“Ligbi ko benɛ i ngɛ sɔlee ngɛ Yopa a, a je ni nami ko kpo kɛ tsɔɔ mi. I na bo ngua ko nɛ a nu e kɔ nya eywiɛ ɔmɛ kɛ je Hiɔwe kɛ kple si. <verse eid="ACT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 11:6" />Nɛ i na lohwehi slɔɔtohi ngɛ mi, sinɔhi kɛ lohwe pɛlitsɛhi. <verse eid="ACT 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 11:7" />Nɛ i nu gbi ko nɛ de mi ke, ‘Gbee a ti nɔ́ nɛ o suɔ nɛ o ye.’<verse eid="ACT 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 11:8" />Nɛ i ha heto ke, Dabi, Nutsɔ, ejakaa i yi nɔ́ ko nɛ wɔ Yuda bi ɔmɛ wa mlaa amɛ ha we wɔ blɔ kaa waa ye!<verse eid="ACT 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 11:9" />Se gbi ɔ de ekohu ke, ‘Ní ko nɛ Mawu ke a ye ɔ, mo ko de ke e hí.’<verse eid="ACT 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 11:10" />A je kikɛmɛ a ni nami nɛ ɔ kɛ tsɔɔ mi si etɛ loko ji bo ngua kɛ e mi nɔ́ fɛɛ nɔ ɔ kpale kɛ ho hiɔwe ya ekohu. <verse eid="ACT 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 11:11" />Nɛ amlɔ ɔ nɔuu ɔ, tsɔli etɛ nɛ je Kaisarea ba su we mi he nɛ i to ɔ agbo ɔ nya. <verse eid="ACT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 11:12" />Nɛ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ de mi ke i kɛ mɛ nɛ ho, nɛ ma ko di kaa ma je li ji mɛ. Nyɛmimɛ ekpa nɛ ɔmɛ piɛ ye he kɛ ho nɔ nɛ tsɔ kɛ ba tsɛ mi ɔ ngɔ ya. <verse eid="ACT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 11:13" />E bɔ wɔ bɔ nɛ bɔfo ko je e he si ha lɛ nɛ e de lɛ ke e tsɔ nɔ Yopa nɛ a ya tsɛ Simon Petro kɛ ba ha lɛ ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 11:14" />Nɛ bɔfo ɔ de lɛ ke, ‘E maa tsɔɔ mo bɔ nɛ a maa pee kɛ he o kɛ o we ɔ tsuo yi wami ha.’<verse eid="ACT 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 11:15" />Se benɛ i bɔni mɛ Manye Munyu ɔ tumi pɛ nɛ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ ba a nɔ kaa bɔ nɛ e ba wa nɔ kekle ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 11:16" />Enɛ ɔ ha nɛ i kai Nutsɔ ɔ munyu ɔ nɛ e tu ke, ‘Yohane baptisi kɛ nyu, se nyɛɛ lɛɛ a maa baptisi nyɛ kɛ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 11:17" />Nɛ akɛnɛ Mawu nitsɛ ji nɔ nɛ ha ma je li ɔmɛ nɔ́ke nɔ nɛ ɔ, kaa bɔ nɛ e ha wɔ hu benɛ wa he Nutsɔ Yesu Kristo nɔ ye ɔ, mɛnɔ ji mi nɛ e sa kaa ma sa nya ngɛ he?” <verse eid="ACT 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 11:18" />Benɛ Petro bɔ mɛ kikɛmɛ a amaniɛ nɛ ɔ, a nɛ nɔ́ ko nɛ a de hu. A je Mawu yi nɛ a de ke, “Mawu ha ma je li ɔmɛ hu tsui tsakemi he blɔ nɛ a ma kɛ he a yi wami!”<verse eid="ACT 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Antiokia Kristo se nyɛɛli ɔmɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 11:19" />Nɛ e ba mi kaa kaseli ɔmɛ nɛ gbɛ fia kɛ je Yerusalem benɛ a gbe Stefano se ɔ, ekomɛ je kɛ ho tsitsaa Foinike kɛ Kipro kɛ Antiokia ya, nɛ a ya ngɛ Manye Munyu ɔ fiɛe ha Yuda bi ɔmɛ pɛ nɛ ngɛ lejɛ ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 11:20" />Se a ti ni komɛ nɛ je Kipro kɛ Kireene kɛ ba Antiokia a fiɛ Yesu he sane ɔ kɛ tsɔɔ Hela bi ɔmɛ ekomɛ. <verse eid="ACT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 11:21" />Nɛ Nutsɔ ɔ jɔɔ a fiɛmi ɔ nɔ nɛ ma je li babauu he ye.<verse eid="ACT 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 11:22" />Benɛ Yerusalem asafo ɔ nu a he ɔ, a tsɔ Barnaba nɛ e ya ye kɛ bua Antiokia asafo he ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 11:23" />Benɛ Barnaba ya su Antiokia nɛ e na nyakpɛ ni nɛ Mawu ngɛ tsue ngɛ lejɛ ɔ, e bua jɔ e he, nɛ e wo mɛ he wami nɛ e de ke, bɔ fɛɛ bɔ nɛ e ma ji ha a, a pɛtɛ Nutsɔ ɔ he wawɛɛ. <verse eid="ACT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 11:24" />Barnaba ji nɔ ko nɛ e mi jɔ, nɛ Mumi Klɔuklɔu kɛ hemi kɛ yemi nɛ mi wa hyi lɛ tɔ. E subai kpakpa he je ɔ, nihi babauu ba sɛ Nutsɔ ɔ asafo ɔ mi.<verse eid="ACT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 11:25" />Jehanɛ ɔ Barnaba po mi kɛ ho Tarso ya nɛ e ya hla Paulo. <verse eid="ACT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 11:26" />Nɛ benɛ e ya na lɛ ɔ, e kɛ lɛ kpale kɛ ba Antiokia nɛ mɛ ni enyɔ ɔmɛ a ba hi lejɛ ɔ nɛ a ye kɛ bua asafo ɔ nɛ a tsɔɔ nihi babauu ni jeha mluku. Antiokia ji he kekle nɛ a wo kaseli ɔmɛ biɛ ngɛ ke “Kristo se nyɛɛli.”<verse eid="ACT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 11:27" />Nɛ e ba mi jamɛ a be ɔ mi kaa gbali komɛ je Yerusalem kɛ ba Antiokia; <verse eid="ACT 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 11:28" />nɛ a ti nɔ kake nɛ a tsɛɛ lɛ ke Agabo ɔ gba ngɛ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ mi nɛ e de ke hwɔ ngua ko maa ba ngɛ Israel zugba a nɔ, nɛ e ba mi ja ngɛ Klaudio yi nɔ. <verse eid="ACT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 11:29" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, kaseli ɔmɛ to nɛ a ma tsu nɔ́ ko bɔɔbɔɔ bɔ nɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ ma nyɛ, nɛ a kɛ ya ye kɛ bua Yudea asafo ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 11:30" />A tsu a yi mi tomi ɔ he ni, nɛ a ngɔ nike ni ɔmɛ kɛ mane Barnaba kɛ Paulo nɛ a kɛ ya ha asafo ɔ nikɔtɔma amɛ ngɛ Yerusalem.<verse eid="ACT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ACT 12" />
  <para style="s1">Petro tsu mi womi kɛ e jemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 12:1" />Jamɛ a be ɔ mi nɛ matsɛ Herode hu te si kɛ wo kaseli ɔmɛ, <verse eid="ACT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 12:2" />nɛ e gbe Yohane nyɛmi Yakobo. <verse eid="ACT 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 12:3" />Benɛ Herode na kaa Yakobo gbenɔ ɔ ngɔ Yuda bi ɔmɛ a nikɔtɔma amɛ a nya a, e nu Petro hu benɛ a ngɛ Hebemi jeha a yee ɔ, <verse eid="ACT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 12:4" />nɛ e wo lɛ tsu mi, nɛ e hla he buli nyɔngma kɛ ekpa sɔuu nɛ a bu e he. E pee e juɛmi kaa e ma je Petro he gbi kɛ ha Yuda bi ɔmɛ nɛ a gbe lɛ ke a ye Hebemi jeha a gbe nya a. <verse eid="ACT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 12:5" />Se asafo ɔ hɛɛ sɔlemi mi wawɛɛ kɛ a tsui kulaa nɛ Petro yi nɛ na wami ngɛ tsu ɔ mi.<verse eid="ACT 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 12:6" />Nɛ nyɔ mi nɛ ke je na loko a maa gbe lɛ ɔ, Petro hwɔ mahe nɛ kɔsɔkɔsɔ enyɔ ngɛ e nine. Buli enyɔ daa si ngɛ e he, nɛ buli nɛ piɛ ɔ hu daa si ngɛ sinya a nya. <verse eid="ACT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 12:7" />Si kake too ɔ, la ko kpɛ ngɛ tsu ɔ mi, nɛ Nutsɔ ɔ bɔfo ko ba da e kasa nya. Bɔfo ɔ gba Petro ma kɛ tsiɛ lɛ nɛ e de lɛ ke, “O he nɛ sɔ! Moo te si mla!” Kɛkɛ nɛ kɔsɔkɔsɔ ɔmɛ kplɔ ngɛ e nine. <verse eid="ACT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 12:8" />Nɛ bɔfo ɔ de lɛ ke, “Moo wo o tade kɛ o tokota amɛ.” Nɛ Petro ye bɔfo ɔ gbi nɔ. Jehanɛ ɔ bɔfo ɔ de lɛ ke, “Moo wo o hiɔwe tade ɔ nɛ o nyɛɛ ye se.”<verse eid="ACT 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 12:9" />Petro nyɛɛ bɔfo ɔ se kɛ je kpo ngɛ tsu ɔ mi. Se e li nɔ́ nɛ ngɛ nɔ yae ɔ, ejakaa e ngɛ lɛ pee kaa nlami nɛ e ngɛ nlae. <verse eid="ACT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 12:10" />A be kekle buli kɛ enyɔne ɔmɛ a he nɛ a ba su dade agbo nɛ ngɛ kɛ yaa ma a mi ɔ he, nɛ dade agbo ɔ nitsɛ bli ha mɛ nɛ a je kpo kɛ po gbɛjegbɛ kake mi. Kɛkɛ nɛ bɔfo ɔ si lɛ ngɛ lejɛ ɔ.<verse eid="ACT 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 12:11" />Jehanɛ ɔ loko Petro hɛ mi tɛ paa nɛ e de e he ke, “Kpaloko ji i na paa kaa Nutsɔ ɔ nɛ tsɔ e bɔfo nɛ e ba je mi kɛ je Herode dɛ, kɛ nɔ́ nɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ to kaa a maa pee mi ɔ mi.” <verse eid="ACT 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 12:12" />Petro susu nɔ́ nɛ ba e nɔ ɔ he saii nɛ e pue nɔ kɛ ho Yohane nɛ a tsɛɛ lɛ ke Marko hu ɔ nyɛ Maria we ɔ mi he nɛ kaseli ɔmɛ bua a he nya nɛ a ngɛ sɔlee ngɛ ɔ ya.<verse eid="ACT 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 12:13" />Benɛ e si agbo ɔ, jokuɛ yoyo ko nɛ a tsɛɛ lɛ ke Roda a ba bu tue. <verse eid="ACT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 12:14" />Nɛ benɛ yoyo ɔ na le Petro gbi mi tso ɔ, e bua jɔ e he nɛ e ma fo ya de ni ɔmɛ ngɛ we ɔ mi ke Petro daa si ngɛ agbo ɔ se. <verse eid="ACT 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 12:15" />Se a he we lɛ yi nɛ a de lɛ ke, “O ngɛ godo nue!” Se benɛ Roda ngɛ nɔ mi mae ke Petro nɛ daa si ngɛ agbo ɔ se ɔ, a de lɛ ke, “Lɛɛ e kpade i:”<verse eid="ACT 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 12:16" />Jamɛ a be ɔ mi kulaa a, Petro ngɛ agbo ɔ sie kɛ ya si benɛ a je kpo nɛ a ya bli agbo ɔ. Benɛ a na lɛ ɔ, a nya kpɛ a he. <verse eid="ACT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 12:17" />Se Petro bɛ mɛ hɛ ngmɛ ke a ko kpa ngmlaa; nɛ e bɔ mɛ bɔ nɛ Nutsɔ ɔ je lɛ kɛ je tsu ɔ mi. Nɛ e de mɛ ke, “Nyɛɛ ya nɛ nyɛ ya bɔ Yakobo kɛ nyɛmi ɔmɛ amaniɛ.” Kɛkɛ nɛ e pue nɔ kɛ ho he kpa ya.<verse eid="ACT 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 12:18" />Makɛ mi ɔ, tsu womi he ɔ pee basabasa. A li nɔ́ nɛ ba Petro nɔ. <verse eid="ACT 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 12:19" />Benɛ Herode tsɔ nɛ a ya kpaka Petro kɛ ba se a nɛ lɛ ɔ, e ha nɛ a nuu buli nyɔngma kɛ ekpa amɛ tsuo. A kojo mɛ nɛ a bu mɛ gbenɔ fɔ. Enɛ ɔ se ɔ, Petro pue nɔ kɛ ho Kaisarea ya nɛ e ya hi lejɛ ɔ be saii.<verse eid="ACT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 12:20" />Nɛ e ba mi kaa Herode na Tiro kɛ Zidon ma amɛ a he abofu wawɛɛ. Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, Tiro kɛ Zidon bi ɔmɛ pee kake kɛ tsɔ bɔfohi kɛ ba Herode ngɔ. A ya gu e womi ngmalɔ nɛ a tsɛɛ lɛ ke Blasto nɔ kɛ ba e ngɔ ngɛ Kaisarea nɛ a ba kpa lɛ pɛɛ, ejakaa e zugba a mi nɔ́ nɛ a yeɔ. <verse eid="ACT 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 12:21" />Benɛ ligbi nɛ a to kɛ ha pɛɛ kpami ɔ su ɔ, Herode wo e matsɛ yemi tade ɔ nɛ e ya hi kojomi sɛ ɔ nɔ nɛ e kɛ mɛ tu munyu. <verse eid="ACT 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 12:22" />Benɛ Herode nya nɔ si ɔ, ni ɔmɛ kpa ngmlaa nɛ a je e yi ke, “Pi nɔmlɔ adesa gbi ji nɛ ɔ, Mawu gbi i.”<verse eid="ACT 12:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 12:23" />Amlɔ ɔ nɔuu nɛ Nutsɔ ɔ bɔfo ko wo hiɔ kɛ fɔ Herod nɔ, nɛ e nɔmlɔ tso ɔ tsuo wo gɔgɔ nɛ e gbo. Ejakaa e suɔ nɛ a ja lɛ, nɛ lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, anunyami nɛ sa nɛ a kɛ ha Mawu ɔ, e kplɛɛ nɛ a kɛ ha lɛ.<verse eid="ACT 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Barnaba kɛ Paulo ngɛ Antiokia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 12:24" />Mawu Manye Munyu ɔ gbɛ fia nɛ nihi fuu ba sɛ asafo ɔ mi. <verse eid="ACT 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 12:25" />Nɛ e ba mi kaa benɛ Barnaba kɛ Paulo gbe a ni tsumi ɔ nya ngɛ Yerusalem ɔ, a kpale a se kɛ ba Antiokia ekohu, nɛ a ngɔ Yohane nɛ a tsɛɛ lɛ ke Marko ɔ kɛ piɛ a he.<verse eid="ACT 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ACT 13" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 13:1" />Gbali kɛ tsɔɔli komɛ nɛ ngɛ Antiokia asafo ɔ mi ji, Barnaba kɛ Simeon nɛ a tsɛɛ lɛ ke, “Nɔmlɔ Yumu” ɔ kɛ Lukio nɛ je Kireene kɛ Matsɛ Herode nyɛminyumu Manahen, kɛ Paulo. <verse eid="ACT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 13:2" />E ba mi kaa ligbi ko benɛ a ngɛ Mawu jae nɛ a ngɛ hwɔ hae ɔ, Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ de mɛ ke, “Nyɛ je Barnaba kɛ Paulo ngɔ ha mi kɛ ha ni tsumi titli ko.” <verse eid="ACT 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 13:3" />Enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, benɛ a ha hwɔ nɛ a sɔle ɔ, a wo a nine pue a nɔ nɛ a wo mɛ blɔ.<verse eid="ACT 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 13:4" />Nɛ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ tsɔɔ mɛ he nɛ a ya; nɛ a pue nɔ kɛ ho Seleukia ya. A ya po wo ɔ ngɛ lejɛ ɔ kɛ ba Kipro. <verse eid="ACT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 13:5" />Nɛ benɛ a ba su Salami ma a mi ɔ, a ya fiɛ Manye Munyu ɔ ngɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ a kpe he ɔmɛ; nɛ Yohane Marko piɛ a he kaa a sɔmɔlɔ.<verse eid="ACT 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 13:6" />Benɛ a fiɛ ngɛ wo kpɔ ma amɛ tsuo a mi nɛ a ba su Pafo ɔ, a ba na Yuda no kunya tsulɔ kɛ lakpa gbalɔ ko nɛ a tsɛɛ lɛ ke Baryesu ɔ <verse eid="ACT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 13:7" />ngɛ Amlaalo Sergio Paulo ngɔ. Sergio Paulo ji nyumu hɛ si kalɔ ko nɛ ngɛ juɛmi saminya. Amlaalo ɔ tsɛ Barnaba kɛ Paulo kɛ ba e ngɔ, ejakaa e ngɛ hlae nɛ e bu Mawu Manye Munyu ɔ tue. <verse eid="ACT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 13:8" />Se kunya tsulɔ ɔ, nɔ nɛ a tsɛ lɛ ngɛ Hela gbi mi ke Elima a, kplɛɛ we nɔ, ejakaa e sume nɛ amlaalo ɔ nɛ bu Barnaba kɛ Paulo a munyu ɔ tue nɛ e he Nutsɔ ɔ nɔ nɛ e ye.<verse eid="ACT 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 13:9" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ sɛ Paulo mi nɛ e hyɛ kunya tsulɔ ɔ gaa kɛ abofu nɛ e de lɛ ke, <verse eid="ACT 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 13:10" />“Mo abosiami bi, nɔ sisilɔ kɛ lakpatsɛ nɛ sume nɔ́ kpakpa! Anɛ o maa pee Nutsɔ ɔ he nyɛlɔ kɛ ya neneene lo? <verse eid="ACT 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 13:11" />Mawu maa sa tue ha mo, nɛ o be nɔ́ hyɛe kɛ ya si be ko.” Paulo nya nɔe si nɛ e hɛ mi wo diblii nɛ e li he nɛ e yaa. Nɛ e bɔni pɛɛ kpami ke nɔ ko nɛ ta tso mi ha lɛ. <verse eid="ACT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 13:12" />Benɛ amlaalo ɔ na nɔ́ nɛ ba Baryesu nɔ ɔ, Mawu Munyu ɔ he wami ɔ ha nɛ e nya kpɛ e he, nɛ e he Manye Munyu ɔ ye.<verse eid="ACT 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo ho Turkia ya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 13:13" />Nɛ Paulo kɛ nihi nɛ piɛ e he ɔ je Pafo nɛ a wo lɛ kɛ ba Perge ngɛ Pamfilia. Se Yohane lɛɛ e kpale ngɛ lejɛ ɔ kɛ ba Yerusalem ekohu. <verse eid="ACT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 13:14" />Nɛ Barnaba kɛ Paulo tsa nɔ kɛ ba Antiokia ngɛ Pisidia zugba a nɔ. Hejɔɔmi Ligbi ɔ nɔ ɔ, a ya kpe he ɔ nɛ a ya ja Mawu. <verse eid="ACT 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 13:15" />Nɛ e ba mi kaa benɛ a kane Mawu munyuhi kɛ je Mose kɛ Gbali ɔmɛ a womi ɔmɛ a mi se ɔ, kpe he ɔ nikɔtɔma amɛ tsɔ nɛ a ba de mɛ ke, “Anyɛmimɛ, ke nyɛ ngɛ nɔ́ ko nɛ nyɛ maa tsɔɔ wɔ ɔ, nyɛɛ ba nɛ nyɛ ba tsɔɔ wɔ.”<verse eid="ACT 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 13:16" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Paulo te si nɛ e nga mɛ, nɛ e de mɛ ke, “Israel bi kɛ nyɛ nihi nɛ nyɛ yee Mawu gbeye, nyɛɛ bu tue!<verse eid="ACT 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 13:17" />Mawu nɛ e ma ji kikɛmɛ a Israel ma nɛ ɔ, nɛ e hla wa tsɛ ɔmɛ nɛ e wo a hɛ mi nyami ngɛ Mizraim, nɛ e kpaka mɛ kɛ je nyɔguɛ yemi mi. <verse eid="ACT 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 13:18" />E lɛ mɛ jeha nyingmi eywiɛ sɔuu ngɛ nga a nɔ. <verse eid="ACT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 13:19" />Nɛ e kpata mahi kpaago a hɛ mi ngɛ Kanaan zugba a nɔ, nɛ e dla a zugba a kɛ ha mɛ kaa a gbosi ni. <verse eid="ACT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 13:20" />E ha mɛ kojoli nɛ a ye a nɔ jeha lafa eywiɛ kɛ nyingmi enuɔ kɛ ba su Gbalɔ Samuel nɔ.<verse eid="ACT 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 13:21" />Pee se ɔ, a kpa Mawu pɛɛ ke e ha mɛ matsɛ, nɛ e ha mɛ Kis bi Saulo nɛ je Benyamin weku ɔ mi ɔ, nɛ e ye a nɔ matsɛ jeha nyingmi eywiɛ. <verse eid="ACT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 13:22" />Se Mawu kpa Saulo nɛ e ngɔ David kɛ to e nane mi ngɛ matsɛ sɛ ɔ nɔ. Mawu de ngɛ David he ke, ‘Ye bua jɔ Isai bi David ɔ he, ejakaa e ma ba pee ye suɔmi nya ni.’ <verse eid="ACT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 13:23" />Nɛ Matsɛ David mi nɔuu nɛ Yesu, nɔ nɛ ji Israel Yiwamihelɔ nɛ Mawu wo e he si ɔ je.<verse eid="ACT 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 13:24" />Se loko ji Yesu ba a, Yohane Baptisilɔ ɔ sɛ e hlami nɛ e ba fiɛ ke Israel no tsuaa Israel no nɛ e kpale ngɛ yayami se kɛ ba Mawu ngɔ. <verse eid="ACT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 13:25" />Nɛ e ba mi kaa benɛ Yohane ngɛ e ni tsumi ɔ nya gbee ɔ, e bi ke, ‘Anɛ nyɛ ngɛ susue kaa ami ji Yiwamihelɔ ɔ lo? Kpaoo! Nɔ ko nɛ kle pe mi ma, nɔ nɛ i sɛ nɛ a kɛ mi toɔ e he kulaa.’<verse eid="ACT 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 13:26" />Anyɛmimɛ Abraham bimɛ, kɛ nyɛ ma je li nɛ yee Mawu gbeye, wɔ tsuo nɛ a kɛ yi wami hemi nɛ ɔ ba ha. <verse eid="ACT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 13:27" />Yuda bi ɔmɛ kɛ a nikɔtɔma amɛ ngɛ Yerusalem ɔ gbe Yesu, nɛ lɔ ɔ ha nɛ gbami nɛ a gba kɛ fɔ si ɔ ba mi. A pee enɛ ɔ ejakaa a yo we lɛ, nɛ a li kaa e he munyu ji nɔ́ nɛ gbali ɔmɛ ngma kɛ fɔ si ɔ. Se a kaneɔ nɔ́ nɛ gbali ɔmɛ ngma a nɛ a nuɔ daa ngɛ Hejɔɔmi Ligbi ɔ nɔ. <verse eid="ACT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 13:28" />A nɛ gbenɔ fɔ bumi sane ko ngɛ e he, se kɛ ɔ, a bi Pilato nɛ e gbe lɛ. <verse eid="ACT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 13:29" />Nɛ benɛ nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ nɛ a ngma ngɛ e gbenɔ ɔ he ɔ ba mi pɛpɛɛpɛ ɔ, a je lɛ kɛ je sɛumi tso ɔ nɔ nɛ a ya to lɛ ngɛ yɔkɔ mi.<verse eid="ACT 13:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 13:30" />Se Mawu tle lɛ si kɛ je gbeje. <verse eid="ACT 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 13:31" />Nɛ pee se ɔ, e je e he kpo si abɔ kɛ tsɔɔ nihi nɛ kɛ lɛ je Galilea kɛ ba Yerusalem ɔ, nɛ a ye he odase ngɛ ma a mi kaa e te si.<verse eid="ACT 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 13:32" />Manye Munyu nɛ ɔ he je nɛ i kɛ Barnaba ba nyɛ ngɔ ngɛ nɛ wa ba ha nɛ nyɛɛ le kaa si nɛ Mawu wo wa tsɛ ɔmɛ ɔ, <verse eid="ACT 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 13:33" />e ba mi ngɛ wa yi nɔ. Ejakaa Mawu tle Yesu si kɛ je gbeje kaa bɔ nɛ a ngma ngɛ David La enyɔne ɔ mi ngɛ Yesu he ke, ‘I wo mo ye biɔ o hɛ mi nyami mwɔnɛ ɔ.’<verse eid="ACT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 13:34" />Ejakaa Mawu wo si kaa e ma tle lɛ si nɛ e be gboe hu, kaa bɔ nɛ a ngma ngɛ Ngmami Klɔuklɔu ɔ mi nɛ a de ke, ‘Ma ngɔ dloomi níhi nɛ i wo David si ngɛ he ɔ kɛ ha nyɛ.’ <verse eid="ACT 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 13:35" />Nɛ e de ngɛ David La kpa ko hu mi ke, ‘Mawu be e Bi Klɔuklɔu ɔ he ngmɛe nɛ e sa gblee!’ <verse eid="ACT 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 13:36" />Tsa pi David he munyu nɛ e ngɛ tue, ejakaa benɛ David gbe ni tsumi nɛ Mawu ha lɛ ɔ nya a, e gbo nɛ a pu lɛ nɛ e sa. <verse eid="ACT 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 13:37" />Se nɔ nɛ he munyu nɛ e ngɛ tue ji nɔ nɛ Mawu tle lɛ si ɔ, nɔ nɛ gbenɔ na we e nɔ he wami ko ɔ.<verse eid="ACT 13:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 13:38" />Anyɛmimɛ suɔli, nyɛɛ bu mi tue! I ngɛ nyɛ dee ke, kɛ gu Yesu nɔ ɔ, a maa ngɔ nyɛ he yayami ɔmɛ kɛ ke nyɛ. <verse eid="ACT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 13:39" />Nɛ e nɔ nɔuu a maa gu kɛ bu nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ heɔ e nɔ yeɔ ɔ bɛmi; nɛ enɛ ɔ ji nɔ́ ko nɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ a mlaa be nyɛe maa pee. <verse eid="ACT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 13:40" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, nyɛɛ hyɛ nyɛ he saminya konɛ níhi nɛ a ngma ngɛ gbali ɔmɛ a womi ɔmɛ a mi ɔ nɛ a ko ba nyɛ nɔ. Ejakaa a de ke, <verse eid="ACT 13:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 13:41" />‘Nyɛɛ hyɛ, nyɛ nɔ he guɛ gbeli, nyɛ hɛ mi ma kpata, ejakaa ma tsu nɔ́ ko ngɛ nyɛ yi nɔ nɛ ke nyɛ nu he ɔ, nyɛ be hee maa ye.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 13:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 13:42" />E ba mi kaa benɛ a ngɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ a kpe he ɔ jee ɔ, a kpa Paulo pɛɛ nɛ e ba tu munyu kɛ tsɔɔ mɛ ekohu ngɛ Hejɔɔmi Ligbi nɛ maa ba a nɔ. <verse eid="ACT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 13:43" />Nɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ kɛ ma je li ɔmɛ nɛ yee Mawu gbeye ɔ nyɛɛ Paulo kɛ Barnaba se kɛ je kpe he ɔ kɛ ba ma a mi nɛ Paulomɛ slɔ mɛ wawɛɛ kaa a pɛtɛ Mawu dloomi ɔ he. <verse eid="ACT 13:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 13:44" />Nɛ benɛ Hejɔɔmi Ligbi ɔ su ekohu ɔ, ma a tsuo ba bua a he nya nɛ a bu Mawu Munyu ɔ tue.<verse eid="ACT 13:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 13:45" />Se Benɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ a nikɔtɔma amɛ na asafo nɛ ba pue si ɔ, a bɔni hunga jemi nɛ a tu musu bɔmi munyuhi kɛ si Paulo nɛ a bɔ mɔde kaa a maa ku e fiɛmi ɔ nya.<verse eid="ACT 13:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 13:46" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Paulo kɛ Barnaba tu munyu kɛ kã ke, “E sa kaa a kɛ Mawu Manye Munyu ɔ ba ha nyɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ kekle, se akɛnɛ nyɛ kua Mawu Munyu ɔ, nɛ nyɛ bui nyɛ he kaa nihi nɛ sa neneene wami ɔ, wa ma wo kɛ ya ha ma je li ɔmɛ. <verse eid="ACT 13:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 13:47" />Ejakaa ja a nɛ Nutsɔ ɔ wo kita nɛ e de ke, ‘I pee mo la kɛ ha ma je li ɔmɛ, konɛ o kpaka mɛ kɛ je zugba nyata he kɛ ba ye yi wami hemi ɔ mi.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 13:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 13:48" />Benɛ ma je li ɔmɛ nu munyu nɛ ɔ, a bua jɔ a he saminya nɛ a nya, nɛ a ti nihi nɛ suɔ kaa a nine nɛ su neneene wami ɔ nɔ ɔ, a he ye. <verse eid="ACT 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 13:49" />Nɛ Mawu Munyu ɔ gbɛ fia jamɛ a zugba a nɔ he fɛɛ he.<verse eid="ACT 13:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 13:50" />Nɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ a nikɔtɔma amɛ wo yihi Mawu jali ɔmɛ a yi mi, kɛ ma mi nikɔtɔma amɛ, nɛ a bua basabasa peeli a nya kɛ wo Paulo kɛ Barnaba he nɛ a fie mɛ kɛ je ma a mi. <verse eid="ACT 13:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 13:51" />Se Paulo kɛ Barnaba blɛ a nane si zu ngɔ pue ma a nɔ nɛ a si lejɛ ɔ kɛ ho Ikonium ya. <verse eid="ACT 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 13:52" />Nɛ kaseli ɔmɛ a bua jɔ a he nɛ a hyi tɔ kɛ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ.<verse eid="ACT 13:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ACT 14" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 14:1" />Benɛ Paulo kɛ Barnaba ya su Ikonium ɔ, a pue nɔ kɛ ho Yuda bi ɔmɛ a kpe he ɔ ya nɛ a ya fiɛ Mawu Munyu ɔ kɛ ka nɛ nya wa, nɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ kɛ ma je li fuu he ye.<verse eid="ACT 14:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 14:2" />Se Yuda bi tue gboli ɔmɛ nɛ ngɛ Yudea puɛ ma je li ɔmɛ a tue nɛ a tu munyu yayahi kɛ si Paulo kɛ Barnaba. <verse eid="ACT 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 14:3" />Se kɛ ɔ, a hi lejɛ ɔ be saii nɛ a fiɛ Mawu Munyu ɔ kɛ tsɔɔ, nɛ Nutsɔ ɔ hu ye a fiɛmi ɔ he odase nɛ e ha mɛ he wami nɛ a tsu nyakpɛ ni nguahi. <verse eid="ACT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 14:4" />Ma mi bi ɔmɛ a mi gba enyɔ, a ti ni fa kɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ a nikɔtɔma amɛ ya pee kake, nɛ fa bi hu piɛ bɔfo ɔmɛ a he.<verse eid="ACT 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">A tsa nyumu ko nɛ nyɛɛ we gblee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 14:5" />Benɛ Paulo kɛ Barnaba nu kaa ma je li komɛ kɛ Yuda bi komɛ kɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ a nikɔtɔma komɛ to yi mi kaa a maa pee mɛ haihai nɛ a fiaa mɛ tɛ ɔ, <verse eid="ACT 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 14:6" />a tu fo kɛ ho Likaonia kɛ Listra kɛ Derbe kɛ a kasa mi ma amɛ a mi ya, <verse eid="ACT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 14:7" />nɛ a ya fiɛ Manye Munyu ɔ ngɛ lejɛ ɔmɛ.<verse eid="ACT 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 14:8" />Benɛ a ngɛ Listra a, a na nyumu ko nɛ nyɛɛ we hyɛ kɛ je benɛ a fɔ lɛ ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 14:9" />Nɛ Paulo ngɛ fiɛe ɔ, nyumu ɔ ngɛ lɛ tue bue. Paulo na lɛ ngɛ ni ɔmɛ a kpɛti nɛ e nu he kaa e ngɛ hemi kɛ yemi nɛ a ma nyɛ kɛ tsa lɛ. <verse eid="ACT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 14:10" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, e kpa ngmlaa nɛ e de lɛ ke, “Tee si!” Amlɔ ɔ nɔuu nɛ nyumu ɔ tu da si nɛ e bɔni nyɛɛmi. <verse eid="ACT 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 14:11" />Asafo ɔ nɛ ngɛ Paulo tue bue ɔ na nɔ́ nɛ e pee ɔ nɛ a kpa ngmlaa nɛ a de ngɛ a gbi mi ke, “mawuhi nɛ a plɛ a he nimli adesahi pɛ ji mɛ!” <verse eid="ACT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 14:12" />Nɛ a tsɛ Barnaba ke Dio; nɛ a wo Paulo ke Herme, ejakaa lɛ titli ji nɔ nɛ ngɛ munyu tue ɔ nɛ. <verse eid="ACT 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 14:13" />Kɛkɛ nɛ lejɛ ɔ Dio wɔ ɔ nɛ maa si ngɛ a ma a nya a e wɔnɔ ɔ wo nahi kɛ mɔmɔhi kɛ ba agbo ɔmɛ a nya ke e maa sã bɔ kɛ ha mɛ ngɛ asafo ɔ hɛ mi.<verse eid="ACT 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 14:14" />Benɛ Barnaba kɛ Paulo na nɔ́ nɛ a ngɛ pee ɔ, a gba a tadehi ngɛ a he nɛ a sa fo kɛ sɛ ni ɔmɛ a kpɛti kɛ ngmlaa ke, <verse eid="ACT 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 14:15" />“Anyɛmimɛ, mɛni nyɛ ngɛ pee ɔ? Nimli adesahi ji wɔ kaa nyɛ nɔuu. Wa ba nɛ wa wo Manye Munyu ɔ kɛ ba ha nyɛ bɔ nɛ pee nɛ nyɛɛ kpale ngɛ yaka nɔ́ ɔmɛ a jami se, nɛ nyɛɛ sɔle ha Mawu hɛ kalɔ ɔ, nɔ nɛ bɔ hiɔwe kɛ zugba kɛ wo kɛ nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ nɛ ngɛ a mi ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 14:16" />Ngɛ be nɛ be ɔ mi ɔ, Mawu ngmɛ majemaje ɔ tsuo blɔ nɛ a pee níhi nɛ a suɔ. <verse eid="ACT 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 14:17" />Se e peeɔ nihi kpakpahi fuu nɛ wa kɛ yeɔ e he odase. E haa nɛ hiɔmi nɛɛ, nɛ niye ni baa nɛ wa naa bua jɔmi.”<verse eid="ACT 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 14:18" />Enɛ ɔ kulaa se ɔ, Paulo kɛ Barnaba nyɛ we ni ɔmɛ a nya nɛ a tsi kɛ a bɔ sami ɔ.<verse eid="ACT 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 14:19" />Pee se ɔ, Yuda bi komɛ nɛ je Antiokia kɛ Ikonium kɛ ba a, a ba puɛ asafo ɔ tue nɛ a ha nɛ a plɛ se kɛ wo Paulo nɛ a fiaa lɛ tɛ, nɛ a sa lɛ si kɛ je ma a mi, nɛ a susu kaa e gbo. <verse eid="ACT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 14:20" />Se benɛ kaseli ɔmɛ ba bɔle lɛ ɔ kɛkɛ nɛ e te si nɛ e ho ma a mi ya ekohu. E nɔ jena nɔ ɔ, e kɛ Barnaba si lejɛ ɔ kɛ ho Derbe ya. <verse eid="ACT 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 14:21" />Benɛ a ya fiɛ Manye Munyu ɔ ngɛ Derbe ma a mi nɛ nihi fuu tsake ɔ, a kpale se ekohu kɛ ba Listra kɛ Ikonium kɛ Antiokia. <verse eid="ACT 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 14:22" />A ba wo kaseli ɔmɛ a mumi he wami bɔ nɛ pee nɛ a suɔ Mawu kɛ mɛ nitsɛmɛ a he. A wo mɛ bua nɛ a pɛtɛ a hemi kɛ yemi ɔ he wawɛɛ nɛ a ko ye gbeye ngɛ yi mi nɛ a ngɛ mɛ wae ɔ he. Nɛ a kai mɛ kaa amanehluhi ji níhi a mi nɛ a maa gu kɛ sɛ Mawu Matsɛyemi ɔ mi. <verse eid="ACT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 14:23" />Paulo kɛ Barnaba hla nikɔtɔmahi kɛ to asafo fɛɛ asafo nya; nɛ a ha hwɔ kɛ sɔle nɛ a to mɛ kɛ wo Nutsɔ, nɔ nɛ a he e nɔ ye ɔ dɛ mi.<verse eid="ACT 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 14:24" />A po mi kɛ je Pisidia kɛ ba Pamfilia, <verse eid="ACT 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 14:25" />nɛ a ba fiɛ ngɛ Perge ekohu loko ji a pue nɔ́ kɛ ba Atalia.<verse eid="ACT 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 14:26" />A sɛ lɛ mi ngɛ Atalia kɛ ba Antiokia, he nɛ a blɔ hiami ɔ je sisi kɛ je, kɛ he nɛ a to mɛ kɛ wo Mawu dɛ mi ngɛ, kɛ ha ni tsumi nɛ a tsu gbe nya nɛ ɔ.<verse eid="ACT 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 14:27" />Benɛ a ba su Antiokia a, a bua kaseli ɔmɛ a nya kɛ kpe nɛ a bɔ mɛ a blɔ hiami ɔ mi amaniɛ. A de mɛ bɔ nɛ Mawu bli hemi kɛ yemi sinya a nya kɛ ha ma je li ɔmɛ hu ɔ; <verse eid="ACT 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 14:28" />nɛ a kɛ kaseli ɔmɛ hi si ngɛ Antiokia be saii.<verse eid="ACT 14:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ACT 15" />
  <para style="s1">Kekle asafo ɔ he nya buami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 15:1" />Benɛ Paulo kɛ Barnaba ngɛ Antiokia a, Yuda bi komɛ je Yudea kɛ ba lejɛ ɔ nɛ a ba tsɔɔ kaseli ɔmɛ ni ke, loko ji a ma he a yi wami ɔ, ja a wo mɛ nyumu mi ngɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ a kusumi ɔ nya. <verse eid="ACT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 15:2" />Paulo kɛ Barnaba kɛ ni ɔmɛ sa nya ngɛ he. Nyagbe mi ɔ, kaseli ɔmɛ tsɔ Paulo kɛ Barnaba kɛ a ti ni komɛ kɛ ho Yerusalem ya nɛ a kɛ bɔfo ɔmɛ kɛ nikɔtɔmahi nɛ ngɛ lejɛ ɔ nɛ a ya susu kikɛmɛ a tsɔɔmi nɛ ɔ he. <verse eid="ACT 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 15:3" />Benɛ asafo ɔ je mɛ blɔ ɔ, tsɔli ɔmɛ tsa nɔ nɛ a ya gu kaseli nɛ ngɛ Foinike kɛ Samaria mahi nɛ ngɛ Yerusalem blɔ he ɔ a ngɔ, nɛ a bɔ mɛ amaniɛ kaa ma je li ɔmɛ hu ngɛ tsakee, nɛ a na bua jɔmi babauu.<verse eid="ACT 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 15:4" />Benɛ Paulo kɛ Barnaba ya su Yerusalem ɔ, bɔfo ɔmɛ kɛ asafo nikɔtɔma amɛ tsuo kpe nɛ Paulomɛ bɔ mɛ ni tsumihi nɛ Mawu ngɛ tsue kɛ gu a nɔ ɔ he amaniɛ. <verse eid="ACT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 15:5" />Se Farisi bi komɛ nɛ tsake ɔ kɛ mɛ kpa we gbi. A de ke e sa nɛ a wo ma je li ɔmɛ nɛ he Mawu Manye Munyu ɔ ye ɔ nyumu mi nɛ a ha nɛ a ye Yuda bi ɔmɛ a kusumi ɔmɛ kɛ mlaa amɛ tsuo nɔ. <verse eid="ACT 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 15:6" />Enɛ ɔ ha nɛ bɔfo ɔmɛ kɛ asafo nikɔtɔma amɛ tsɛ kpe kpa konɛ a hyɛ kikɛmɛ a munyu nɛ ɔ mi.<verse eid="ACT 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 15:7" />Benɛ a ya kpe nɛ a hyɛ munyu ɔ mi hluu ɔ, Petro te si nɛ e de mɛ ke, “Anyɛmimɛ, nyɛ tsuo nyɛ le kaa Mawu hla mi ngɛ nyɛ kpɛti nɛ ma ya fiɛ Manye Munyu ɔ kɛ tsɔɔ ma je li ɔmɛ konɛ mɛ hu a he nɛ a ye. <verse eid="ACT 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 15:8" />Nɛ Mawu, nɔ nɛ le tsui fɛɛ tsui mi ɔ, e kɛ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ ha ma je li ɔmɛ hu kaa bɔ nɛ e kɛ ha wɔ ɔ, nɛ e kɛ ma nɔ mi kaa e he mɛ hu. <verse eid="ACT 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 15:9" />Mawu gba we waa kɛ mɛ wa mi, ejakaa e tsukɔ a he kɛ gu hemi kɛ yemi nɔ kaa bɔ nɛ e pee wɔ hu ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 15:10" />Anɛ nyɛ ngɛ hlae nɛ nyɛɛ ka Mawu, nɛ lɔ ɔ he nɛ nyɛ wo tlomi nɛ wɔ kɛ wa tsɛ ɔmɛ nyɛ we nɛ waa tloo ɔ kɛ ngɛ ma je li ɔmɛ tlooe lo? <verse eid="ACT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 15:11" />Anɛ nyɛ he we yi kaa blɔ kake ɔ nɔuu nɛ ji Nutsɔ Yesu dloomi nɔ́ke nɔ ɔ nɔ nɛ a guɔ kɛ heɔ nɔ tsuaa nɔ yi wami lo?”<verse eid="ACT 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 15:12" />Kɛkɛ nɛ a kpa munyu ɔ nya hlami ɔ, nɛ a bu Paulo kɛ Barnaba tue nɛ a bɔ mɛ nyakpɛ níhi nɛ Mawu pee kɛ gu a nɔ ngɛ ma je li ɔmɛ a kpɛti ɔ.<verse eid="ACT 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 15:13" />Benɛ Barnaba kɛ Paulo a nya nɔ si ɔ, Yakobo te si nɛ e de kpe ɔ ke, “Anyɛmimɛ, nyɛɛ bu mi tue! <verse eid="ACT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 15:14" />Petro tsɔɔ nyɛ be kekle nɛ Mawu ba slaa ma je li ɔmɛ nɛ e hla a ti ni komɛ kɛ wo e hɛ mi nyami ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 15:15" />Nɛ ma je li ɔmɛ a tsakemi ɔ ba mi kaa bɔ nɛ gbali ɔmɛ gba kɛ fɔ si ɔ, nɛ Gbalɔ Amos womi ɔ de ke, <verse eid="ACT 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 15:16" />‘Nɛ ma kpale kɛ ba ekohu ngɛ nɔ́ nɛ ɔmɛ a se, nɛ ma ba ma David Sɔlemi Tsu ɔ nɛ ywia a, <verse eid="ACT 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 15:17" />konɛ ma je li ɔmɛ kɛ nihi tsuo nɛ a wo ye biɛ kɛ wo mɛ ɔ nɛ a hla ye se blɔ.’ <verse eid="ACT 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 15:18" />Nutsɔ, nɔ nɛ jeɔ e yi mi tomi kpo kɛ tsɔɔ kɛ je sisije ɔ, nɛ ngɛ enɛ ɔ dee.<verse eid="ACT 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 15:19" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, nɔ́ nɛ i ngɛ dee ji, wa ko nyɛ ma je li ɔmɛ nɛ ngɔ a he ke ha Mawu ɔ a nɔ, kaa a ye wɔ Yuda bi ɔmɛ wa mlaa amɛ a nɔ. <verse eid="ACT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 15:20" />Se mohu; nyɛ ha nɛ waa ngma mɛ womi nɛ wa de mɛ ke a ko ye lohwehi nɛ a gbe kɛ ha wɔhi, nɛ a kpa ajuama bɔmi. <verse eid="ACT 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 15:21" />Ejakaa nɔ́ nɛ ɔmɛ ji níhi nɛ a bɔɔ mɛ kɔkɔ ngɛ he daa Hejɔɔmi Ligbi ɔ nɔ kɛ je blema ngɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ a kpe he ɔmɛ ngɛ ma fɛɛ ma nɔ ke a ko pee.”<verse eid="ACT 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 15:22" />Kɛkɛ nɛ bɔfo ɔmɛ kɛ nikɔtɔma amɛ kɛ asafo ɔ tsuo kplɛɛ nɔ kaa a je a ti nihi kɛ piɛ Paulo kɛ Barnaba he kɛ ya Antiokia nɛ a ya bɔ kaseli nɛ ngɛ lejɛ ɔ a susumi nɛ ɔ. Nɛ asafo nikɔtɔmahi enyɔ nɛ a je kɛ piɛ a he ɔ ji Yuda nɛ a tsɛɛ lɛ ke Barsaba kɛ Sila.<verse eid="ACT 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 15:23" />Nɛ womi nɛ a ngma kɛ ha tsɔli ɔmɛ nɛ a kɛ ya ha ma je li ɔmɛ ji enɛ ɔ nɛ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 15:23">“Bɔfohi kɛ nikɔtɔmahi kɛ nyɛmimɛ nɛ ngɛ Yerusalem ɔ biɔ nyɛ nyɛmimɛ ma je li nɛ ngɛ Antiokia kɛ Siria kɛ Kilikia a saminya.<verse eid="ACT 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 15:24" />Wa na le kaa wa ti kaseli komɛ ba nyɛ ngɔ ba puɛ nyɛ juɛmi nɛ a hao nyɛ susuma. Wa ngɛ hae nɛ nyɛɛ le kaa pi wa gbi nɔ nɛ a ba ngɛ. <verse eid="ACT 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 15:25" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, wa susu he nɛ wa ma nya si kɛ gbi kake kaa e sa nɛ wa je wa nane mi dali enyɔ kɛ piɛ suɔli Paulo kɛ Barnaba he kɛ ba nyɛ ngɔ. <verse eid="ACT 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 15:26" />Nɛ wa nane mi dali ɔmɛ nɛ ji Yuda kɛ Sila a, a ji nimli nɛ ngɔ a wami kɛ ha ngɛ Nutsɔ Yesu Kristo he.<verse eid="ACT 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 15:27" />Nɛ a maa ma nɔ́ nɛ wa susu ngɛ nyɛ sane ɔ he ɔ nɔ mi kɛ ha nyɛ. <verse eid="ACT 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 15:28" />Ejakaa e sa Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ hɛ mi kɛ wɔ hu wa hɛ mi kaa a ko ngɔ Yuda bi ɔmɛ a mlaa kpa ko kɛ ha nyɛ ke nyɛɛ ye nɔ, pe kɔhi nɛ a he hia amɛ kɛkɛ, <verse eid="ACT 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 15:29" />kaa nyɛ ko ye lohwe nɛ a gbe kɛ ha wɔ, kɛ lohwe nɛ a ki e kuɛ; nɛ nyɛ ko bɔ ajuama hulɔ. Ke nyɛ ye kɔ nɛ ɔmɛ a nɔ ɔ, kɛkɛ e hiɛ. Nyɛɛ hi si saminya.”<verse eid="ACT 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 15:30" />Kɛkɛ nɛ tsɔli eywiɛ ɔmɛ pue nɔ amlɔ ɔ nɔuu kɛ ho Antiokia ya nɛ a ya bua asafo ɔ tsuo nya, nɛ a kɛ womi ɔ ha mɛ. <verse eid="ACT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 15:31" />Nɛ asafo ɔ na bua jɔmi babauu benɛ a kane womi ɔ.<verse eid="ACT 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 15:32" />Akɛnɛ Yuda kɛ Sila a nya mi tsɔ kɛ munyu tumi he je ɔ, a fiɛ Mawu Munyu ɔ nɛ e nya kɛ, kɛ ha Antiokia asafo ɔ, nɛ a kɛ wo mɛ he wami. <verse eid="ACT 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 15:33" />Yuda kɛ Sila kɛ Antiokia asafo ɔ hi si be saii loko ji a kpale kɛ ba Yerusalem he nɛ a tsɔ mɛ ke je ɔ kɛ manye. <verse eid="ACT 15:33" /><verse number="34-35" style="v" sid="ACT 15:34-35" />Se Paulo kɛ Barnaba tlɔ Antiokia nɛ a ye kɛ bua nihi fuu ngɛ Mawu Munyu ɔ fiɛmi kɛ ni tsɔɔmi mi.<verse eid="ACT 15:34-35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo kɛ Barnaba mi gba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 15:36" />Se benɛ a ye be saii ngɛ Antiokia a, Paulo de Barnaba ke a kpale kɛ ba Turkia ekohu nɛ a ya slaa kaseli ɔmɛ ngɛ ma fɛɛ ma mi he nɛ a fiɛ Manye Munyu ɔ ngɛ ɔ, konɛ a hyɛ bɔ nɛ a ngɛ nɔ yae ha. <verse eid="ACT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 15:37" />Barnaba kplɛɛ, se e suɔ kaa a ngɔ Yohane Marko kɛ piɛ a he. <verse eid="ACT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 15:38" />Se Paulo kplɛɛ we nɔ, ejakaa Yohane kpale ngɛ a se ngɛ Pamfilia. <verse eid="ACT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 15:39" />Akɛnɛ a bɛ gbi kake ngɛ enɛ ɔ he he je ɔ, a mi gba enyɔ, nɛ Barnaba ngɔ Marko kɛ piɛ e he nɛ a gu lɛ mi kɛ ho Kipro ya. <verse eid="ACT 15:39" /><verse number="40-41" style="v" sid="ACT 15:40-41" />Paulo hu ngɔ Sila kɛ piɛ e he; nɛ benɛ kaseli ɔmɛ to mɛ kɛ wo Mawu dɛ nɛ a gbaa mɛ ɔ, a pue nɔ kɛ ho Siria kɛ Kilikia ya konɛ a ya wo asafohi nɛ ngɛ lejɛ ɔmɛ he wami.<verse eid="ACT 15:40-41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ACT 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 16:1" />Paulo kɛ Sila ya Derbe kekle loko a pue nɔ kɛ ho Listra ya, he nɛ a ya na kaselɔ ko nɛ a tsɛɛ lɛ ke Timoteo ngɛ. Timoteo nyɛ ɔ Yuda no i, nɛ e ngɛ asafo ɔ mi. Se e tsɛ ɔ lɛɛ Hela no i. <verse eid="ACT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 16:2" />Timoteo ji kaselɔ ko nɛ Listra kɛ Ikonium nyɛmi ɔmɛ tuɔ e he munyu kpakpa. <verse eid="ACT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 16:3" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, Paulo suɔ nɛ e kɛ mɛ nɛ ya. Se akɛnɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ le kaa Hela no ji Timoteo tsɛ ɔ he je ɔ, Paulo wo lɛ nyumu mi ngɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ a he loko ji a hia blɔ. <verse eid="ACT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 16:4" />A kpa mahimahi a nɔ, nɛ a tsɔɔ mɛ mlaa amɛ, nɛ ji mlaahi nɛ bɔfo ɔmɛ kɛ nikɔtɔma amɛ ngɛ Yerusalem ɔ wo, nɛ kɔɔ Hela bi ɔmɛ a he ɔ, konɛ mɛ hu a ye nɔ. <verse eid="ACT 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 16:5" />Nɛ asafo ɔ bɔni klemi, nɛ e bɔni wami ngɛ hemi kɛ yemi hu mi.<verse eid="ACT 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 16:6" />Nɛ akɛnɛ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ de mɛ ke, a ko ya Turkia nɛ ngɛ Asia zugba a nɔ, ngɛ jamɛ a be ɔ mi he je ɔ, a po mi ngɛ Frigia kɛ ba Galatia zugba a nɔ. <verse eid="ACT 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 16:7" />Benɛ a ba su Misia zugba a nɔ ɔ, a ka kaa a maa ya Bitinia, se Yesu Mumi ɔ ngmɛ́ mɛ blɔ. <verse eid="ACT 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 16:8" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, a gu Misia nɔ́ ɔmɛ a mi kɛ ba Troia ma a mi.<verse eid="ACT 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo ni nami ngɛ Troia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 16:9" />Nɛ jamɛ a nyɔ ɔ mi nɛ a hwɔɔ si ɔ, Paulo na ni nami ko. E na nɛ Makedonia nyumu ko ngɛ lɛ pɛɛ kpae ke, “Ba Makedonia nɛ o ba ye ke bua wɔ.” <verse eid="ACT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 16:10" />Kɛkɛ nɛ wa dla wa he nɛ wa pue Makedonia blɔ ejakaa wa na kaa Mawu nɛ ngɛ wɔ tsɔe nɛ wa ya fiɛ Manye Munyu ɔ ngɛ lejɛ ɔ.<verse eid="ACT 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 16:11" />Amlɔ ɔ nɔuu ɔ, wa wo lɛ kɛ je Troia kɛ ba Samotrake, nɛ wa ba Neapoli e nɔ́ jena nɔ; <verse eid="ACT 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 16:12" />loko wa ba su Filipi nɛ ji Roma bi a nɔ yemi he nɛ ngɛ Makedonia zugba a nɔ, ngɛ Makedonia huzu nya; nɛ wa ba hi lejɛ ɔ be saii.<verse eid="ACT 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 16:13" />Benɛ e su Hejɔɔmi Ligbi ɔ, wa je ma a mi kɛ ho pa ko nya ya, he ko nɛ a pɔɔ sɔlemi peemi ngɛ ɔ, nɛ wa ya tsɔɔ yi komɛ nɛ ba lejɛ ɔ Ngmami Klɔuklɔu ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 16:14" />A kpɛti nɔ kake ji Lidia. E je Tiatira, nɛ e juaa bo nɛ a tsɛɛ ke kuajai ɔ. Lidia jaa Mawu. Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, benɛ e ngɛ wɔ tue bue ɔ, Mawu bli e tsui nya nɛ e he nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ nɛ Paulo de ɔ ye. <verse eid="ACT 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 16:15" />Nɛ benɛ a sɔle lɛ kɛ e we ɔ tsuo ɔ, e bi wɔ nɛ wa ba to e ngɔ. E de wɔ ke, “Ke nyɛ buu mi kaa i heɔ Nutsɔ ɔ nɔ yeɔ anɔkuale mi ɔ, lɛɛ nyɛ ba to ye we ɔ mi.” E ngɛ nɔ hluu kɛ ya si wa kplɛɛ.<verse eid="ACT 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 16:16" />Ligbi ko benɛ wa yaa pa a nya he nɛ a peeɔ Sɔlemi ngɛ ɔ, waa kɛ mawayo ko nɛ mumi yayami ngɛ e mi, nɛ naa ni ɔ ya kpe. Yoyo nɛ ɔ gu enɛ ɔ nɔ nɛ e ha nɛ e nutsɔ ɔmɛ na ni fuu. <verse eid="ACT 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 16:17" />E bɔni wa se nyɛɛmi kɛ ngmlaa ke, “Mawu tsɔli ji nimli nɛ ɔmɛ, nɛ a ba hiɛ ɔ nɛ a ba de nyɛ bɔ nɛ a kɛ nyɛ he yayami ɔmɛ maa ke nyɛ ha.”<verse eid="ACT 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 16:18" />Yoyo nɛ ɔ ya nɔ kɛ ngmlaa kpami nɛ ɔ kɛ ya su be ko nɛ Paulo kɛ abofu nga mumi yayami ɔ yi ke, “I ngɛ mo fae ngɛ Yesu Kristo biɛ mi ke o je kpo kɛ je e mi.” Nɛ nɔuu ɔ, mumi yayami ɔ je e mi.<verse eid="ACT 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 16:19" />Akɛnɛ yoyo ɔ nutsɔ ɔmɛ a ni nami ɔ se po he je ɔ, a nu Paulo kɛ Sila nɛ a sa mɛ si kɛ ba kojoli a hɛ mi ngɛ ma nɔ.<verse eid="ACT 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 16:20" />A ya po a nya ngɛ kojomi he ɔ kɛ ngmlaa ke, “Kikɛmɛ a Yuda bi nɛ ɔmɛ wo basabasa kɛ ngɛ wa ma a mi bae, <verse eid="ACT 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 16:21" />ejakaa a ngɛ ma mi bi ɔmɛ tsɔɔe nɛ a pee níhi nɛ sɛ kaa a peeɔ ngɛ Roma mlaa amɛ a nya.”<verse eid="ACT 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">A wo Paulo kɛ Sila tsu mi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 16:22" />Amlɔ ɔ nɔuu ɔ, ma mi bi ɔmɛ te si kɛ wo Paulo kɛ Sila, nɛ kojoli ɔmɛ ha nɛ a kpɔ a tadehi ngɛ a he nɛ a fiaa mɛ kpa saminya. <verse eid="ACT 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 16:23" />E ba mi kaa benɛ a fiaa mɛ kpa a ta a, a wo mɛ kɛ ya wo tsu mi. Nɛ a wo a he bulɔ ɔ si kaa a maa gbe lɛ ke e ha nɛ Paulo kɛ Sila ma fo kɛ je tsu ɔ mi. <verse eid="ACT 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 16:24" />Enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, e kɛ mɛ ya wo se tsu ɔ mi nɛ e wo a nane kɔsɔkɔsɔ.<verse eid="ACT 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 16:25" />Se benɛ nyɔ mi kpɛti su, nɛ Paulo kɛ Sila ngɛ sɔlee nɛ a ngɛ lae, nɛ nihi nɛ a wo mɛ hu tsu mi kɛ piɛ a he ngɛ lejɛ ɔ ngɛ mɛ tue bue ɔ, <verse eid="ACT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 16:26" />kɛkɛ nɛ zugba huanya si kake too nɛ tsu ɔ mi gba. Sinya amɛ tsuo bli nɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ kɔsɔkɔsɔ ɔ kplɔ pue si. <verse eid="ACT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 16:27" />Benɛ a he bulɔ ɔ he tsiɛ nɛ e na kaa sinya amɛ kulaa bli ɔ, e susu kaa Paulo kɛ Sila kɛ nihi nɛ a wo mɛ hu tsu mi ɔ tsuo tu fo kɛ je. Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, e hia klaate nɛ e ma kɛ gbe e he.<verse eid="ACT 16:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 16:28" />Se Paulo hia ngmlaa ke, “Koo gbe o he! Wɔ tsuo wa ngɛ hiɛ ɔ!”<verse eid="ACT 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 16:29" />Kɛkɛ nɛ e bi nɛ a ba ha lɛ kane, nɛ e sa fo kɛ sɛ se tsu ɔ mi kɛ gbeye yemi nɛ e ya kpla si ngɛ Paulo kɛ Sila hɛ mi. <verse eid="ACT 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 16:30" />Nɛ benɛ e kɛ mɛ je kpo ngɛ tsu ɔ mi ɔ, e bi mɛ ke, “Mawetsɛmɛ, kɛ ma pee kɛɛ nɛ ma na yi wami hemi?”<verse eid="ACT 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 16:31" />A ha lɛ heto ke, “Mo he Nutsɔ Yesu nɔ nɛ o ye, nɛ a ma he o kɛ o we ɔ tsuo yi wami.”<verse eid="ACT 16:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 16:32" />Paulo kɛ Sila fiɛ Nutsɔ ɔ Manye Munyu ɔ kɛ tsɔɔ lɛ kɛ e we ɔ tsuo. <verse eid="ACT 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 16:33" />Nɛ e tsɔɔ a pa amɛ ha mɛ jamɛ a ngmlɛfia a mi nɔuu, nɛ a sɔle lɛ kɛ e we ɔ kulaa. <verse eid="ACT 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 16:34" />E kɛ mɛ ba e we ɔ mi nɛ e ngmɛ okplɔɔ ha mɛ, nɛ e kɛ e we ɔ na bua jɔmi kaa jehanɛ ɔ a plɛ Mawu jali. <verse eid="ACT 16:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 16:35" />Nɛ e ba mi kaa benɛ je na a, kojoli ɔmɛ tsɔ nɛ a ya de bulɔ ɔ ke, “Moo ngmɛɛ nimli ɔmɛ a he nɛ a ho!” <verse eid="ACT 16:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 16:36" />Kɛkɛ nɛ bulɔ ɔ de Paulo ke a ngmɛɛ a he, lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, a ma nyɛ maa ya.<verse eid="ACT 16:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 16:37" />Se Paulo ha tsɔli ɔmɛ heto ke, “Dabi! A ngmɛɛ we wa he lolo, ejakaa Roma bi ji wɔ, nɛ a fiaa wɔ kpa ngɛ ma nɔ, nɛ a wo wɔ tsu mi benɛ a kojo we wɔ. Mɛni a na nɛ a ngɛ hlae nɛ a ngmɛɛ wa he zaa? Dabi! Ha nɛ mɛ nitsɛmɛ a ba nɛ a ba ngmɛɛ wa he.”<verse eid="ACT 16:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 16:38" />Benɛ polisi ɔmɛ ya bɔ kojoli ɔmɛ amaniɛ, nɛ a nu kaa Roma bi ji Paulo kɛ Sila a, a ye gbeye. <verse eid="ACT 16:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 16:39" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, a ba tsu womi he ɔ nɛ a ba kpa mɛ pɛɛ. Benɛ a je mɛ kpo ɔ, a hɛɛ mɛ blɛuublɛuu kɛ pɛɛ kpami ke a je ma a mi. <verse eid="ACT 16:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 16:40" />Se Paulo kɛ Sila kpale kɛ ho Lidia we ɔ mi ya ekohu, nɛ a ya na kaseli ɔmɛ ngɛ lejɛ ɔ nɛ a fiɛ munyu ɔ kɛ wo mɛ he wami loko ji a je ma a mi.<verse eid="ACT 16:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ACT 17" />
  <para style="s1">Paulo na amanehlu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 17:1" />Jehanɛ ɔ a nyɛɛ kɛ gu Amfipoli kɛ Apolonia ma amɛ a mi kɛ ba Tesalonika he nɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ a kpe he ko ngɛ ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 17:2" />Nɛ kaa bɔ nɛ Paulo pɔɔ peemi ɔ, e ya fiɛ ngɛ kpe he ɔ ngɛ Hejɔɔmi Ligbi etɛ sɔuu nɔ nɛ e tsɔɔ Tesalonika bi ɔmɛ nihi nɛ ngɛ Ngmami Klɔuklɔu ɔ mi. <verse eid="ACT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 17:3" />E de mɛ níhi nɛ gbali ɔmɛ ngma nɛ kɔɔ Yesu nɛ ji Mesia a e amanehlu kɛ e si temi kɛ je gbeje ɔ he. <verse eid="ACT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 17:4" />Nɛ nihi nɛ nu munyu ɔ he ye nɛ a tsake a tsui. A kpɛti ni komɛ ji Hela bi Mawu gbeye yeli kɛ ma mi yi nikɔtɔma komɛ.<verse eid="ACT 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 17:5" />Enɛ ɔ pee Yuda bi ɔmɛ a nikɔtɔma amɛ tai. Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, a ya dɔ awi yeli kɛ wo a he nɛ a bɔni gidigidi peemi; nɛ a ya bɔle kaselɔ ko nɛ a tsɛɛ lɛ ke Yason ɔ e we ɔ konɛ a nu Paulo kɛ Sila kɛ ya kojomi he ɔ nɛ a ya kojo mɛ.<verse eid="ACT 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 17:6" />Se benɛ a ya nɛ mɛ ngɛ lejɛ ɔ, a nu Yason kɛ kaseli ɔmɛ a ti ni komɛ kɛ ba kojomi he ɔ nɛ a ba po a nya kɛ ngmlaa ke, “Paulo kɛ Sila plɛ je ɔ hɛ mi bu si, nɛ a ba hiɛ ɔ hu nɛ a ba pee wa ma a mi gidigidi. <verse eid="ACT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 17:7" />Nɛ Yason he mɛ kɛ to ngɛ e we ɔ mi. Mɛ tsuo a yeɔ gbenɔ fɔ, ejakaa a ngɛ matsɛ kpa nɛ a ngɛ tsɛe ke Yesu toe ngɛ Matsɛ Kaisare nane mi.”<verse eid="ACT 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8-9" style="v" sid="ACT 17:8-9" />Sane nɛ ɔ he wa ha ma mi bi ɔmɛ kɛ kojoli ɔmɛ tsuo, lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, a he se dami ni ngɛ Yason kɛ kaseli kpa amɛ a dɛ loko ji a ngmɛɛ a he.<verse eid="ACT 17:8-9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 17:10" />Jamɛ a nyɔ ɔ mi nɔuu ɔ, kaseli ɔmɛ je Paulo kɛ Sila blɔ kɛ ho Beroia ya; nɛ kaa bɔ nɛ a pɔɔ peemi ɔ, a ya fiɛ ngɛ lejɛ ɔ kpe he ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 17:11" />Se Beroia bi ɔmɛ nuɔ nɔ́ sisi pe Tesalonika bi ɔmɛ. Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, a bu Mawu Manye Munyu ɔ nɛ Paulo kɛ Sila fiɛ ha mɛ ɔ tue, nɛ a kaneɔ Ngmami Klɔuklɔu ɔ daa. A ngɛ hlae nɛ a hyɛ kaa nɔ́ nɛ Paulo kɛ Sila ngɛ mɛ dee ɔ ngɛ mi ja a lo. <verse eid="ACT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 17:12" />Enɛ ɔ ha nɛ a ti nihi fuu kɛ Hela yi nikɔtɔma komɛ nɛ a le mɛ saminya a he ye.<verse eid="ACT 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 17:13" />Benɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ nɛ ngɛ Tesalonika a nu kaa Paulo ngɛ fiɛe ngɛ Beroia a, a bu e nɔ nɛ a ya puɛ ni ɔmɛ a tue. <verse eid="ACT 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 17:14" />Se kaseli ɔmɛ ye kɛ bua Paulo nɛ a je lɛ blɔ kɛ gu wo ɔ nya, se Sila kɛ Timoteo tlɔ si. <verse eid="ACT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 17:15" />Nɛ Paulo blɔ jeli ɔmɛ kɛ lɛ ya su Atene loko a kpale a se, nɛ a wo e sɛ kɛ ba ha Sila kɛ Timoteo kaa e ke a bu e nɔ.<verse eid="ACT 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 17:16" />Benɛ Paulo ngɛ mɛ mlɛe ngɛ Atene ɔ, e bua jɔɛ e he ngɛ wɔhi nɛ e na ngɛ Atene ma a mi he fɛɛ he ɔ he. <verse eid="ACT 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 17:17" />E yaa kpe he ɔ nɛ e kɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ kɛ Hela bi Mawu jali komɛ ya naa ni sɛɛmi, nɛ e ya fiɛɔ daa ngɛ ma a nɔ kɛ tsɔɔ nihi nɛ buaa a he nya ngɛ lejɛ ɔ.<verse eid="ACT 17:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo kɛ womi leli kpanaa amɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 17:18" />Paulo kɛ ni leli nɛ je Epikuro kɛ Stoa a kpɛti ɔ, a ti ni komɛ ya na nya sami, ejakaa benɛ e de mɛ Yesu gbenɔ kɛ e si temi ɔ he sane ɔ, nɔ́ nɛ ni leli ɔmɛ de ji, “E ji nɔ ko nɛ ngɛ nlae.” A ti ni komɛ hu de ke, “Ma se jami kpa ko nɛ e ba ngɛ wɔ tsɔɔe nɛ ɔ nɛ.”<verse eid="ACT 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 17:19" />Kɛkɛ nɛ a kpee lɛ ke e ba a kojomi he nɛ a tsɛɛ ke Areopago ɔ. A de lɛ ke, “Wa ngɛ ma se jami kpa ko nɛ o ngɛ tsɔɔe ɔ he nue. <verse eid="ACT 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 17:20" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, moo ba nɛ o ba de wɔ jami he ɔ nɛ o ngɛ he munyu tue ɔ he nɔ́ ko.” <verse eid="ACT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 17:21" />Nɔ́ kake nɛ ngɛ Atene bi kɛ nibwɔhi nɛ ngɛ ma a mi ɔ a he ji, a suɔ nɛ a puɛ a be kɛ sɛsɛ nɔ́ he ko nɛ ba a he. <verse eid="ACT 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 17:22" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, benɛ Paulo ya da si ngɛ Areopago ɔ, e de mɛ ke, “Atene bi, i na kaa nyɛ jaa wɔ saminya, <verse eid="ACT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 17:23" />ejakaa benɛ i ngɛ ma a mi nyɛɛe ɔ, i na nɛ a ngma ngɛ nyɛ afɔle sami la tɛ ɔmɛ kake nɔ ke, ‘Kɛ ha Mawu nɛ a li lɛ ɔ.’ Mawu ɔ nɛ nyɛ li lɛ se nyɛ ngɛ lɛ jae ɔ, e he munyu nɛ i ba nɛ ma ba tu nyɛ ɔ nɛ.<verse eid="ACT 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 17:24" />Lɛ ji Mawu nɛ bɔ je ɔ kɛ e mi nɔ́ fɛɛ nɔ. Nɛ akɛnɛ lɛ ji hiɔwe kɛ zugba Nutsɔ he je ɔ, e hí sɔlemi tsu nɛ a ma kɛ nine mi, <verse eid="ACT 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 17:25" />nɛ nimli a nine be lɛ nyɛe ma sɔmɔ, ejakaa nɔ́ ko he hia we lɛ; nɛ lɛ ji nɔ nɛ haa nɔ tsuaa nɔ wami kɛ mumi kɛ nɔ́ fɛɛ nɔ. <verse eid="ACT 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 17:26" />Lɛ ji nɔ nɛ bɔ adesahi tsuo kɛ je nɔ kake nɛ ji Adam mi, nɛ e gbɛ mɛ kɛ fia zugba a nɔ. E le mahi nɛ maa ya nɔ kɛ mahi nɛ maa gbee si, kɛ be nɛ nɔ́ nɛ ɔmɛ maa ba mi ɔ kɛ fɔ si. Lɛ ji nɔ nɛ wo a huzu ɔmɛ.<verse eid="ACT 17:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 17:27" />E pee nɔ́ nɛ ɔmɛ bɔ nɛ pee nɛ a hla e se blɔ nɛ a na lɛ; tsɛ be ɔ, e ngɛ wɔ tsuo wa kasa mi haa. <verse eid="ACT 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 17:28" />Ejakaa e mi nɔuu nɛ wa ngɛ wami mi ngɛ, nɛ e mi nɔuu nɛ wa ngɛ yae ngɛ bae ngɛ kaa bɔ nɛ nyɛ nitsɛmɛ nyɛ kpɛti la polɔ ko de ke, ‘Mawu bimɛ ji wɔ.’ <verse eid="ACT 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 17:29" />Ke Mawu bimɛ ji wɔ niinɛ ɔ, lɛɛ e sɛ nɛ wa susu kaa Mawu ngɛ kaa amaga ko nɛ nimli pee kɛ sika tsu loo sika hiɔ loo amaga nɛ a kpɛ kɛ je tɛ mi. <verse eid="ACT 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 17:30" />Be ko nɛ be ɔ mi ɔ, nimli li kikɛmɛ a ni nɛ ɔmɛ, nɛ lɔ ɔ he je ɔ Mawu kamaa we mɛ ngɛ he; se amlɔ nɛ ɔ, e bɔ nɔ tsuaa nɔ kɔkɔ ngɛ wɔ jami he, nɛ e ke a ja lɛ pɛ. <verse eid="ACT 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 17:31" />Ejakaa e to be nɛ e maa kojo je ɔ kɛ gu nɔ ko nɛ e hla, nɛ e tle lɛ si kɛ je gbeje ɔ nɔ.”<verse eid="ACT 17:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 17:32" />Benɛ a nu nɛ Paulo de ke nɔ ko gbo nɛ e te si kɛ je gbeje ɔ, a kpɛti ni komɛ muɔ nɛ a ye e he fɛu. Nɛ ni komɛ hu de ke, “Wa maa suɔ nɛ hwɔɔ se ɔ, waa nu nɔ́ ko kɛ je enɛ ɔ he ekohu.” <verse eid="ACT 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 17:33" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Paulo wo a ni sɛɛmi ɔ kɛ ba nyagbe nɛ e je a he. <verse eid="ACT 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 17:34" />Se a kpɛti ni komɛ nyɛɛ e se nɛ a ba pee kaseli. Nimli nɛ ɔmɛ a kpɛti ni komɛ ji Dionisio nɛ ji Ma Kpe ɔ mi no kɛ yo ko nɛ a tsɛɛ lɛ ke Damari kɛ ni kpa komɛ.<verse eid="ACT 17:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ACT 18" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 18:1" />Enɛ ɔ se ɔ, Paulo si Atene kɛ ho Korinto ya. <verse eid="ACT 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 18:2" />Nɛ e kɛ Yuda no ko ya kpe nɛ a tsɛɛ lɛ ke Akuila nɛ a fɔ lɛ ngɛ Ponto ɔ, kɛ e yo Priskila. Akuila je Italia kɛ ba Korinto, ejakaa Kaisare Klaudio fie mɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ tsuo kɛ je Roma. <verse eid="ACT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 18:3" />Paulo kɛ mɛ hi si nɛ e kɛ mɛ tsu ni, ejakaa mɛ hu bo tsu peeli ji mɛ kaa lɛ kɛ.<verse eid="ACT 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo kɛ ma je li ɔmɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 18:4" />Paulo ya fiɛɔ ngɛ kpe he ɔ daa Hejɔɔmi Ligbi ɔ nɔ, nɛ e bɔɔ mɔde kaa e ma tsake Yuda bi ɔmɛ kɛ Hela bi ɔmɛ hu lo. <verse eid="ACT 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 18:5" />Se benɛ Sila kɛ Timoteo je Makedonia kɛ ba na lɛ ngɛ Korinto ɔ, Paulo tsu we nɔ́ kpa ko hu pe Mawu Munyu ɔ fiɛmi kɛ Yesu he odase yemi kaa lɛ ji Mesia a nɛ. <verse eid="ACT 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 18:6" />Se benɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ te si kɛ wo lɛ nɛ a tu musu bɔmi munyuhi kɛ si Yesu ɔ, Paulo blɛ bunyuku ngɛ e tade ɔ mi ngɔ pue a nɔ nɛ e de mɛ ke, “Nyɛ muɔ ɔ nɛ ba nyɛ nitsɛmɛ nyɛ nɔ, ami i li he nɔ́ ko. Nɛ kɛ je be nɛ ɔ mi kɛ yaa a, i ma ya fiɛ munyu ɔ kɛ tsɔɔ ma je li ɔmɛ.”<verse eid="ACT 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 18:7" />Paulo si lejɛ ɔ nɛ e ya to Hela no Mawu jalɔ ko nɛ a tsɛɛ lɛ ke Titio Yusto nɛ e we ngɛ kpe he ɔ kasa mi ɔ ngɔ. <verse eid="ACT 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 18:8" />Nɛ a baptisi kpe he nɔkɔtɔma nɛ a tsɛɛ lɛ Krispo ɔ kɛ e we ɔ tsuo kɛ Korinto bi fuu nɛ he Nutsɔ ɔ nɔ ye ɔ.<verse eid="ACT 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 18:9" />Mawu kɛ Paulo tu munyu nyɔ mi ko ngɛ ni nami mi ke, “Koo ye gbeye! Moo fiɛ munyu ɔ, nɛ o ko si. <verse eid="ACT 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 18:10" />Ejakaa i kɛ mo ngɛ, nɛ nɔ ko be mo yayami ko nyɛe maa pee; i ngɛ nihi babauu ngɛ ma nɛ ɔ mi.” <verse eid="ACT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 18:11" />Enɛ ɔ ha nɛ Paulo hi ma a mi jeha kake kɛ fa sɔuu nɛ e tsɔɔ mɛ Mawu anɔkuale munyu ɔ.<verse eid="ACT 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 18:12" />E ba mi kaa benɛ a wo Galio amlaalo ngɛ Akaia a, Yuda bi ɔmɛ pee kake nɛ a te si kɛ wo Paulo nɛ a nu lɛ kɛ ba kojomi he ɔ ngɛ amlaalo ɔ hɛ mi. <verse eid="ACT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 18:13" />Nɛ a po e nya ke, “Nyumu nɛ ɔ ngɛ nihi a tue puɛe nɛ a je Roma mlaa a se nɛ a ba ja Mawu.” <verse eid="ACT 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 18:14" />Se benɛ Paulo ma je e nya pɛ nɛ Galio de Paulo nya poli ɔmɛ ke, “Nyɛɛ bu tue, nyɛ Yuda bi, kaa e ji mlaa tɔmi sane ko nɛ nyɛ kɛ ba ye ngɔ jinɛ e sa nɛ ma bu nyɛ tue. <verse eid="ACT 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 18:15" />Se akɛnɛ e hine nya sami sane nɛ kɔɔ nyɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ nyɛ mlaa amɛ a he ɔ, ma suɔ nɛ nyɛ nitsɛmɛ nyɛ ya hyɛ mi. Ejakaa i sume nɛ ma kojo kikɛmɛ a munyuhi.” <verse eid="ACT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 18:16" />Nɛ e fie mɛ kɛ je kpo ngɛ kojomi he ɔ.<verse eid="ACT 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 18:17" />Kɛkɛ nɛ ni ɔmɛ nu Sostene nɛ ji kpe he ɔ nɔkɔtɔma he nɛ a to ɔ, nɛ a fiaa lɛ ni saminya ngɛ tsu ɔ se. Se nɔ́ nɛ ɔmɛ hɛ wui Galio kulaa.<verse eid="ACT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 18:18" />Sane nɛ ɔmɛ a se ɔ, Paulo hi lejɛ ɔ be saii loko ji e si nɛ e ngɔ Akuila kɛ Priskila kɛ piɛ e he, nɛ a sɛ lɛ kɛ ba Siria. Benɛ a ba su Kenkrea a, Paulo ba kpa e yi ɔ ngɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ a kusumi ɔ nya, ejakaa e ka kita. <verse eid="ACT 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 18:19" />Se benɛ a ya su Efeso lɛda he ɔ, Paulo si mɛ ngɛ lɛ ɔ mi nɛ e kɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ ya na ni sɛɛmi ngɛ a kpe he ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 18:20" />Efeso bi ɔmɛ kpa lɛ pɛɛ nɛ e hi a ngɔ bɔɔ, se akɛnɛ e be be he je ɔ, e kplɛɛ we nɔ, nɛ e sɛ mɛ nɛ e de ke,<verse eid="ACT 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 18:21" />“E sa kaa ma ya su Yerusalem nɛ ma ya ye Hejɔɔmi Ligbi ɔ ngɛ lejɛ ɔ.” Se e wo mɛ si kaa ke Mawu suɔ ɔ, e maa kpale kɛ ba a ngɔ ekohu. Kɛkɛ nɛ a pue nɔ.<verse eid="ACT 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 18:22" />Nɛ benɛ lɛ ɔ ya wa ngɛ Kaisarea a, Paulo je kpo nɛ e ya nga Yerusalem asafo ɔ loko ji a tsa nɔ kɛ ho Antiokia ya. <verse eid="ACT 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 18:23" />E hi Antiokia be saii, nɛ e pue nɔ ekohu kɛ ya kpa Galatia kɛ Frigia zugba amɛ a nɔ kɛ wo kaseli ɔmɛ he wami bɔ nɛ pee nɛ a ya nɔ nɛ a wa ngɛ Nutsɔ ɔ mi.<verse eid="ACT 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 18:24" />Nɛ e ba mi kaa Yuda no ko nɛ a tsɛɛ lɛ ke Apolo ɔ je Aleksandria ngɛ Mizraim kɛ ba Efeso. Apolo ji Mawu Munyu fiɛlɔ kɛ Ngmami Klɔuklɔu ɔ Tsɔɔlɔ, nɛ e nya mi tsɔ saminya.<verse eid="ACT 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 18:25" />Benɛ Apolo ngɛ Mizraim ɔ, nɔ ko tu lɛ Yohane Baptisilɔ ɔ he munyu kɛ nɔ́ nɛ Yohane de ngɛ Yesu he; nɛ lɔ ɔ pɛ ji nɔ́ nɛ e le. E nui sane ɔ e mi ekpa ko hu. <verse eid="ACT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 18:26" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, e bɔni fiɛmi kɛ ka ngɛ kpe he ɔ nɛ e ngɛ dee ke, “Yiwamihelɔ ɔ ma! Nyɛ dla nyɛ he nɛ nyɛ nya e he.” Benɛ Akuila kɛ Priskila nu e fiɛmi ɔ, pee se ɔ, a tsɛ lɛ kɛ ba a ngɔ nɛ a tsɔɔ lɛ nɔ́ nɛ ba Yesu nɔ́ kɛ je Yohane yi nɔ bebeebe, nɛ a pá níhi a mi kɛ tsɔɔ lɛ.<verse eid="ACT 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 18:27" />Benɛ Apolo pee e juɛmi kaa e maa ya Akaia a, kaseli ɔmɛ wo lɛ he wami kaa e ya; nɛ a ngma Akaia nyɛmi ɔmɛ womi kaa ke e ba a, a he lɛ atuu. Nɛ e ba mi kaa benɛ Apolo ya su Akaia a, Mawu gu e nɔ kɛ wo asafo ɔ he wami babauu. <verse eid="ACT 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 18:28" />Ejakaa e kɛ ka ku Yuda bi ɔmɛ a nya la, nɛ e tsɔɔ mɛ ngɛ Ngmami Klɔuklɔu ɔ mi kaa anɔkuale mi ɔ, Yesu ji Mesia a nɛ.<verse eid="ACT 18:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ACT 19" />
  <para style="s1">Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ nami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 19:1" />Benɛ Apolo ngɛ fiɛe ngɛ Korinto ɔ, Paulo ya kpa mahi a nɔ kɛ gu Turkia kɛ ba je Efeso he nɛ e ba na kaseli fuu ngɛ. <verse eid="ACT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 19:2" />Nɛ e bi mɛ ke, “Anɛ nyɛ na Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ benɛ nyɛ he Manye Munyu ɔ ye ɔ lo?” A ha heto ke, “Wa li nɔ́ nɛ o ngɛ tsɔɔe ɔ. Mɛni ji Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ?”<verse eid="ACT 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 19:3" />Paulo bi mɛ ekohu ke, “Lɛɛ mɛni nyɛ ke nyɛ he ye, be mi nɛ a ngɛ nyɛ baptisie ɔ?” Nɛ a de lɛ ke, “Nɔ nɛ Yohane Baptisilɔ ɔ tsɔɔ ɔ.” <verse eid="ACT 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 19:4" />Paulo ya nɔ nɛ e de mɛ ke, Yohane Baptisilɔ ɔ fiɛ tsui tsakemi, nɛ lɔ ɔ se ɔ, nihi nɛ a baptisi mɛ ɔ, a he Yesu, nɔ nɛ Yohane wo si kaa e maa ba ngɛ e se ɔ nɔ nɛ a ye.<verse eid="ACT 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 19:5" />Benɛ a nu munyu nɛ ɔ nɔuu nɛ a ha nɛ a baptisi mɛ kɛ wo Nutsɔ Yesu biɛ mi. <verse eid="ACT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 19:6" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Paulo kɛ e nine pue a nɔ, nɛ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ ba a nɔ, nɛ a tu gbi slɔɔtohi nɛ a gba. <verse eid="ACT 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 19:7" />Nɛ nyumu ɔmɛ tsuo a hiɛmi maa pee nyɔngma kɛ enyɔ.<verse eid="ACT 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 19:8" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Paulo je kɛ ho kpe he ɔ ya nɛ e ya fiɛ Manye Munyu ɔ paa nyɔhiɔ etɛ sɔuu. E tsɔɔ mɛ níhi nɛ kɔɔ Mawu Matsɛyemi ɔ he. Nɛ e slɔ mɛ kaa a he Yesu nɔ nɛ a ye. <verse eid="ACT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 19:9" />Se a ti ni komɛ bui lɛ tue, nɛ a tu munyu yayahi kɛ si Kristo. Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, Paulo kpa fiɛmi ɔ ngɛ lejɛ ɔ. Nɛ e kɛ e kaseli ɔmɛ si mɛ kɛ ho kaselɔ ko nɛ a tsɛɛ lɛ ke Tirano ɔ ngɔ ya nɛ e ya fiɛɛ ngɛ e ni tsɔɔmi he ɔ daa ligbi. <verse eid="ACT 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 19:10" />Paulo fiɛ ngɛ Tirano ni tsɔɔmi he ɔ jeha enyɔ sɔuu. Nɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ ngɛ Turkia zugba a nɔ, Yuda bi ɔmɛ kɛ Hela bi ɔmɛ tsuo nu Mawu Munyu ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 19:11" />Nɛ Mawu ha Paulo he wami nɛ e kɛ tsu nyakpɛ nihi fuu. <verse eid="ACT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 19:12" />E ba mi kaa ke a ngɔ e klala duku loo e tade hɛ mi hami bo tete kɛ fɔ hiɔtsɛ loo nɔ ko nɛ mumi yayami ngɛ e mi nɔ ɔ, e naa he wami aloo mumi yayami ɔ jeɔ e mi.<verse eid="ACT 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 19:13" />Jamɛ a be ɔ mi ɔ, Yuda bi wɔtsɛ komɛ hu ngɛ si kpae nɛ a ngɛ mumi yayamihi hiae ngɛ nihi a mi. Nɛ a pee a juɛmi kaa a maa ngɔ Yesu biɛ kɛ ka mumi yayami ɔmɛ hiami nɛ a hyɛ ha. Nɔ́ nɛ a susu nɛ a ma de ji, “I ngɛ mo fae ngɛ Yesu, nɔ nɛ he munyu nɛ Paulo ngɛ fiɛe ɔ biɛ mi kaa o je kpo!” <verse eid="ACT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 19:14" />Yuda no osɔfo Sikeva bihi kpaago ji nihi nɛ ngɛ kikɛmɛ a ni nɛ ɔ tsue. <verse eid="ACT 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 19:15" />Se benɛ a ka mumi yayami hiami ngɛ nyumu ko mi ɔ, mumi yayami ɔ de mɛ ke, “I le Yesu, nɛ i le Paulo hulɔ. Se nyɛɛ lɛɛ mɛnɔmɛ ji nyɛ?” <verse eid="ACT 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 19:16" />Kɛkɛ nɛ mumi yayamitsɛ ɔ tu ma a ti nihi enyɔ a nɔ nɛ e plaa mɛ nɛ e pee mɛ butuu. Kɛkɛ nɛ a tu fo kɛ a he gu kɛ je kpo ngɛ we ɔ mi.<verse eid="ACT 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 19:17" />Munyu nɛ ɔ gbɛ fia ngɛ Efeso zugba a nɔ tsuo nɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ kɛ Hela bi ɔmɛ tsuo nu he, nɛ a ye gbeye, nɛ a wo Nutsɔ Yesu biɛ ɔ hɛ mi nyami babauu.<verse eid="ACT 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18-19" style="v" sid="ACT 19:18-19" />Enɛ ɔ ha nɛ kunya tsuli ɔmɛ nɛ ba bɔni Mawu jami ɔ ba nɛ a ba jaje a ni peemi ni ɔmɛ kɛ tsɔɔ. Nɛ a ngɔ a womi ɔmɛ kɛ a sɛbɛ ɔmɛ kɛ ba nɛ a sa mɛ kɛ la ngɛ ma nɔ. Benɛ a bu womi ɔmɛ a nya a, a na kaa a maa su sidi akpe nyɔngma. <verse eid="ACT 19:18-19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 19:20" />Enɛ ɔ tsɔɔ bɔ nɛ Mawu Munyu ɔ ye kunimi ngɛ Turkia zugba a nɔ ha.<verse eid="ACT 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Basabasa te si ngɛ Efeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 19:21" />Benɛ a pee nɔ́ nɛ ɔmɛ se ɔ, Paulo to e yi mi ngɛ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ demi nya kaa e sa nɛ e ya gu Makedonia kɛ Akaia kɛ ba Yerusalem. Nɛ e de ke, “Enɛ ɔ se ɔ, e sa nɛ ma ya Roma.” <verse eid="ACT 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 19:22" />E tsɔ Timoteo kɛ Erasto nɛ ji e he piɛli enyɔ ɔmɛ nɛ a sɛ e hlami kɛ ho Makedonia ya, nɛ lɛ nitsɛ lɛɛ e hi Asia be bɔɔ ko.<verse eid="ACT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 19:23" />Jamɛ a be ɔ mi nɔuu ɔ, pɛ agbo ko ba Efeso kaseli ɔmɛ a kpɛti. <verse eid="ACT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 19:24" />Ejakaa Demetrio, sika hiɔ he galɔ ko bɔ gali apaa nɛ a ngɔ sika hiɔ kɛ pee wɔ tsuhi kɛ ha Hela bi a wɔ nɛ a tsɛɛ ke Diana a. <verse eid="ACT 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 19:25" />Nɛ Demetrio tsɛ e ni tsuli ɔmɛ kɛ ni kpahi nɛ tsuɔ jamɛ a ni tsumi ɔ eko ɔ kpe nɛ e de mɛ ke, “Anyɛmimɛ, nyɛ le kaa wa ga ni tsumi nɛ ɔ mi nɛ wa naa sika kɛ jee. <verse eid="ACT 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 19:26" />Se kaa bɔ nɛ nyɛ le momo ɔ, kikɛmɛ a Paulo nɛ ɔ puɛ nihi fuu a tue ke amagahi nɛ a kɛ nine pee ɔ, a pi mawuhi. Enɛ ɔ ha nɛ wa ni tsumi ɔ ngɛ si gbee, tsa pi ngɛ Efeso hiɛ ɔ kɛkɛ, se ngɛ zugba a nɔ tsuo. <verse eid="ACT 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 19:27" />Tsa pi wa ni tsumi ɔ nɛ ngɛ si gbee ɔ kɛkɛ nɛ he wa ha mi, se mohu be maa su nɛ Diana we ɔ kɛ Diana biɛ tete maa laa kulaa ngɛ Asia zugba nɔ kɛ je ɔ he fɛɛ he nɛ a jaa lɛ ngɛ ɔ.”<verse eid="ACT 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 19:28" />Benɛ a nu kikɛmɛ a munyu nɛ ɔ, a na abofu nɛ a de kɛ ngmlaa ke, “Efeso bi a Diana a ngɛ he wami agbo!”<verse eid="ACT 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 19:29" />Amlɔ ɔ nɔuu nɛ ma a mi pee gidigidi, nɛ ma asafo nɛ bua a he nya a nu Paulo he piɛli nɛ je Makedonia nɛ a tsɛɛ mɛ ke Gaio kɛ Aristarko ɔ kɛ ho nɔ́ hyɛmi he ɔ ya konɛ a ya kojo mɛ. <verse eid="ACT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 19:30" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Paulo hla kaa e maa sɛ nɔ́ hyɛmi he ɔ ngɛ ni ɔmɛ a kpɛti, se kaseli ɔmɛ kplɛɛ we lɛ. <verse eid="ACT 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 19:31" />Nɛ ja a nɔuu nɛ e huɛ Roma nikɔtɔma komɛ hu tsɔ kɛ ba slɔ lɛ ke e kó ya asafo ɔ kpɛti, ejakaa e ma sake e he lo kɛ fɔ he.<verse eid="ACT 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 19:32" />Jehanɛ ɔ ni ɔmɛ bɔni ngmlaa kpami kɛkɛ, nɛ a kpɛti nɔ ko li nɔ́ nɛ e nyɛmi ngɛ dee. Lejɛ ɔ kulaa pee basabasa, nɛ a ti nihi hiɛhiɛɛ li nɔ́ nɛ he je tete nɛ a ba lejɛ ɔ ngɛ.<verse eid="ACT 19:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 19:33" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Yuda bi komɛ yo Aleksandro ngɛ asafo ɔ kpɛti nɛ a tsitsɛɛ e yi se kɛ ba ni ɔmɛ a hɛ mi. Aleksandro wo e nine nɔ nɛ e ka kaa e maa tu munyu; <verse eid="ACT 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 19:34" />se benɛ asafo ɔ na le kaa Yuda no ji lɛ ɔ, a kpa ngmlaa ngmlɛfia enyɔ sɔuu nɛ a de ke, “Efeso bi a Diana a ngɛ he wami agbo!”<verse eid="ACT 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 19:35" />Benɛ ma womi ngmalɔ ɔ ha nɛ a pee dii ɔ, e de mɛ ke, “Anyɛmimɛ Efeso bi, nyɛ ti nɔ tsuaa nɔ le kaa Efeso ji ma nɔ he nɛ a jaa Diana nɛ e foni je hiɔwe kɛ ba wa ngɔ ɔ ngɛ. <verse eid="ACT 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 19:36" />Nɛ akɛnɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ le enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, nɔ́ ko nɛ ko dɔ nyɛ, nɛ nyɛɛ pee gidigidi ke nɔ ko tu munyu ko kɛ si lɛ. <verse eid="ACT 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 19:37" />Se nimli nɛ ɔmɛ nɛ nyɛ nu kɛ ba hiɛ ɔ, a jui nɔ́ ko ngɛ Diana we ɔ, nɛ a pee we musu bɔmi nɔ́ ko hu kɛ si we lɛ. <verse eid="ACT 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 19:38" />Nɛ ke ji Demetrio kɛ gali ɔmɛ a kɛ nimli nɛ ɔmɛ na sane ko tete ɔ, lɛɛ kojomi he ɔmɛ ngɛ ni tsue amlɔ nɛ ɔ. Nɛ e sa kaa nyɛɛ kɛ mɛ nɛ ya konɛ a ya kojo mɛ ngɛ mlaa nya nɔuu. <verse eid="ACT 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 19:39" />Se ke munyu kpa komɛ a he i ɔ, lɛɛ Ma Kpe ɔ ma nyɛ maa hyɛ mi nɛ a dla. <verse eid="ACT 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 19:40" />Ejakaa wa ma na sane agbo ke Roma amlaalo ɔ ma tsɛ wɔ ke wa ba je wa nya ngɛ mwɔnɛ ɔ gidigidi nɛ ba nɛ ɔ he ɔ, i li bɔ nɛ ma je nya kɛ ha. Ejakaa e sɛ kaa kikɛmɛ a gidigidi nɛ ɔ baa.”<verse eid="ACT 19:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 19:41" />Kɛkɛ nɛ e gbɛ kpe ɔ nɛ e wo mɛ blɔ.<verse eid="ACT 19:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ACT 20" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 20:1" />Benɛ gidigidi ɔ nya ma si ɔ, Paulo tsɛ kaseli ɔmɛ kɛ kpe nɛ e fiɛ kɛ tsɔɔ mɛ, nɛ e kɛ mɛ ye sɛ, nɛ e si mɛ kɛ ho Akaia ya. <verse eid="ACT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 20:2" />Se loko ji Paulo ya su Akaia a, e fiɛ ngɛ mahi nɛ ngɛ blɔ nɔ ɔ a mi. <verse eid="ACT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 20:3" />E hi Akaia nyɔhiɔ etɛ, se akɛnɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ to e he ga nɛ a maa gbe lɛ benɛ e ngɛ hlae nɛ e ya Siria a, e tsake blɔ ɔ kɛ ya gu Makedonia yi nɔ.<verse eid="ACT 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 20:4" />Nɛ nihi fuu piɛ e he kɛ ba su Asia. Nimli nɛ ɔmɛ ji Sopatre nɛ je Beroia nɛ e tsɛ ji Pirho ɔ, kɛ Tesalonika bi enyɔ nɛ a tsɛɛ mɛ ke Aristarko kɛ Sekundo, kɛ Gaio nɛ je Derbe, kɛ Timoteo, kɛ Tihiko kɛ Trofimo nɛ a ji Asia bi nɛ kpale kɛ yaa a je ngɛ Turkia a. <verse eid="ACT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 20:5" />Nimli nɛ ɔmɛ sɛ wa hlami nɛ a ya ngɛ wɔ mlɛe ngɛ Troia. <verse eid="ACT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 20:6" />Se benɛ a gbe Hebemi gbijlɔ ɔ nya a, wa sɛ lɛ ngɛ Filipi ngɛ Hela zugba a yi nɔ blɔ. Nɛ wa ye ligbi enuɔ ngɛ wo ɔ nɔ loko ji wa ya su Troia ngɛ Turkia, nɛ wa hi lejɛ ɔ otsi.<verse eid="ACT 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eutiko si nɔmi ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 20:7" />Benɛ Hɔgba su nɛ wa kpe ngɛ Nutsɔ Niye ni he ɔ, Paulo tu munyu kɛ tsɔɔ mɛ kɛ ya si nyɔ mi kpɛti, ejakaa e maa hia blɔ e nɔ jena. <verse eid="ACT 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 20:8" />A su kanehi fuu ngɛ hiɔwe tsu ɔ nɔ he nɛ wa kpe ngɛ ɔ, nɛ lejɛ ɔ tsuo tsɔ. <verse eid="ACT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 20:9" />Nɛ e ba mi kaa benɛ Paulo ngɛ munyu ɔ tue ɔ, mahe nɔ niheyo ko nɛ a tsɛɛ lɛ ke Eutiko ɔ nɔ. E hii si ngɛ siaudo etɛ ɔ saflɛ ɔ nya. Kɛkɛ nɛ e je lejɛ ɔ ba nɔ si nɛ e gbo.<verse eid="ACT 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 20:10" />Amlɔ ɔ nɔuu nɛ Paulo kple si nɛ e ya bu e nɔ, nɛ e fua lɛ kɛ wo e gugue mi nɛ e de asafo ɔ ke, “Nyɛ ko ye tsui, wami ngɛ e mi.” <verse eid="ACT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 20:11" />Kɛkɛ nɛ a kpale kɛ ho sãu ɔ nɔ ya nɛ a ya ye Nutsɔ Niye ni ɔ. Nɛ Paulo tsa e fiɛmi ɔ nɔ kɛ ya si makɛ he loko ji e si mɛ. <verse eid="ACT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 20:12" />A wo niheyo ɔ kɛ ho nɛ e ngɛ hɛ ngmle, nɛ a bua jɔ a he saminya.<verse eid="ACT 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 20:13" />Wa sɛ lɛ kɛ sɛ hlami nɛ waa kɛ Paulo ya kpe ngɛ Aso, ejakaa lɛɛ e gu nane. <verse eid="ACT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 20:14" />Benɛ Paulo ba na wɔ ngɛ Aso ɔ, waa kɛ lɛ tsuo wo lɛ kɛ ba Mitilene. <verse eid="ACT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 20:15" />Wa hia kɛ je Mitilene nɛ e nɔ jena a, wa ba su Kio. Nɛ e nɔ jena ekohu ɔ, wa ba su Samo, nɛ e nɔ je nɛ pa na a, wa ba Mileto.<verse eid="ACT 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo kɛ Efeso bi ye sɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 20:16" />Jehanɛ ɔ, Paulo pee e juɛmi kaa e be wae ngɛ Efeso, ejakaa e ngɛ esɔ yee nɛ e ya su Yerusalem mla ngɛ Pentekoste ligbi ɔ he je. <verse eid="ACT 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 20:17" />Se benɛ wa ba su Mileto ɔ, e ha nɛ a ya tsɛ Efeso asafo nikɔtɔma amɛ nɛ a kɛ lɛ ba kpe.<verse eid="ACT 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 20:18" />Nɛ e de mɛ ke, “Nyɛ tsuo nyɛ le kaa kɛ je benɛ ye nane ma Asia zugba a nɔ́ kɛ ba si piɔ ɔ, <verse eid="ACT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 20:19" />i tsu Nutsɔ ɔ ni tsumi ɔ kɛ he si bami kɛ dengme gbomi. I na amanehluhi kɛ gu klamahi nɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ tsɔ nɛ a kɛ gbe mi ɔmɛ a mi. <verse eid="ACT 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 20:20" />Se kɛ ɔ, i hyɛ we ye se, nɛ i laa we nyɛ nɔ́ ko hulɔ, se mohu i de nyɛ nɔ́ nɛ ji anɔkuale ɔ ngɛ ma nɔ kɛ nyɛ wehi a mi. <verse eid="ACT 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 20:21" />Nɛ sɛ kake too ji nɔ́ nɛ i hɛɛ kɛ ha Yuda bi ɔmɛ kɛ ma je li tsuo, kaa mɛ kulaa a kpale ngɛ a yayami ɔmɛ a se, nɛ a he Nutsɔ Yesu Kristo nɔ nɛ a ye, konɛ a ba Mawu ngɔ.<verse eid="ACT 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 20:22" />Amlɔ nɛ ɔ, Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ ngɛ mi blɔ tsɔɔe kɛ yaa Yerusalem, nɛ i li nɔ́ nɛ ma ya ba ye nɔ ngɛ lejɛ ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 20:23" />Se mohu Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ ha nɛ i nu sisi kaa ngɛ ma fɛɛ ma mi ɔ, nɔ́ nɛ fɔɔ si ha mi ji tsu womi kɛ nɔ́ nami. <verse eid="ACT 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 20:24" />Se nami ko be ye wami he ke ji i kɛ tsu we ni tsumi nɛ Nutsɔ Yesu to kɛ ha mi ɔ, kaa ma fiɛ Mawu mi jɔmi kɛ e suɔmi Manye Munyu ɔ kɛ tsɔɔ ni kpahi ɔ.<verse eid="ACT 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 20:25" />Amlɔ nɛ ɔ hu i le kaa nyɛ nihi nɛ i nyɛɛ nyɛ kpɛti kɛ fiɛ Mawu Matsɛyemi ɔ he sane ɔ, nyɛ be ye hɛ mi nae hu. <verse eid="ACT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 20:26" />Nɛ i ngɛ nyɛ dee ke i be nyɛ ti nɔ́ ko muɔ he tue gblami tlooe, <verse eid="ACT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 20:27" />ejakaa i laa we nyɛ nɔ́ ko. I de nyɛ Mawu sɛ ɔ tsuo pɛpɛɛpɛ.<verse eid="ACT 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 20:28" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, nyɛɛ hyɛ saminya; nɛ nyɛ kpaka Mawu to ɔmɛ nɛ ji asafo ɔ nɛ e he kɛ e muɔ nɛ he jua wa a, ejakaa Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ ma bi a ti nɔ nɛ maa laa a si ngɛ nyɛ de. <verse eid="ACT 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 20:29" />Nɛ i le pɛpɛɛpɛ kaa ke i si nyɛ se ɔ, lakpa tsɔɔli maa ba nyɛ ngɔ kaa ogbetee awi yeli nɛ a be nyɛ ti nɔ ko mɔbɔ nae. <verse eid="ACT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 20:30" />Nyɛ ti ni komɛ tete ma plɛ anɔkuale ɔ hɛ mi ngɔ bu si bɔ nɛ pee nɛ a na se nyɛɛli. <verse eid="ACT 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 20:31" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, nyɛɛ pee klaalo, nɛ nyɛ kai kaa jeha etɛ sɔuu nɛ i kɛ nyɛ ba hi si, nɛ i gbo nyɛ he dengme nyɔ kɛ pia, kɛ e mi amanehlu slɔɔtohi nɛ i na ngɛ nyɛ he.<verse eid="ACT 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 20:32" />Nɛ jehanɛ ɔ, i ngɛ nyɛ toe kɛ ngɛ Mawu kɛ e dloomi munyu ɔ nɛ haa nɛ nɔ hemi kɛ yemi pii si ɔ dɛ woe, konɛ e ha nyɛ gbosi níhi nɛ e to kɛ ha nihi nɛ e hla kɛ ha e he ɔmɛ.<verse eid="ACT 20:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 20:33" />Sika loo tade nɛ ngɛ fɛu ko he hia we mi hyɛ gblee, <verse eid="ACT 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 20:34" />nɛ nyɛ nitsɛmɛ nyɛ le kaa ye nine nɛ ɔ nɔuu nɛ i kɛ tsu ni kɛ lɛ ye he kɛ nihi nɛ piɛ ye he ɔ tete. <verse eid="ACT 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 20:35" />Nɛ i kɛ nɔ́ nɛ ɔmɛ tsɔɔ nyɛ kaa ja a nɛ e sa nɛ a tsu ni nɛ a kɛ ye kɛ bua ohiafohi, ejakaa i kai Nutsɔ Yesu munyu nɛ e tu ɔ ke, ‘Jɔɔmi ngɛ nɔ́ hami mi pe e hemi.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 20:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 20:36" />Benɛ Paulo nya nɔ si ɔ, e kpla si nɛ e kɛ mɛ sɔle, <verse eid="ACT 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 20:37" />nɛ a fo ya saminya. A fua lɛ nɛ a kɛ lɛ ye se. <verse eid="ACT 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 20:38" />Nɛ aywilɛho nu mɛ nɛ a hao, ejakaa e de mɛ ke a be lɛ nae hu. Kɛkɛ nɛ a ya je lɛ blɔ ngɛ lɛ ɔ mi.<verse eid="ACT 20:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ACT 21" />
  <para style="s1">Paulo nyagbe Yerusalem yami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 21:1" />Benɛ waa kɛ Efeso asafo nikɔtɔma amɛ ye se gbe nya a, wa sɛ lɛ kɛ ba Koo. E no jena a, wa je Koo kɛ ba Rodo, nɛ wa je lejɛ ɔ hu kɛ ba Patara. <verse eid="ACT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 21:2" />Nɛ wa ba sɛ lɛ ko ngɛ lejɛ ɔ nɛ yaa Foinike ngɛ Siria zugba a nɔ. <verse eid="ACT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 21:3" />Wa na Kipro wo kpɔ ɔ paa mohu, se wa po lɛ ngɔ fɔ wa muɔ nɔ je, nɛ wa ya wa ngɛ Tiro lɛ dami he ɔ ngɛ Siria zugba a nɔ, nɛ a ba je tlomi ngɛ lejɛ ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 21:4" />Wa kple si nɛ wa ya hla kaseli nɛ ngɛ Tiro ɔmɛ a se blɔ, nɛ wa hi a ngɔ otsi kake. Nɛ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ de kɛ gu a nɔ nɛ a de Paulo ke e ko ya Yerusalem. <verse eid="ACT 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 21:5" />Otsi ɔ nyagbe ɔ, Tiro kaseli ɔmɛ kɛ a yihi kɛ a bimɛ kulaa ba je wɔ blɔ ngɛ lɛ dami he ɔ. Benɛ waa kɛ mɛ sɔle gbe nya a, wa ye sɛ. <verse eid="ACT 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 21:6" />Wa sɛ lɛ ɔ nɛ mɛ hu a kpale a se.<verse eid="ACT 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 21:7" />Jehanɛ ɔ, wa ya wa ngɛ Pitolemai nɛ wa ya nga kaseli nɛ ngɛ ma a mi ɔ, nɛ wa ye ligbi kake ngɛ a ngɔ, <verse eid="ACT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 21:8" />loko wa je kɛ ho Kaisarea ya nɛ wa ya to Filipo nɛ ji Mawu Munyu fiɛlɔ, kɛ nimli kpaago nɛ a hla kɛ to nihi a nya a, a ti nɔ kake ɔ ngɔ. <verse eid="ACT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 21:9" />Filipo ngɛ biyiwi eywiɛ nɛ gba we, nɛ Mawu mumi ngɛ a mi nɛ a naa ni.<verse eid="ACT 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 21:10" />Benɛ wa ye be saii ngɛ Kaisarea a, Yuda no gbalɔ ko nɛ a tsɛɛ lɛ ke Agabo ɔ je Yudea kɛ ba, <verse eid="ACT 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 21:11" />nɛ e ba slaa wɔ. Kɛkɛ nɛ Agabo ba wo Paulo mlɛ mi fimi nɔ́ ɔ nɛ e kɛ fi lɛ nitsɛ e ninehi kɛ e nanehi nɛ e de ke, “Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ ngɛ dee ke, ‘Kikɛ ɔ nɔuu nɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ ma ya fi mlɛ mi fimi nɔtsɛ nɛ ɔ ngɛ Yerusalem nɛ a kɛ lɛ ma ha Roma bi ɔmɛ.’ ” <verse eid="ACT 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 21:12" />Kikɛmɛ a munyu nɛ ɔ ngɔɛ wa nya. Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, waa kɛ lejɛ ɔ kaseli ɔmɛ kpa Paulo pɛɛ nɛ e ko hia nane kɛ ya Yerusalem.<verse eid="ACT 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 21:13" />Se Paulo he nɔ nɛ e de ke, “Mɛni he je nɛ nyɛ ngɛ ya foe kɛ ngɛ ye tsui yee kikɛ ɔ? I dla ye he, pi kɛ ha tsu nɛ a maa wo mi ngɛ Yerusalem ɔ kɛkɛ, se mohu kɛ ha gbenɔ tete nɛ i ma gbo ngɛ Nutsɔ Yesu biɛ ɔ he.” <verse eid="ACT 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 21:14" />Benɛ wa na kaa Paulo muɔ e yi mi kpɔ nɛ e bui wa slɔmi ɔ tue ɔ, wa ngmɛɛ e he nɛ wa de ke, “A pee nɔ́ nɛ Nutsɔ ɔ suɔ.”<verse eid="ACT 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 21:15" />Kɛkɛ nɛ wa fi wa tlomi ɔmɛ nɛ wa pue Yerusalem blɔ. <verse eid="ACT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 21:16" />Kaisarea kaseli ɔmɛ a ti ni komɛ piɛ wa he kɛ ba su Yerusalem, nɛ wa ya to Mason nɛ ji kekleekle kaseli ɔmɛ a ti nɔ kake nɛ je Kipro ɔ ngɔ. <verse eid="ACT 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 21:17" />Nɛ Yerusalem kaseli ɔmɛ tsuo ba nya wa he saminya.<verse eid="ACT 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 21:18" />E nɔ jena a, Paulo kɛ wɔ piɛ e he nɛ wa ya nga Yakobo kɛ Yerusalem asafo ɔ nikɔtɔma amɛ. <verse eid="ACT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 21:19" />Benɛ wa nga mɛ se ɔ, Paulo bɔ mɛ nihi babauu nɛ Mawu tsu ngɛ ma je li ɔmɛ a kpɛti kɛ gu e nɔ ɔ.<verse eid="ACT 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 21:20" />A je Mawu yi se a de Paulo ke, “Suɔlɔ anyɛmi, o le, Yuda bi abɔ he Manye Munyu ɔ ye, se mohu a ngmɛɛ we a mlaa amɛ kɛ a kusumi ɔmɛ a he. <verse eid="ACT 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 21:21" />A ba de Yuda bi nɛ he ye ngɛ Yerusalem ɔ ke o sume Mose mlaa amɛ kɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ a kusumi ɔmɛ; nɛ o bɔ mɛ kɔkɔ hulɔ kaa a ko wo a bimɛ nyumu mi. <verse eid="ACT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 21:22" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, kɛ wa ngɛ pee kɛɛ? Ejakaa a maa nu he kaa o ba.<verse eid="ACT 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 21:23" />Wa maa suɔ nɛ waa wo mo ga nɛ ɔ. Wa ngɛ nyumuhi eywiɛ ngɛ hiɛmɛ nɛ ɔ nɛ dla a he nɛ a ma kpa a yi nɛ a kã kita komɛ. <verse eid="ACT 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 21:24" />Kɛ mɛ nɛ ya Sɔlemi We ɔ nɛ mohu o ya kpa o yi ɔ nɛ o wo hiɔ ha mɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 21:24">Enɛ ɔ ma ha nɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ na kaa o de we Yuda bi ɔmɛ a ti nihi nɛ he ye ɔ kaa a ko ye a kusumi kɛ a mlaa amɛ a nɔ. Ejakaa mo nitsɛ tete o yeɔ a mlaa amɛ a nɔ.<verse eid="ACT 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 21:25" />Se ma je li nɛ he ye ɔmɛ lɛɛ wa de we mɛ ke a ye Yuda bi ɔmɛ a kusumi ɔmɛ a nɔ, pe níhi nɛ wa ngma mɛ ɔ, kaa a ko ye wɔ nya niye ni kɛ lohwehi nɛ a ki a kuɛ; nɛ a ko bɔ ajuama hulɔ.”<verse eid="ACT 21:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 21:26" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Paulo kplɛɛ a ga womi ɔ nɔ, nɛ e nɔ jena a, e kɛ ni ɔmɛ ho ya tsukɔ a he nɛ a sɛ Sɔlemi We ɔ. Enɛ ɔ tsɔɔ kaa a gbe he tsukɔmi be ɔmɛ a nya nɛ e piɛ bɔ sami nɛ a maa sa kɛ ha a ti nɔ tsuaa nɔ ngɛ ligbi kpaago ɔ se. <verse eid="ACT 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 21:27" />Se benɛ e piɛ bɔɔ nɛ ligbi kpaago ɔ maa su ɔ, Yuda bi komɛ nɛ je Turkia a ba na lɛ ngɛ Sɔlemi We ɔ, kɛkɛ nɛ a sɔ kɛ wo e he nɛ a nu lɛ. <verse eid="ACT 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 21:28" />A kpa ngmlaa nɛ a de ke, “Nyɛ ba ye kɛ bua wɔ, Israel bi! Nyɛ nɛ nyumu ɔ nɛ ngɛ fiɛe ngɛ he fɛɛ he ke a ko bu wa ma a kɛ wa mlaa amɛ ɔ ngɛ hiɛ ɔ! E tuɔ musu bɔmi munyu kɛ siɔ Sɔlemi We ɔ nɛ e kɛ ma je li tete baa Sɔlemi We ɔ nɛ e ba woɔ Sɔlemi We ɔ he mu.” <verse eid="ACT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 21:29" />A po Paulo nya ja, ejakaa a na e kɛ Trofimo, ma je no nɛ je Efeso ngɛ Turkia jamɛ a ligbi ɔ ngɛ ma a mi, nɛ a susu kaa Paulo kɛ lɛ ya Sɔlemi We ɔ.<verse eid="ACT 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 21:30" />Enɛ ɔ ha nɛ ma a mi tsuo pee gidigidi nɛ a nu Paulo nɛ a sa lɛ kɛ je kpo ngɛ Sɔlemi We ɔ nɛ a ngmɛ Sɔlemi We ɔ agbo ɔmɛ a mi amlɔ nɔuu. <verse eid="ACT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 21:31" />Nɛ e ba mi kaa benɛ a ngɛ hlae nɛ a gbe lɛ ɔ, Roma asafoatsɛ nɔkɔtɔma a nu he kaa Yerusalem tsuo pee gidigidi. <verse eid="ACT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 21:32" />Amlɔ ɔ nɔuu nɛ e je sojahi kɛ asafoatsɛmɛ nɛ a wo fo kɛ ya sɛ asafo kpɛti. Nɛ benɛ ni ɔmɛ na soja amɛ ɔ, kɛkɛ nɛ a jɔɔ Paulo gbemi. <verse eid="ACT 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 21:33" />Asafoatsɛ nɔkɔtɔma a nu lɛ nɛ e ha nɛ a wo lɛ kɔsɔkɔsɔhi enyɔ. Jehanɛ ɔ, e bi ni ɔmɛ nɔ nɛ e ji, kɛ nɔ́ nɛ e pee. <verse eid="ACT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 21:34" />Se mɛ tsuo a ngɛ ngmlaa kpae nɛ a ngɛ níhi slɔɔtohi dee. Nɛ akɛnɛ asafoatsɛ nɔkɔtɔma a nɛ nɔ́ pɔtɛɛ nɛ a ngɛ dee, nɛ lejɛ ɔ tsuo pee hoo he je ɔ, e ha nɛ a ngɔ Paulo kɛ ya wo mwɔ mi. <verse eid="ACT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 21:35" />Se benɛ a kɛ Paulo su atlakpe ɔ nya a, ni ɔmɛ a gidigidi peemi ɔ nya ba wa. Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, a wo lɛ ngɔ fɔ a konɔ bɔ nɛ pee nɛ ni ɔmɛ a nine nɛ ko su e he. <verse eid="ACT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 21:36" />Se kɛ ɔ, ni ɔmɛ nyɛɛ e se kɛ ngmlaa ke, “A gbe lɛ, a gbe lɛ!”<verse eid="ACT 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 21:37" />Benɛ a kɛ Paulo yaa wo tsu ɔ mi ɔ, e bi asafoatsɛ nɔkɔtɔma a ke, “Anɛ i ngɛ he blɔ nɛ i kɛ mo tuɔ munyu lo?” Enɛ ɔ pee asafoatsɛ nɔkɔtɔma a hɛ mi yaa, nɛ e bi Paulo ke, “Anɛ o nu Hela gbi lo? <verse eid="ACT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 21:38" />Anɛ pi mo ji Mizraim no atuã tsɔlɔ nɛ ba nu awi yeli akpe eywiɛ nɛ o kpaka mɛ kɛ ho nga a nɔ ya be ko nɛ be ɔ mi lo?”<verse eid="ACT 21:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 21:39" />Nɛ Paulo ha lɛ heto ke, “Dabi! Yuda no ji mi, nɛ i je Tarso ngɛ Kilikia ma agbo ko mi. I kpa mo pɛɛ nɛ o ha mi he blɔ nɛ ma tu munyu kɛ tsɔɔ nimli nɛ ɔmɛ.”<verse eid="ACT 21:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo je e nya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 21:40" />Asafoatsɛ nɔkɔtɔma a kplɛɛ nɔ nɛ Paulo da si ngɛ atlakpe ɔ nɔ nɛ e fɔ ni ɔmɛ nine ke a pee dii nɛ a bu lɛ tue. Benɛ lejɛ ɔ jɔ klanaa a, Paulo tu munyu ngɛ Hebri gbi mi nɛ e de ke,<verse eid="ACT 21:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ACT 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 22:1" />“Anyɛmimɛ kɛ tsɛmɛ, nyɛɛ bu mi tue nɛ ma je ye nya.” <verse eid="ACT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 22:2" />Benɛ a nu kaa Hebri gbi nɛ e ngɛ tue ɔ, a pee dii pe kekle ɔ. Nɛ Paulo de mɛ ke, <verse eid="ACT 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 22:3" />“Yuda no ji mi, nɛ a fɔ mi ngɛ Tarso ngɛ Kilikia. Se Yerusalem nɛ a lɛ mi ngɛ, nɛ Gamaliel nane nya nɛ i kase wɔ Yuda bi wa mlaa amɛ kɛ kusumi ɔmɛ ngɛ. Ye he dɔɔ kaa ma wo Mawu hɛ mi nyami kaa bɔ nɛ nyɛ ngɛ pee mwɔnɛ ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 22:4" />I waa Kristo se nyɛɛli ɔmɛ yi mi kɛ ya suu gbenɔ mi. I woɔ nyumuhi kɛ yihi tsuo kpa, nɛ i haa nɛ a woɔ mɛ tsu mi. <verse eid="ACT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 22:5" />Osɔfo Nɔkɔtɔma a loo Ma Kpe ɔ mi no ko ma nyɛ ye ye he odase. Ejakaa i heɔ womi ngɛ a dɛ kɛ yaa Yuda bi ɔmɛ a nikɔtɔma amɛ a ngɔ ngɛ Damasko nɛ a haa mi blɔ nɛ i ya nuu kaseli ɔmɛ ngɛ lejɛ ɔ nɛ i woɔ mɛ kɔsɔkɔsɔ kɛ baa Yerusalem nɛ a ba waa mɛ yi mi.<verse eid="ACT 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 22:6" />Ligbi ko piani benɛ i yaa Damasko ɔ, la nɛ nya wa ko kpɛ kɛ je hiɔwe kɛ bɔle mi tlukaa. <verse eid="ACT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 22:7" />Kɛkɛ nɛ i nɔ si, nɛ i nu gbi ko nɛ bi mi ke, ‘Saulo, Saulo mɛni he je nɛ o ngɛ mi yi mi wae kikɛ ɔ?’<verse eid="ACT 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 22:8" />Nɛ i bi ke, ‘Nutsɔ, mo mɛnɔ nɛ o ngɛ munyu ɔ tue ɔ?’ Nɛ gbi ɔ ha mi heto ke, ‘Ami Yesu Nazaret no ɔ nɛ o ngɛ lɛ yi mi wae ɔ i.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 22:9" />Nihi nɛ a kɛ mi ngɛ nyɛɛe ɔ na la a mohu se a nui nɔ́ nɛ gbi ɔ ngɛ mi dee ɔ sisi.<verse eid="ACT 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 22:10" />Kɛkɛ nɛ i bi ke, ‘Nutsɔ, mɛni ma pee?’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:10">Nɛ Nutsɔ ɔ de mi ke, ‘Tee si nɛ o ya Damasko nɛ a maa tsɔɔ mo nɔ́ nɛ sa nɛ o pee.’<verse eid="ACT 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 22:11" />La a ha nɛ ye hɛ yu, lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, ye he piɛli ɔmɛ kpaka mi kɛ ya su Damasko. <verse eid="ACT 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 22:12" />Benɛ wa ya su Damasko ɔ, nyumu Mawu gbeye yelɔ ko nɛ yeɔ mlaa a nɔ nɛ a tsɛɛ lɛ ke Anania, nɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ ngɛ Damasko ɔ tsuo buu lɛ nɛ a tuɔ e he munyu kpakpa a, <verse eid="ACT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 22:13" />ba ye ngɔ nɛ e ba da si ngɛ ye kasa nya nɛ e de mi ke, ‘Anyɛmi Saulo, o hɛ ngmɛ ɔ nɛ bli!’ Nɛ jamɛ a hɛ ngmɛfia a mi nɔuu ɔ, i bɔni nɔ́ hyɛmi.<verse eid="ACT 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 22:14" />Kɛkɛ nɛ e de mi ke, ‘Wa tsɛmɛ a Mawu ɔ hla mo nɛ o le e suɔmi nya ni, nɛ o na Yiwamihelɔ ɔ, nɛ o nu e gbi. <verse eid="ACT 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 22:15" />O maa fiɛ e munyu ɔ kɛ ya he fɛɛ he, nɛ o jaje nɔ́ nɛ o na a kɛ nɔ́ nɛ o nu ɔ kɛ tsɔɔ. <verse eid="ACT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 22:16" />Nɛ jehanɛ ɔ, mɛni o ngɛ mlɛe? Yaa nɛ a baptisi mo, nɛ a tsukɔ o he nɛ a je o he yayami ɔmɛ, nɛ o tsɛ Nutsɔ ɔ biɛ.’<verse eid="ACT 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 22:17" />Nɛ ligbi ko benɛ i kpale kɛ ba Yerusalem nɛ i ngɛ Sɔlee ngɛ Sɔlemi We ɔ, i pee kaa nɔ ko nɛ nɔ́ nɔ e nɔ, <verse eid="ACT 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 22:18" />nɛ i na ni nami ko, nɛ Mawu de mi ke, ‘O he nɛ sɔ nɛ o si Yerusalem, ejakaa a be ye munyu ɔ nɛ o ngɛ fiɛe ɔ hee maa ye ngɛ hiɛ ɔ.’<verse eid="ACT 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 22:19" />Se i je nya nɛ i de ke, ‘Nutsɔ, a le klɛdɛɛ kaa ami ji nɔ nɛ wo mɛ tsu mi; kɛ nɔ nɛ fiaa nihi nɛ he o nɔ ye ɔmɛ kpa ngɛ kpe he ɔmɛ. <verse eid="ACT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 22:20" />Benɛ a ngɛ o he odase yelɔ Stefano gbee tete ɔ, i ngɛ lejɛ ɔ nɛ ye bua jɔ he, nɛ i bu nihi nɛ ngɛ lɛ gbee ɔmɛ a tadehi a he ha mɛ.’<verse eid="ACT 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 22:21" />Se kɛ ɔ, Mawu de mi ke, ‘Si Yerusalem, ejakaa i ma tsɔ mo tsitsaa he ko ngɛ ma je li ɔmɛ a ngɔ.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 22:22" />Asafo ɔ bu Paulo tue kɛ ba si kikɛmɛ a munyu nɛ ɔ nɛ e tu ɔ nɔ, kɛkɛ nɛ a bɔni ngmlaa kpami ekohu ke, “A wo kikɛmɛ a nɔmlɔ nɛ ɔ kɛ je hiɛ ɔ nɛ a ya gbe lɛ, ejakaa e sɛ nɛ e hii je mi.”<verse eid="ACT 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 22:23" />Benɛ a ngɛ ngmlaa kpae ɔ, a kpɔ a hiɔwe tadehi nɛ a ngɛ mɛ fiae kɛ ngɛ kɔɔhiɔ mi manee nɛ a ngɛ bunyuku woe.<verse eid="ACT 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 22:24" />Kɛkɛ nɛ asafoatsɛ nɔkɔtɔma a kpaka Paulo kɛ ba tsu ɔ mi nɛ e fa ke a fiaa lɛ kpa bɔ nɛ pee nɛ e tu anɔkuale ɔ nɛ e tsɔɔ nɔ́ he je nɛ a ngɛ ngmlaa kpae ja a ngɛ.<verse eid="ACT 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 22:25" />Se benɛ a fi Paulo nɛ a maa ho lɛ kpa a fiami ya a, e bi asafoatsɛ ko nɛ daa si ngɛ lejɛ ɔ ke, “Anɛ nyɛ ngɛ he blɔ ngɛ mlaa nya kaa nyɛ fiaa Roma no kpa benɛ a kojo we lɛ lo?”<verse eid="ACT 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 22:26" />Benɛ asafoatsɛ ɔ nu kaa Roma no ji Paulo ɔ, e ya bi asafoatsɛ nɔkɔtɔma a ke, “Mɛni o ngɛ pee ɔ? Nyumu nɛ ɔ, Roma no i!”<verse eid="ACT 22:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 22:27" />Asafoatsɛ nɔkɔtɔma a ba Paulo ngɔ nɛ e ba bi lɛ ke, “De mi, anɛ Roma no ji mo lo?” Nɛ Paulo ha lɛ heto ke, “Ee, Roma no ji mi.”<verse eid="ACT 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 22:28" />Asafoatsɛ nɔkɔtɔma a de Paulo ke, “Ami hu eko ji mi. I puɛ sika saminya loko ji i plɛ Roma no.” Nɛ Paulo de lɛ ke, “Ami lɛɛ Roma no fɔfɔɛ ji mi.”<verse eid="ACT 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 22:29" />Amlɔ ɔ nɔuu nɛ nihi nɛ pee klaalo nɛ a maa fiaa Paulo kpa a si lejɛ ɔ benɛ a nu kaa Roma no ji lɛ ɔ. Ja a nɔuu nɛ asafoatsɛ nɔkɔtɔma a hu ye gbeye, ejakaa e fa ke a fi Roma no nɛ a fiaa lɛ kpa.<verse eid="ACT 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo ba Kpe Ngua a hɛ mi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 22:30" />E nɔ jena a, asafoatsɛ nɔkɔtɔma a ha nɛ a kplɔ kɔsɔkɔsɔ ɔmɛ ngɛ Paulo he, nɛ e tsɛ osɔfo nikɔtɔma amɛ kɛ ma nikɔtɔma amɛ kpe, nɛ e ha nɛ a wo Paulo kɛ ba da a hɛ mi konɛ a le nɔ́ nɛ wo basabasa a kɛ ba.<verse eid="ACT 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ACT 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 23:1" />Paulo hyɛ Kpe ɔ gaa nɛ e de mɛ ke, “Anyɛmimɛ, i baa ye je mi kɛ juɛmi kpakpa ngɛ Mawu hɛ mi.”<verse eid="ACT 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 23:2" />Paulo nya nɔɛ si nɛ Anania nɛ ji Osɔfo Nɔkɔtɔma a de nihi nɛ daa si ngɛ e kasa nya a ke a gba e nya ma.<verse eid="ACT 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 23:3" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Paulo de Anania ke, “Mo gbogbo nɛ a sa he kalo, Mawu ma gba mo hu ma. Mɛni kojolɔ mimi ji mo nɛ mo nitsɛ o tɔɔ mlaa a nɔ, nɛ o faa kaa a gba ye nya ma kaa kikɛ ɔ?”<verse eid="ACT 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 23:4" />Se nihi nɛ daa si ngɛ Paulo he ɔ de lɛ ke, “Ei! Mawu Osɔfo Nɔkɔtɔma a munyu nya nɛ o ngɛ jee kikɛ ɔ?”<verse eid="ACT 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 23:5" />Paulo ha mɛ heto ke, “Anyɛmimɛ, i li kaa lɛ ji Osɔfo Nɔkɔtɔma a, ejakaa a ngma ngɛ Ngmami Klɔuklɔu ɔ mi ke, ‘Koo tu munyu yaya ko kɛ si ma nɔkɔtɔma ko.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 23:6" />Benɛ Paulo na kaa Saduki bi ɔmɛ kɛ Farisi bi ɔmɛ ji kojoli ɔmɛ ɔ, e kpa ngmlaa nɛ e de ke, “Anyɛmimɛ, Farisi no ji mi, nɛ ye nɛmɛ hu Farisi bi ji mɛ, nɛ nyɛ ngɛ mi kojoe mwɔnɛ ɔ ngɛ hiɛ ɔ? Ejakaa i ke i heɔ yeɔ kaa gbogboehi a si temi ko ngɛ.”<verse eid="ACT 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 23:7" />Enɛ ɔ ha nɛ mi gbami ba Farisi bi ɔmɛ kɛ Saduki bi ɔmɛ a kpɛti. <verse eid="ACT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 23:8" />Ejakaa Saduki bi ɔmɛ tsɔɔ kaa ni gbogboehi a si temi ko be, nɛ Mawu bɔfohi loo mumi ko be neneene wami. Se Farisi bi ɔmɛ lɛɛ a heɔ ni nɛ ɔmɛ tsuo yeɔ.<verse eid="ACT 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 23:9" />Kɛkɛ nɛ nya sami wawɛɛ ko te si ngɛ a kpɛti. Nɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ a kpɛti womi ngmali komɛ fi Paulo se, nɛ a kpa ngmlaa nɛ a de ke, “Wa nɛ yayami ko ngɛ nyumu nɛ ɔ he. Eko piɔ ɔ, mumi ko loo hiɔwe bɔfo ko nɛ e kɛ lɛ tu munyu.”<verse eid="ACT 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 23:10" />Benɛ ngmlaa a nya ba ngɛ wae, nɛ a bɔni Paulo hɛɛmi basabasa a, asafoatsɛ nɔkɔtɔma a ye gbeye kaa e mi ma tsɔ, lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, e ha nɛ soja amɛ ya kpɔ lɛ ngɛ a dɛ, nɛ a kɛ lɛ ya wo tsu mi ekohu.<verse eid="ACT 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 23:11" />Jamɛ a ligbi ɔ nyɔ mi ɔ, Nutsɔ ɔ ba Paulo ngɔ nɛ e ba de lɛ ke, “Paulo! Koo ye gbeye; bɔ nɛ o ye ye he odase ngɛ Yerusalem ɔ, moo ye ye he odase ja a kɛ ngɛ Roma hu.”<verse eid="ACT 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 23:12" />E nɔ jena a, Yuda bi komɛ ka a he kita kaa a be ni yee, nɛ a be nyu hu nue kɛ ya si be nɛ a maa gbe Paulo. <verse eid="ACT 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 23:13" />Nihi nɛ ka a he kikɛmɛ a kita nɛ ɔ a yi maa su nyingmi eywiɛ. <verse eid="ACT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 23:14" />Nɛ a ho ya de osɔfo nikɔtɔma amɛ kɛ ma nikɔtɔma amɛ kita a nɛ a kã a. <verse eid="ACT 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 23:15" />A de mɛ ke, “Nyɛ de asafoatsɛ nɔkɔtɔma a nɛ e kpale Paulo kɛ ba Ma Kpe ɔ hɛ mi ekohu, nɛ nyɛɛ bua de lɛ ke nyɛ ngɛ nɔ́ komɛ nɛ nyɛ ma bi lɛ ekohu, bɔ nɛ pee nɛ waa gbe lɛ ngɛ blɔ ɔ nɔ.”<verse eid="ACT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 23:16" />Se Paulo nyɛmiyo e binyumu ko nu yi mi nɛ a to ɔ he nɛ e ya wo Paulo tue nɔ ngɛ tsu ɔ mi.<verse eid="ACT 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 23:17" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Paulo tsɛ asafoatsɛ ɔmɛ a ti nɔ kake nɛ e de lɛ ke, “Moo kɛ kikɛmɛ a niheyo nɛ ɔ nɛ ya asafoatsɛ nɔkɔtɔma a ngɔ, ejakaa e ngɛ sɛ wawɛɛ ko nɛ e ma de lɛ.”<verse eid="ACT 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 23:18" />Asafoatsɛ ɔ kplɛɛ nɛ e kpaka Paulo tsɔlɔ ɔ kɛ ho asafoatsɛ nɔkɔtɔma a ngɔ ya nɛ e ya de lɛ ke, “Paulo, nɔ nɛ a wo tsu mi ɔ ke ma kpaka niheyo nɛ ɔ kɛ ba o ngɔ nɛ e ba de mo sane ko.”<verse eid="ACT 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 23:19" />Asafoatsɛ nɔkɔtɔma a nu niheyo ɔ nine si kɛ ba se nɛ e bi lɛ ke, “Mɛni sane nɛ o ngɛ hlae nɛ o de mi ɔ?”<verse eid="ACT 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 23:20" />Niheyo ɔ he nɔ nɛ e de lɛ ke, “Hwɔɔ ɔ, Yuda bi ɔmɛ ma bi mo nɛ o ngmɛɛ Paulo he konɛ a kɛ lɛ nɛ ba Kojomi he ɔ ekohu. A maa bua kaa a ma bi e nya mi munyu ko. <verse eid="ACT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 23:21" />Mo ko kplɛɛ, ejakaa a ti nihi pe nyingmi eywiɛ wo ka ngɛ blɔ ɔ he, nɛ a kã kita kaa a be ni yee, nɛ a be nyu tete nue kɛ ya si be nɛ a maa gbe lɛ. Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, o nya kɛkɛ nɛ a ngɛ hyɛe nɛ o kplɛɛ.”<verse eid="ACT 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 23:22" />Benɛ asafoatsɛ nɔkɔtɔma a nu kikɛmɛ a sane nɛ ɔ, e bɔ niheyo ɔ kɔkɔ ke, “Mo ko de nɔ ko kaa o wo sane nɛ ɔ nɔ ta de mi.”<verse eid="ACT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 23:23" />Asafoatsɛ nɔkɔtɔma a tsɛ asafoatsɛhi enyɔ kɛ ba e ngɔ nɛ e fa mɛ ke, “Nyɛ ha nɛ sojahi lafa enyɔ a pee klaalo nɛ a maa ya Kaisarea mwɔnɛ ɔ gbɔkuɛ ngmlɛ nɛɛ. Nɛ nyɛ tsɛ soja akplɔtsɛmɛ lafa enyɔ kɛ okpɔngɔtsɛmɛ hu nyingmi kpaago kɛ piɛ a he kɛ ya. <verse eid="ACT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 23:24" />Nyɛ ha Paulo hu okpɔngɔ nɛ e hi nɔ, nɛ nyɛɛ kɛ lɛ ya ha Amlaalo Felike kɛ manye.”<verse eid="ACT 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 23:25" />Nɛ e ngma womi nɛ ɔ kɛ mane amlaalo ɔ ke,<verse eid="ACT 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 23:26" />“Imi Klaudio Lisia nɛ ngɛ mo Amlaalo Nɔkɔtɔma Felike womi nɛ ɔ ngmae.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 23:26">I ngaa mo!<verse eid="ACT 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 23:27" />Yuda bi ɔmɛ nu kikɛmɛ a nyumu nɛ ɔ nɛ a miɔ nɛ a maa tane e yi, se i ha nɛ soja amɛ ya kpɔ lɛ ngɛ a de. Ejakaa i na le kaa Roma no ji lɛ. <verse eid="ACT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 23:28" />Jehanɛ ɔ, i kɛ lɛ ya a Kojomi he ɔ konɛ ma le nɔ́ nɛ e pee. <verse eid="ACT 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 23:29" />Nɛ i na kaa e pee we nɔ́ ko nɛ sa gbenɔ loo tsu womi, se mɛ nitsɛmɛ a mlaa amɛ a he nɛ a ngɛ e nya poe ngɛ. <verse eid="ACT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 23:30" />I na le hu kaa a ngɛ hlae nɛ a gbe lɛ kokooko. Enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, i tsɔ nɛ a wo lɛ kɛ ba ha mo konɛ e nya poli ɔmɛ nɛ a ba je a nya ngɛ o hɛ mi.”<verse eid="ACT 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 23:31" />Nɛ soja amɛ kɛ Paulo nyɛɛ nyɔnyɔɔnyɔ nɛ a kɛ lɛ ba Antipatri jamɛ a gbɔkuɛ ɔ kaa bɔ nɛ a fa mɛ ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 23:32" />E nɔ jena mɔtu ɔ, a kpale a se kɛ ba he nɛ a wo Paulo tsu mi ngɛ ɔ ekohu, nɛ okpɔngɔtsɛ ɔmɛ kɛ Paulo tsa nɔ kɛ ho Kaisarea ya.<verse eid="ACT 23:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 23:33" />Benɛ a ya su Kaisarea a, a wo Paulo kɛ womi ɔ ya ha amlaalo ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 23:34" />Amlaalo ɔ kane womi ɔ gbe nya pɛ nɛ e bi Paulo he nɛ e je, nɛ Paulo ha heto ke e je Kilikia.<verse eid="ACT 23:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 23:35" />Kɛkɛ nɛ amlaalo ɔ de Paulo ke, “Ke o nya poli ɔmɛ ba su si ɔ, loko ma bu mo tue saminya.” Nɛ e ha nɛ a ya wo lɛ tsu mi ngɛ Matsɛ Herode mwɔ ɔ mi.<verse eid="ACT 23:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ACT 24" />
  <para style="s1">Paulo ngɛ Roma nɔ yeli ɔmɛ i hɛ mi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 24:1" />Ligbi enuɔ se ɔ, Osɔfo Nɔkɔtɔma Anania kɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ a nikɔtɔma amɛ a ti ni komɛ kɛ otsiamɛ ko nɛ a tsɛɛ lɛ ke Tertulo ɔ ba Kaisarea nɛ a ba po Paulo nya. <verse eid="ACT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 24:2" />Benɛ a tsɛ Tertulo nɛ e tu munyu ɔ, e te si nɛ e po Paulo nya ke, “Wa nɔmo Amlaalo, i ngɛ hae nɛ o le kaa o matsɛ yemi ɔ haa nɛ wɔ Yuda bi ɔmɛ hu a buu wa he akɔtaa, nɛ lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, wa ngɛ tue mi jɔmi kɛ bua jɔmi. <verse eid="ACT 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 24:3" />Wa ngɛ mo si nae ngɛ ni nɛ ɔmɛ tsuo a he. <verse eid="ACT 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 24:4" />I kɛ he si bami kɛ pɛɛ kpami ngɛ o hɛ mi fɔe kaa o bu mi tue kpiti kɛkɛ nɛ ma jaje waa kɛ nyumu nɛ ɔ wa kpɛti sane kɛ tsɔɔ mo. <verse eid="ACT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 24:5" />Ejakaa wa na nyumu nɛ ɔ kaa gidigiditsɛ ko, nɛ e ngɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ a tue puɛe ngɛ je ɔ mi he fɛɛ he nɛ a pee basabasa, nɛ a te si kɛ si Roma amlaalo ɔ. Nɛ lɛ ji Nazaret bi ɔmɛ a kuu ko nyatsɛ. <verse eid="ACT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 24:6" />Tsa pi ni nɛ ɔmɛ kɛkɛ, se loko ji wa nu lɛ ɔ, e ngɛ Sɔlemi We ɔ he mu woe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 24:6">Jinɛ wa ko tsu e he ni bɔ nɛ sa, <verse eid="ACT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 24:7" />se Lisia nɛ ji asafoatsɛ nɔkɔtɔma a kpɔ lɛ ngɛ wa dɛ kɛ je, <verse eid="ACT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 24:8" />ke e sa nɛ a kojoɔ lɛ ngɛ Roma mlaa a nya. Nɛ mo nitsɛ o maa na anɔkuale ɔ ke o bi e nya mi.”<verse eid="ACT 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 24:9" />Tertulo nya mɛ si nɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ nɛ ngɛ lejɛ ɔ fi e se nɛ a de ke nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ nɛ e de ngɛ Paulo he ɔ ngɛ mi anɔkuale.<verse eid="ACT 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 24:10" />Kɛkɛ nɛ amlaalo ɔ gba Paulo nine nɛ e je munyuhi nɛ a de ngɛ e he ɔ nya. Nɛ e wo e nya nɔ nɛ e de ke, “Amlaalo, i le kaa o bɔni Yuda zugba a nɔ munyu yemi ɔ pi mwɔnɛ ɔ, nɛ lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, i yi tsui kaa ma je ye nya. <verse eid="ACT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 24:11" />Maa pee mwɔnɛ ɔ ji ligbi nyɔngma kɛ enyɔ nɛ i ba Yerusalem nɛ ma ba ja Mawu ngɛ Sɔlemi We ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 24:12" />I kɛ nɔ ko pee we gidigidi ko ngɛ kpe he ko loo ngɛ ma mi gbɛjegbɛ ko tete nɔ. <verse eid="ACT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 24:13" />Nɛ nimli nɛ ɔmɛ be sane nɛ a po kɛ fɔ ye nɔ nɛ ɔ nya nyɛe maa tsɔɔ.<verse eid="ACT 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 24:14" />Se nɔ́ kake kɛkɛ nɛ ngɛ mi ji, i jaa wa tsɛ ɔmɛ a Mawu ɔ, nɛ i nyɛɛ yi wami hemi blɔ ɔ nɔ. Enɛ ɔ ji nɔ́ nɛ a ngɛ tsɔɔe kaa i ngɛ lakpa tsɔɔmi ko mi ɔ nɛ. I yeɔ Yuda bi ɔmɛ a mlaa amɛ kɛ nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ nɛ a ngma ngɛ gbali ɔmɛ a womi ɔmɛ a mi ɔ nɔ pɛpɛɛpɛ. <verse eid="ACT 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 24:15" />Nɛ ami hu i heɔ yeɔ kaa nimli nɛ ɔmɛ nɔuu, kaa gbogboehi a si temi be maa ba, nɛ dali kɛ yayami peeli tsuo maa te si. <verse eid="ACT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 24:16" />Enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, i gboɔ dengme be fɛɛ be kaa ma hɛɛ he nile kpakpa ngɛ Mawu kɛ nimli kulaa a hɛ mi.<verse eid="ACT 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 24:17" />I hia blɔ jeha babauu ji nɛ, nɛ i kpale kɛ ba Yerusalem kɛ ye dɛ mi sika nɛ i ma kɛ ye kɛ bua Yuda bi ɔmɛ, nɛ ma sã bɔ kɛ ha Mawu. <verse eid="ACT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 24:18" />Jamɛ a be ɔ mi nɛ ye nya poli ɔmɛ na mi ngɛ Sɔlemi We ɔ nɛ i ngɛ bɔ sae. I kpa ye yi ngɛ mlaa a nya. A nɛ asafo ko nɛ ngɛ gidigidi pee ngɛ ye kasa nya. Se mohu Yuda bi komɛ nɛ je Turkia ngɛ Asia a ba lejɛ ɔ, <verse eid="ACT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 24:19" />nɛ mɛ ji nihi nɛ sa nɛ a ba po ye nya ke i pee nɔ́ yaya ko. <verse eid="ACT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 24:20" />Aloo mo bi ni nɛ ɔmɛ nitsɛ po tɔmi nɛ a na ngɛ ye he benɛ a ke mi ya a kojomi he ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 24:21" />Ke ji a na tɔmi ko kulaa a, lɛɛ munyu kake nɛ i kpa ngmlaa ke de ke, ‘Gbogboehi a si temi he odase nɛ i ngɛ yee ɔ he je nɛ nyɛ ngɛ mi kojoe mwɔnɛ ɔ’ ɔ pe.”<verse eid="ACT 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 24:22" />Se akɛnɛ Felike le klɛdɛɛ kaa Kristo se nyɛɛli ɔmɛ pee we gidigidi ɔ, e tsiɛ munyu ɔ kɛ to nɛ e de Yuda bi ɔmɛ ke a mlɛ nɛ soja amɛ a nɔkɔtɔma Lisia nɛ ba konɛ a ye sane ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 24:23" />E ha nɛ a kpale Paulo kɛ ya wo tsu mi ekohu, se e de e he buli ɔmɛ ke a ko nyɛ lɛ nɔ́ ko he, nɛ a ha he blɔ nɛ e huɛmɛ nɛ a ba slaa lɛ nɛ a ke lɛ ni. A ko ha nɛ e na nɔ́.<verse eid="ACT 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 24:24" />Be saii se ɔ, Felike kɛ e yo Drusila nɛ ji Yuda no ɔ ba nɛ a ha a tsɛ Paulo kɛ ba a ngɔ nɛ e ba tsɔɔ mɛ nɔ́ nɛ hemi kɛ yemi ngɛ Yesu Kristo mi ɔ tsɔɔ. <verse eid="ACT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 24:25" />Se benɛ Paulo ngɛ mɛ dami kɛ he nɔ yemi kɛ kojomi nɛ maa ba a he munyu tue ɔ, Felike ye gbeye nɛ e de lɛ ke, “Moo ya lolo, ke i na deka a, ma tsɛ mo ekohu.”<verse eid="ACT 24:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 24:26" />Felike pɔɔ Paulo tsɛmi kpitikpiti kɛ ni sɛɛmi, ejakaa e ngɛ blɔ hyɛe kaa Paulo maa wo e nya mi nɔ́ nɛ e ngmɛɛ e he. <verse eid="ACT 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 24:27" />Enɛ ɔ ya nɔ jeha enyɔ sɔuu, nɛ Porkio Festo ba ye Felike nane mi. Akɛnɛ Felike suɔ kaa e sa Yuda bi ɔmɛ a hɛ mi he je ɔ, e si Paulo ngɛ tsu ɔ mi.<verse eid="ACT 24:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ACT 25" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 25:1" />Nɛ e ba mi kaa benɛ Festo ba ye Felike nane mi ngɛ Kaisarea ligbi etɛ se ɔ, e ya slaa Yerusalem. <verse eid="ACT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 25:2" />Osɔfo nikɔtɔma amɛ kɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ a nikɔtɔma amɛ ya po Paulo nya kɛ ha lɛ; <verse eid="ACT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 25:3" />nɛ a kpa lɛ pɛɛ kaa e ha nɛ a kɛ Paulo nɛ ba Yerusalem. Ejakaa a pee a juɛmi kaa a maa wo ka nɛ a gbe lɛ ngɛ blɔ ɔ nɔ. <verse eid="ACT 25:3" /><verse number="4-5" style="v" sid="ACT 25:4-5" />Se Festo de mɛ ke, akɛnɛ Paulo ngɛ tsu mi ngɛ Kaisarea, nɛ lɛ nitsɛ hu e se be kɛe ngɛ Yerusalem ɔ he je ɔ, e maa suɔ nɛ e kɛ a nikɔtɔma amɛ nɛ a ho Kaisarea ya konɛ a ya ye Paulo sane ɔ ngɛ lejɛ ɔ.<verse eid="ACT 25:4-5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo kojomi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 25:6" />Benɛ Festo ye ligbi kpaanyɔ loo nyɔngma se ɔ, e kpale e se kɛ ba Kaisarea, nɛ e nɔ jena nɔ ɔ, e tsɛ Paulo munyu ɔ.<verse eid="ACT 25:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 25:7" />Benɛ Paulo ba su kojomi he ɔ, Yuda bi ɔmɛ nɛ je Yerusalem ɔ ba bua a he nya nɛ a po e nya gbeyegbeye. Se a nyɛ we e nya pomi ɔmɛ a nya nɛ a tsɔɔ. <verse eid="ACT 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 25:8" />Nɛ Paulo de ke nya pomi ɔmɛ be mi. E de ke, “I yi fɔ, ejakaa i tɔ we Yuda bi ɔmɛ a mlaa ko nɔ, nɛ i wui Sɔlemi We ɔ he mu, nɛ i tsɔ we Roma amlaalo ɔ a hɛ mi atuã.”<verse eid="ACT 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 25:9" />Se akɛnɛ Festo ngɛ hlae nɛ e pee Yuda bi ɔmɛ a suɔmi nya ni he je ɔ, e bi Paulo ke, “Anɛ o suɔ kaa ma ya kojo mo ngɛ Yerusalem lo?”<verse eid="ACT 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 25:10" />Paulo ha lɛ heto ke, “Dabi. Ma suɔ nɛ a kojo mi ngɛ amlaalo ngua a nitsɛ hɛ mi. Mo nitsɛ o le klɛdɛɛ kaa i yi fɔ. <verse eid="ACT 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 25:11" />Nɛ ke i pee nɔ́ ko nɛ sa gbenɔ ɔ, i kua we ke a ko gbe mi. Se ke i yi fɔ ɔ, mo loo nɔ ko be he blɔ nɛ e ngmɛɛ ye he kɛ haa nimli nɛ ɔmɛ ke a ya gbe mi. Ma suɔ nɛ Kaisare nɛ ye ye sane ɔ.”<verse eid="ACT 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 25:12" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Festo kɛ e ga woli ɔmɛ ya kpe yi nɛ e ba ha Paulo heto ke, “Si abɔ nɛ o kɛ sane ɔ ha Kaisare ɔ, Kaisare ngɔ nɔuu o maa ya.” <verse eid="ACT 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 25:13" />Be bɔɔ se ɔ, Matsɛ Agripa kɛ e nyɛmiyo ko nɛ a tsɛɛ lɛ ke Bernike ɔ ba slaa Festo. <verse eid="ACT 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 25:14" />Benɛ a ye be saii ɔ, Festo bɔ matsɛ ɔ Paulo sane ɔ. E de lɛ ke, “Felike wo nyumu ko tsu mi ngɛ hiɛ ɔ nɛ e si e sane ɔ ha mi nɛ ma kojo. <verse eid="ACT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 25:15" />Nɛ benɛ i ya Yerusalem ɔ, osɔfo nikɔtɔma amɛ kɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ a nikɔtɔma amɛ a ti ni komɛ bɔ mi e he amaniɛ, nɛ a de mi ke ma tane e yi. <verse eid="ACT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 25:16" />Se i ha nɛ a le kaa Roma mlaa ngmɛ we blɔ kaa a buu nɔ ko fɔ benɛ a kojo we lɛ. Se mohu a kɛ nɔ nɛ pee tɔmi ɔ yaa kojomi he nɛ e ya jeɔ e nya ngɛ nihi nɛ wo e he munyu ɔ a hɛ mi.<verse eid="ACT 25:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 25:17" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, benɛ a ba su hiɛ ɔ nɛ a ba ye sane ɔ, i tsɛ munyu ɔ nɔuu e nɔ jena, nɛ i ha nɛ a kɛ Paulo ba kojomi he ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 25:18" />Se munyuhi nɛ i susu kaa a kɛ maa wo e he ɔ, e nya poli ɔmɛ kɛ ekoeko bɛ. <verse eid="ACT 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 25:19" />A po e nya ngɛ mɛ nitsɛmɛ a jami kɛ nɔ ko nɛ a tsɛɛ lɛ ke Yesu nɛ e gbo, se Paulo ngɛ nɔ mi mae ke e gbo we ɔ he. <verse eid="ACT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 25:20" />I nɛ bɔ nɛ ma kojo jamɛ a munyu ɔ kɛ ha. Nɛ i bi Paulo ke e maa suɔ nɛ a ya kojo e munyu ɔ ngɛ Yerusalem lo? <verse eid="ACT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 25:21" />Paulo kplɛɛ we, nɛ e je sane ɔ ke Kaisare nɛ e ya ye ha lɛ. Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ i ha nɛ a kpale lɛ kɛ ya wo tsu ɔ mi kɛ ya si be nɛ i ma ngɔ lɛ kɛ ya ha Kaisare.”<verse eid="ACT 25:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 25:22" />Nɛ Agripa de Festo ke, “Ma suɔ nɛ ami nitsɛ ma nu e nya mi gbi.” Festo ha lɛ heto ke, “Ma ha nɛ o bu lɛ tue hwɔɔ.”<verse eid="ACT 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 25:23" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, benɛ je na a, Agripa kɛ Bernike dla a he saminya, nɛ asafoatsɛmɛ kɛ ma nikɔtɔma amɛ piɛ a he kɛ ba kojomi he ɔ konɛ a ba bu Paulo tue. Nɛ Festo ha a ya kpaka Paulo kɛ ba kojomi he ɔ.<verse eid="ACT 25:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 25:24" />Festo tu munyu kɛ je sisi nɛ e de tue buli ɔmɛ ke, “Matsɛ Agripa kɛ nyɛ nihi tsuo nɛ nyɛ ngɛ hiɛ ɔ, nyumu nɛ ɔ ji nɔ nɛ Yuda bi ngɛ ma nɛ ɔ mi kɛ Yerusalem ngɛ e gbenɔ hlae ɔ nɛ. <verse eid="ACT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 25:25" />Ami lɛɛ i nɛ kaa e pee nɔ́ ko nɛ sa gbenɔ. Nɛ akɛnɛ lɛ nitsɛ e bi nɛ Kaisare nɛ ye e munyu ɔ he je ɔ, i be nɔ́ ko nɛ ma de. I kɛ lɛ ma ya ha lɛ. <verse eid="ACT 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 25:26" />Se akɛnɛ i nɛ nya pomi titli ko ngɛ e he ɔ, mɛni ma ngma kɛ piɛ e he kɛ ya ha Kaisare? Enɛ ɔ he nɛ i kɛ lɛ ba nyɛ hɛ mi ngɛ, titli ɔ, mo Matsɛ Agripa, konɛ o hyɛ e sane ɔ ha nɛ o wo mi ga ngɛ nɔ́ nɛ sa kaa ma ngma a he. <verse eid="ACT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 25:27" />Ejakaa e sɛ kaa a kɛ nɔ ko nɛ a nu lɛ maneɔ Kaisare nɛ a tsɔɔ we nɔ́ nɛ e pee ɔ.”<verse eid="ACT 25:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ACT 26" />
  <para style="s1">Paulo fa e he</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 26:1" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Agripa de Paulo ke, “A ha mo blɔ, moo jaje o sane ɔ.” Paulo je nine nɛ e de ke,<verse eid="ACT 26:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 26:2" />“Matsɛ Agripa, ye he ngɛ ni kaa i na he blɔ nɛ i ma je ye nya ngɛ o hɛ mi. <verse eid="ACT 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 26:3" />Ejakaa i le kaa o le Yuda bi ɔmɛ a mlaa kɛ kusumi ɔmɛ kɛ pi si. Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, i kpa mo pɛɛ nɛ o bu mi tue kɛ tsui si tomi.<verse eid="ACT 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 26:4" />Kaa bɔ nɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ le ɔ, i na Yuda bi a tsɔsemi kɛ je ye jokuɛ mi ngɛ Tarso nɛ ji ye ma mi, kɛ Yerusalem. Nɛ i yeɔ tsɔsemi nɛ ɔmɛ a nɔ pɛpɛɛpɛ. <verse eid="ACT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 26:5" />Ke a maa tu anɔkuale ɔ, a ma de kaa imi ji Farisi no nɛ yeɔ Yuda bi ɔmɛ a mlaa kɛ kusumi ɔmɛ a nɔ veveeve. <verse eid="ACT 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 26:6" />Se anɔkuale mi ɔ, nɔ́ nɛ he nɛ a ngɛ ye nya poe ngɛ ji kaa i ngɛ si nɛ Mawu wo wa tsɛmɛ ɔ blɔ hyɛe. <verse eid="ACT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 26:7" />Kikɛmɛ a si womi nɛ ɔ nɔuu nɔ nɛ Israel wɛtso nyɔngma kɛ enyɔ ɔmɛ hu ngɔ a hɛ kɛ fɔ nɛ a ngɛ Mawu jae nyɔ kɛ pia konɛ a nine nɛ su nɔ. Oo Matsɛ! Enɛ ɔ ji musu nɛ a ke i bɔ nɛ a ngɛ ye nya poe. <verse eid="ACT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 26:8" />Anɛ musu bɔmi sane ji kaa nɔ ko ma de ke e ngɛ hemi kɛ yemi ngɛ gbogboehi a si temi mi lo? Anɛ nyɛ he we yi kaa Mawu ma nyɛ tle gbogboehi si kɛ je gbeje lo?<verse eid="ACT 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 26:9" />Be ko nɛ be ɔ, ye hemi kɛ yemi ji kaa ma pee Yesu, Nazaret no ɔ se nyɛɛli ɔmɛ nihi nɛ sɛ. <verse eid="ACT 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 26:10" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, osɔfo nikɔtɔma amɛ ha mi he wami nɛ i wo ni klɔuklɔuhi fuu tsu mi ngɛ Yerusalem, nɛ i piɛɛ a he nɛ a buu mɛ gbenɔ fɔ. <verse eid="ACT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 26:11" />I nu Kristo se nyɛɛli ɔmɛ a he godo. I nyɛɛ a se kɛ yaa mahimahi a nɔ, nɛ i ya nuu mɛ, nɛ i waa mɛ yi mi bɔ nɛ pee nɛ a tu musu bɔmi munyu kɛ si Kristo.<verse eid="ACT 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12-13" style="v" sid="ACT 26:12-13" />E ba mi kaa ligbi ko piani katakata benɛ osɔfo nikɔtɔma amɛ ha mi he blɔ nɛ i pue nɔ kɛ yaa Damasko ngɛ kikɛmɛ a ni tsumi nɛ ɔ nɔuu he ɔ, la ko nɛ nya wa pe pu kpɛ kɛ je hiɔwe kɛ ba bɔle i kɛ nihi nɛ piɛ ye he ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 26:12-13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 26:14" />Kɛkɛ nɛ wɔ tsuo wa nɔ si, nɛ i nu gbi ko nɛ ngɛ mi dee ngɛ Hebri gbi mi ke, ‘Saulo, Saulo, mɛni he je nɛ o ngɛ mi yi mi wae? O ngɛ mo nitsɛ o he awi yee.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 26:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 26:15" />“Nɛ i bi ke, ‘Nutsɔ, mo mɛnɔ i?’ Nɛ Nutsɔ ɔ ha heto ke, ‘Ami Yesu, nɔ nɛ o ngɛ lɛ yi mi wae ɔ i. <verse eid="ACT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 26:16" />Moo te si nɛ o da si, ejakaa i je ye he kpo kɛ tsɔɔ mo bɔ nɛ pee nɛ ma pee mo ye tsɔlɔ kɛ ye he odase yelɔ. O ma de je ɔ níhi nɛ o na nɛ ɔ, kɛ ní kpahi nɛ ma je ke tsɔɔ mo ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 26:17" />Ma bu o he kɛ je mo nitsɛ o ma mi bi ɔmɛ kɛ je mi bi ɔmɛ a dɛ. I ma tsɔ mo kɛ ya ma jeli ɔmɛ a ngɔ, <verse eid="ACT 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 26:18" />nɛ o ma ya bli a hɛ ngmɛ, konɛ a tsake a tsui nɛ a kpale ngɛ abosiami diblii ɔ mi kɛ ba Mawu la a he nɛ a ngɔ a he yayami ɔmɛ kɛ ke mɛ, nɛ a nine nɛ su Mawu gbosi ni nɛ e to kɛ ha nihi kulaa nɛ a tsukɔ a he kɛ je a he yayami ɔmɛ a mi ɔ nɔ. Nihi nɛ a hemi kɛ yemi nɛ a ngɛ ngɛ ye mi he je ɔ, a ngɔ mɛ kɛ to banee ɔ.’<verse eid="ACT 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 26:19" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, Matsɛ Agripa, i gbo we kikɛmɛ a hiɔwe ni nami nɛ a je kpo kɛ tsɔɔ mi nɛ ɔ nɔ tue. <verse eid="ACT 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 26:20" />I fiɛ Manye Munyu ɔ ngɛ Damasko kekle loko i pue nɔ kɛ ho Yerusalem ya. I ya gu Yudea zugba a nɔ kɛ ba su ma je li ɔmɛ a ngɔ, nɛ i tsɔɔ kaa a kpale ngɛ a yayami ɔmɛ a se nɛ a ba Mawu ngɔ. Nɛ a tsu ni tsumi kpakpahi nɛ maa tsɔɔ kaa a tsake a tsui. <verse eid="ACT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 26:21" />Enɛ ɔ he je nɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ nu mi ngɛ ngɛ Sɔlemi We ɔ nɛ a miɔ nɛ a tane ye yi. <verse eid="ACT 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 26:22" />Se Mawu bu ye he nɛ i ngɛ wami mi kɛ ba si mwɔnɛ ɔ nɛ i ngɛ nɔ́ nɛ ɔmɛ a he odase yee kɛ ngɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ tsɔɔe, nikɔtɔmahi kɛ jokuɛwi tsuo. I tsɔɔ we tsɔɔmi kpa ko pe níhi nɛ gbali ɔmɛ kɛ Mose de ke, <verse eid="ACT 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 26:23" />Kristo maa na amanehlu nɛ e maa pee kekle no nɛ maa te si kɛ je gbeje, nɛ e kɛ la maa ba ha Yuda bi kɛ ma je li tsuo ɔ.”<verse eid="ACT 26:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 26:24" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Festo kpa ngmlaa si kake nɛ e de ke, “Paulo, o ngɛ godo nue. Womi kasemi sɔuu ha nɛ o yi mi ngɛ puɛe!”<verse eid="ACT 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 26:25" />Paulo he nɔ nɛ e de lɛ ke, “Amlaalo Festo, tsa pi godo nɛ i ngɛ nue, anɔkuale munyu nɛ i ngɛ tue. <verse eid="ACT 26:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 26:26" />Matsɛ Agripa le kikɛmɛ a sane nɛ ɔmɛ tsuo. Nɛ i he ye kaa a kɛ eko laa we lɛ, ejakaa tsa pi diblii mi nɛ a pee nɔ́ nɛ ɔmɛ ngɛ. <verse eid="ACT 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 26:27" />Matsɛ Agripa, tse o heɔ gbali ɔmɛ yeɔ? I le kaa o heɔ mɛ yeɔ.”<verse eid="ACT 26:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 26:28" />Paulo nya nɔɛ si nɛ Agripa de lɛ ke, “Anɛ o susu kaa munyu bɔɔ nɛ ɔ nɛ o tu ɔ kɛkɛ ma tsake mi ngɔ pee Kristo se nyɛɛlɔ lo?”<verse eid="ACT 26:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 26:29" />Nɛ Paulo ha lɛ heto ke, “I na nɛ Mawu ha nɛ e ba mi ja, kaa e piɛ bɔɔ jio, e piɛ fuu jio, pi mo kɛkɛ, se nihi kulaa nɛ ngɛ mi tue bue mwɔnɛ nɛ ɔ hu a pee kaa ami, se pi nɛ a wo mɛ kɔsɔkɔsɔ.”<verse eid="ACT 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 26:30" />Kɛkɛ nɛ matsɛ ɔ kɛ amlaalo ɔ kɛ Bernike kɛ ni kpa amɛ tsuo te si nɛ a je. <verse eid="ACT 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 26:31" />Pee se ɔ, a ya kpe yi nɛ a ma nya si kaa, “Nyumu nɛ ɔ pee we nɔ́ ko nɛ sa nɛ a bu lɛ gbenɔ fɔ loo a wo lɛ tsu mi.”<verse eid="ACT 26:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 26:32" />Nɛ Agripa de Festo ke, “Kaa e ngɔɛ munyu ɔ kɛ ya ha we Kaisare jinɛ a ko ngmɛɛ e he.”<verse eid="ACT 26:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ACT 27" />
  <para style="s1">A wo Paulo kɛ ho Roma ya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 27:1" />Benɛ a ma nya si kaa a kɛ wɔ maa nyɛɛ wo hɛ mi kɛ ya Roma a, a ngɔ Paulo kɛ ni kpahi fuu nɛ a wo mɛ tsu mi ɔ kɛ wo amlaalo ɔ he buli ɔmɛ a ti nɔ kake nɛ a tsɛɛ lɛ ke Yulio ɔ dɛ mi. <verse eid="ACT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 27:2" />Wa sɛ Adramitio lɛ ko nɛ a to kaa e ya da ngɛ Asia wo nya ma amɛ a mi ɔ. Nɛ Aristako nɛ ji Makedonia no ko nɛ je Tesalonika a piɛ wa he.<verse eid="ACT 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 27:3" />E nɔ jena a, wa ba su Zidon, nɛ akɛnɛ Yulio mi jɔ kɛ ha Paulo he je ɔ, e hɛɛ lɛ saminya. E ha lɛ he blɔ nɛ e kple si kɛ ya ma a mi nɛ e ya slaa e huɛmɛ. <verse eid="ACT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 27:4" />Benɛ wa hia ngɛ Zidon ɔ, wa kpee kɔɔhiɔ agbo ko, nɛ lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, wa ya gu Kipro yi nɔ ngɛ wo kpɔ ɔ he. <verse eid="ACT 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 27:5" />Wa be ngɛ Kilikia kɛ Pamfilia wo nya ma amɛ a nya loko wa ba da si ngɛ Mira ngɛ Likia zugba a nɔ. <verse eid="ACT 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 27:6" />Lejɛ ɔ nɛ wa asafoatsɛ ɔ na Miztaim lɛ ko nɛ je Aleksandria kɛ yaa Italia, nɛ e kɛ wɔ wo mi. <verse eid="ACT 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 27:7" />Wa hi wo ɔ hɛ mi be saii, ejakaa wo ɔ he wa, nɛ beble loko ji wa ba su Kido wo kpo ɔ he. Akɛnɛ kɔɔhiɔ ɔ nya wa he je ɔ, wa gu Kreta wo kpo ɔ he kɛ ba su Salmone, <verse eid="ACT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 27:8" />nɛ wa hɛɛ mi hluu kɛ ba su he ko nɛ a tsɛɛ ke Lesida he kpakpa ngɛ Lasea kasa nya. <verse eid="ACT 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 27:9" />Wa ba hi lejɛ ɔ be saii, se loloolo ɔ, wo ɔ he wa ha blɔ gaga hiami, nɛ hwɔ hami be ɔ hu be momo. Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, Paulo wo lɛ ɔ mi ni tsuli ɔmɛ ga.<verse eid="ACT 27:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 27:10" />E de mɛ ke, “Anyɛmimɛ, i he ye kaa wa maa na nɔ́ wawɛɛ ke wa hia ngɛ hiɛ ɔ. Nɛ e maa ba mi tete kaa tsa pi lɛ ɔ kɛkɛ nɛ ma mu, se tlomi ɔmɛ hu maa laa nɛ gbenɔ tete maa je mi.” <verse eid="ACT 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 27:11" />Se asafoatsɛ ɔ nɛ ngɛ a he bue ɔ he lɛ kudɔlɔ ɔ kɛ lɛtsɛ ɔ ye pe Paulo. <verse eid="ACT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 27:12" />Nɛ akɛnɛ fiɛ ngɛ yee wawɛɛ jamɛ a be ɔ mi, nɛ Lesida he kpakpa a pi he ko nɛ sa nɛ a yeɔ fiɛ be ngɛ he je ɔ, lɛ ɔ mi ni tsuli ɔmɛ a ti nihi fuu ma nya si kaa a nyɛɛ wo kpo ɔ he dɔdɔɔdɔ kɛ ya Foinike nɛ a ya ye fiɛ be ɔ ngɛ lejɛ ɔ. Ejakaa a ngɛ lɛ dami he kpakpa ko ngɛ lejɛ ɔ, nɛ e jɔ mi blɔ pu si nɔmi he je, kɛ e wo mi blɔ pu si nɔmi he je pɛ ji e hehi nɛ fɔɔ si paa.<verse eid="ACT 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 27:13" />Jamɛ a be ɔ mi nɔuu ɔ, wo mi blɔ kɔɔhiɔ ko bɔni fiami blɛuu nɛ e pee kaa nɔ́ nɛ je mi ma tsɔ. Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, a hia nɛ a nyɛɛ wo kpo ɔ he.<verse eid="ACT 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14-15" style="v" sid="ACT 27:14-15" />A hia e kɛ we nɛ kɔɔhiɔ nya wawɛ ko nɛ a tsɛɛ ke jɔ mi blɔ pu si temi he je kɔɔhiɔ ba te nɛ e fia lɛ ɔ kɛ ho wo ɔ nɔ je ya. A bɔ mɔde nɛ a kudɔ lɛ ɔ kɛ ba wo kpo ɔ he blɔ, se a nyɛ we, nɛ a ngmɛɛ e he ha kɔɔhiɔ ɔ nɛ e kudɔ lɛ.<verse eid="ACT 27:14-15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 27:16" />Nyagbe mi ɔ, kɔɔhiɔ ɔ fia lɛ ɔ kɛ ba je zugba kpɔ nyafii ko nɛ wo bɔle lɛ nɛ a tsɛɛ lɛ ke Klaudia a se je, nɛ wa gbo dengme loko ji wa nine su boto ɔ nɛ a muɔ si ngɛ lɛ ɔ se je ɔ nɔ. <verse eid="ACT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 27:17" />Jehanɛ ɔ, wa wo kpahi kɛ fi lɛ ɔ. Se akɛnɛ lɛ ɔ mi ni tsuli ɔmɛ ngɛ gbeye yee kaa a ma ya sa si ngɛ zia nɔ he je ɔ, a gbe hiɔwe abalaa amɛ konɛ kɔɔhiɔ ɔ nɛ kudɔ lɛ ɔ.<verse eid="ACT 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 27:18" />E nɔ jena benɛ kɔɔhiɔ ɔ nya wa kɛ sa a, a bɔni tlomi ɔ nɔ jemi kɛ wo ɔ mi puemi. <verse eid="ACT 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 27:19" />E nɔ ligbi etɛ ɔ nɔ ɔ, a je lɛ ɔ mi nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ nɛ a nine su nɔ ɔ kɛ pue he. <verse eid="ACT 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 27:20" />Benɛ wa ye ligbi babauu ngɛ wo ɔ nɔ, nɛ loloolo kɔɔhiɔ ɔ nya pui nɛ wa nɛ pu loo dodoe ɔ, wa hɛ nɔ kami kulaa ba ta.<verse eid="ACT 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 27:21" />Wa kpɛti nɔ ko yi ni be saii, nɛ Paulo tsɛ lɛ ɔ mi ni tsuli ɔmɛ kɛ kpe nɛ e de mɛ ke, “Anyɛmimɛ, e ji nyɛ bu mi tue nɛ wa mlɛ ngɛ Lesida he kpakpa a jinɛ amanehlu nɛ ɔ ko bɛ wa nɔ. <verse eid="ACT 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 27:22" />Se kɛ ɔ, nyɛ na tsui, ejakaa ke lɛ ɔ mu tete po ɔ, wa ti nɔ tsuaa nɔ yi ma na wami.<verse eid="ACT 27:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 27:23" />I ngɛ nyɛ enɛ ɔ dee, ejakaa ye Mawu ɔ nɛ i ngɛ jae ɔ tsɔ e bɔfo ko kɛ ba ye ngɔ nyɔ nɛ ɔ mi, <verse eid="ACT 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 27:24" />nɛ e ba de mi ke, ‘Paulo, koo ye gbeye, ejakaa a maa kojo mo ngɛ Kaisare hɛ mi kokooko! Nɛ nɔ́ nɛ pe kulaa ji, Mawu bu o pɛɛ kpami ɔ tue, nɛ e ma he nɔ tsuaa nɔ yi wami ngɛ lɛ ɔ mi.’ <verse eid="ACT 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 27:25" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, nyɛ na tsui. Ejakaa i heɔ Mawu yeɔ kaa e maa ye e gbi ɔ nɔ. <verse eid="ACT 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 27:26" />Se bɔ fɛɛ bɔ nɛ pee ɔ, lɛ ɔ ma ya butu ngɛ zugba kpɔ ko nɛ wo bɔle lɛ ɔ nɔ.”<verse eid="ACT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 27:27" />Benɛ kɔɔhiɔ ɔ kɛ wɔ ngɛ yae nɛ e kɛ wɔ ngɛ bae ngɛ Adria wo ɔ nɔ ɔ, ligbi nɛ ji nyɔngma kɛ eywiɛ ɔ nɔ nyɔ mi ɔ, lɛ hluili ɔmɛ na kaa wa su kpo he ta. <verse eid="ACT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 27:28" />A fɔ nɔ́ susumi kpa a nɛ a na kaa lejɛ ɔ kuɔmi ji nane kami lafa kɛ nyingmi enyɔ. Nɛ wa nyɛɛ bɔɔ se ɔ, a susu nyu ɔ mi kuɔmi ekohu nɛ a na nane kami nyingmi nɛɛ. <verse eid="ACT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 27:29" />Enɛ ɔ ha nɛ a na kaa wa su kpo he ta. Se akɛnɛ e peeɔ mɛ kaa tɛ ngua komɛ ngɛ wo ɔ nya blɔ he je ɔ, a fɔ osɛkɛhi eywiɛ ngɛ lɛ ɔ se blɔ nɛ a bɔni je nanɛɛ mlɛmi.<verse eid="ACT 27:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 27:30" />Jehanɛ ɔ, lɛ hluili ɔmɛ a ti ni komɛ pee a juɛmi kaa a maa tu fo kɛ je lɛ ɔ he. A je boto ɔ nɛ a pee kaa nɔ́ nɛ a yaa fɔ osɛkɛ ngɛ lɛ ɔ yi blɔ. <verse eid="ACT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 27:31" />Kɛkɛ nɛ Paulo de asafoatsɛ ɔ kɛ soja amɛ ke, “Nyɛ tsuo nyɛ yi maa ta ke nyɛ je lɛ ɔ mi.” <verse eid="ACT 27:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 27:32" />Nɛ soja amɛ po kpa amɛ nɛ a kɛ fi lɛ ɔ, nɛ lɛ ɔ ya nɔ si.<verse eid="ACT 27:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 27:33" />Benɛ je mi ngɛ tsɔe ɔ, Paulo kpa mɛ tsuo pɛɛ nɛ a ye nɔ́ ko. E de mɛ ke, “Mwɔnɛ ɔ ji otsi enyɔ sɔuu nɛ nyɛ ti nɔ ko yi nɔ́ ko. <verse eid="ACT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 27:34" />I ngɛ nyɛ pɛɛ kpae nɛ nyɛɛ ye nɔ́ ko bɔ nɛ pee nɛ nyɛ yi nɛ na wami. Ejakaa nyɛ ti nɔ ko yi bwɔmi kake tete be laae!”<verse eid="ACT 27:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 27:35" />Nɛ Paulo wo abolo nɛ e sɔle kɛ na Mawu si ngɛ mɛ tsuo a hɛ mi, nɛ e ku eko nɛ e ye. <verse eid="ACT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 27:36" />Amlɔ ɔ nɔuu ɔ, nɔ tsuaa nɔ hɛ mi tsɔ lɛ nɛ a bɔni ni ɔ yemi. <verse eid="ACT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 27:37" />Wa yi bɔ ngɛ lɛ ɔ mi ji lafa enyɔ kɛ nyingmi kpaago kɛ ekpa. <verse eid="ACT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 27:38" />Benɛ lɛ hluili ɔmɛ ye ni ɔ ta a, a je blɛfo nɛ a wo ɔ tsuo kɛ pue wo ɔ mi bɔ nɛ pee nɛ lɛ ɔ nɛ pee huyɛhuyɛ bɔɔ.<verse eid="ACT 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lɛ ɔ butumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 27:39" />Benɛ je na a, a nɛ wo ɔ nya blɔ; a na wo ɔ nya kpɔ mi he ko nɛ zia fuu ngɛ. Nɛ a pee a juɛmi kaa a maa bɔ mɔde nɛ a kudɔ lɛ ɔ kɛ nyɛɛ tɛ ɔmɛ a kpɛ kɛ ya lejɛ ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 27:40" />Kɛkɛ nɛ a po osɛkɛ ɔmɛ, nɛ a ngmɛɛ a he kɛ wo wo ɔ mi. A pine akɔfa kpa amɛ nɛ a kɛ kudɔɔ lɛ ɔ; a si hɛ mi abalaa a, nɛ a pue wo ɔ nya blɔ. <verse eid="ACT 27:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 27:41" />Se lɛ ɔ ya sa si ngɛ kewu nɔ ngɛ he ko nɛ wo enyɔ kpe ngɛ, nɛ e yi blɔ pu. E supa je kpo nɛ oslɔke ɔmɛ ngɛ lɛ fiae musumusu nɛ e bɔni ywiami.<verse eid="ACT 27:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 27:42" />Nɛ soja amɛ ye gbeye kaa ni ɔmɛ nɛ a ngɛ kpakae kɛ yaa a, a ti ni komɛ ma wu nyu nɛ a maa ma fo. Enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, a wo asafoatsɛ ɔ ga kaa e ha nɛ a gbe mɛ. <verse eid="ACT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 27:43" />Se akɛnɛ Yulio nɛ ji asafoatsɛ ɔ suɔ nɛ e he Paulo yi wami he je ɔ, e kplɛɛ we mɛ. E de nihi nɛ le nyu wumi ɔ nɛ a wu nyu kɛ ho kpo ya, <verse eid="ACT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 27:44" />konɛ nihi nɛ piɛ ɔmɛ a bu gbegbelihi kɛ lɛ kokoe ɔmɛ a nɔ kɛ ya nu kpo. Nɛ a ti nɔ tsuaa nɔ ya nu kpo kɛ manye.<verse eid="ACT 27:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ACT 28" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 28:1" />Benɛ wa ya nu kpo ɔ, e yi be ko nɛ wa na le kaa Melita wo kpɔ ɔ he ji he nɛ wa ba je. <verse eid="ACT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 28:2" />Lejɛ ɔ bi ɔmɛ pee wɔ nubwɔ saminya. A slɛ la ha wɔ nɛ wa hlui, ejakaa fie ngɛ yee nɛ hiɔmi ngɛ nɛe hulɔ.<verse eid="ACT 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 28:3" />E ba mi kaa benɛ Paulo ya ngɛ lɛ nya buae kɛ ba wo la a mi ɔ, sinɔ duɔtsɛ ko nɛ la fie lɛ ɔ tu nɛ e koklo kɛ wo e kɔni he. <verse eid="ACT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 28:4" />Benɛ lejɛ ɔ bi ɔmɛ na nɛ sinɔ ɔ kpla Paulo kɔni he ɔ, a de a he ke, “Awi yelɔ agbo ko ji nyumu nɛ ɔ. E ngɛ mi kaa e je wo ɔ mi slɔkee lɛɛ, se oslaa tɛ e he, nɛ e yi be wami nae.”<verse eid="ACT 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 28:5" />Se Paulo huanya sinɔ ɔ kɛ wo la a mi nɛ e yi lɛ awi ko. <verse eid="ACT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 28:6" />Ni ɔmɛ le kaa Paulo he ma bɔni fuumi aloo e maa nɔ si nɛ e ma gbo tlukaa. Se nɛ a hyɛ blɔ hluu nɛ jamɛ a nɔ́ ko pee we lɛ ɔ, a tsake a juɛmi nɛ a de ke jemɛ a wɔ ko ji lɛ.<verse eid="ACT 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 28:7" />Lejɛ ɔ amlaalo nɛ a tsɛɛ lɛ ke Publio ɔ po we ngɛ he nɛ wa ya nu kpo ngɛ ɔ kasa mi. E he wɔ atuu nɛ e baa wa yi ligbi etɛ sɔuu. <verse eid="ACT 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 28:8" />Se e ba mi kaa asla kɛ muklii mi pa ngɛ nɔ́ dee ha Publio tsɛ, nɛ Paulo ya sɔle ha lɛ nɛ e kɛ e nine pue e nɔ nɛ e tsa lɛ. <verse eid="ACT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 28:9" />Benɛ zugba kpɔ ɔ nɔtsɛmɛ na kaa Paulo tsa Publio tsɛ ɔ, hiɔtsɛhi tsuo nɛ ngɛ lejɛ ɔ ba e ngɔ nɛ e tsa mɛ. <verse eid="ACT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 28:10" />Enɛ ɔ ha nɛ a wo wa hɛ mi nyami. Nɛ loko wa ma si lejɛ ɔ, a ke wɔ níhi babauu nɛ he maa hia wɔ ngɛ blɔ ɔ nɔ.<verse eid="ACT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 28:11" />Wa ye nyɔhiɔ etɛ sɔuu loko ji wa tsa blɔ hiami ɔ nɔ kɛ Aleksandria lɛ ko nɛ a tsɛɛ lɛ ke “Hawi Nyumuhi” nɛ ba ye fiɛ be ngɛ wo kpɔ ɔ nɔ. <verse eid="ACT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 28:12" />Wa ya da si ngɛ Sirakus a lɛ dami he ɔ nɛ wa ye ligbi etɛ ngɛ lejɛ ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 28:13" />Nɛ wa hia a, wa bɔle si kɛ ya je Regio. E nɔ jena a, wo yi je kɔɔhiɔ bɔni fiami, nɛ lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, wa ye ligbi enyɔ loko ji wa ya su Putueli, <verse eid="ACT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 28:14" />nɛ wa na nyɛmimɛ kaseli komɛ ngɛ lejɛ ɔ. A kpa wɔ pɛɛ nɛ waa hi a ngɔ ligbi kpaago. Jehanɛ ɔ wa hia ngɛ Putueli kɛ pue Roma blɔ.<verse eid="ACT 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 28:15" />Benɛ Roma nyɛmimɛ ɔmɛ nu he kaa wa ma a, a ba kpee wɔ ngɛ Apia blɔ ɔ nɔ. A ti ni komɛ hu ba na wɔ ngɛ Tretaberna. Nɛ e ba mi kaa benɛ Paulo na mɛ ɔ, e na Mawu si nɛ ka ba e mi.<verse eid="ACT 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo ya su Roma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 28:16" />Benɛ wa ya su Roma a, a ngɛ Paulo he bue mohu, se a ha lɛ he blɔ nɛ e ya to he nɛ e suɔ. <verse eid="ACT 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 28:17" />Nɛ benɛ wa ye ligbi etɛ ɔ, Paulo tsɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ a nikɔtɔma amɛ kɛ kpe nɛ e de mɛ ke, “Anyɛmimɛ, i yi nɔ ko awi ko, nɛ i tɔ we wa tsɛmɛ a kusumi ɔmɛ eko hu nɔ, se Yerusalem Yuda bi ɔmɛ nu mi kɛ ha Roma amlaalo ɔ ke a kojo mi. <verse eid="ACT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 28:18" />Roma bi ɔmɛ hyɛ sane ɔ mi nɛ a suɔ nɛ a maa ngmɛɛ ye he, ejakaa a nɛ gbenɔ fɔ bumi nɔ́ ko ngɛ ye he kaa bɔ nɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ a nikɔtɔma amɛ ngɛ hlae ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 28:19" />Se Yuda bi ɔmɛ kplɛɛ we kaa i ye bemi nɛ e sa nɛ a ngmɛɛ ye he. Enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, i je sane ɔ nɛ Kaisare nɛ ye ha mi. Nɛ enɛ ɔ tsɔɔ we kaa i na a he dɔmi ko. <verse eid="ACT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 28:20" />I tsɛ nyɛ kɛ ba hiɛ ɔ mwɔnɛ ɔ nɛ waa le wa he, nɛ nyɛɛ le kaa Israel hɛ nɔ kami nɛ ji Mesia a nɛ i he ye ɔ he je nɛ a wo mi kikɛmɛ a kɔsɔkɔsɔ nɛ ɔ ngɛ.”<verse eid="ACT 28:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 28:21" />A ha lɛ heto nɛ a de ke, “Wa nine sui womi ko nɔ kɛ ji Yudea ngɛ o he, nɛ nyɛmi ɔmɛ nɛ je Yerusalem ɔ hu a ti nɔ ko ba de we wɔ o he munyu yaya ko. <verse eid="ACT 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 28:22" />Se e hi kaa mo nitsɛ o ba, lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, wa maa suɔ nɛ waa nu kikɛmɛ a hemi kɛ yemi nɛ ɔ kɛ je o nya. Ejakaa nɔ́ nɛ pɛ nɛ wa le ngɛ Kristo se nyɛɛli nɛ ɔmɛ a he ji kaa a tuɔ munyu kɛ siɔ mɛ ngɛ he fɛɛ he.”<verse eid="ACT 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 28:23" />Enɛ ɔ he ɔ a to be; nɛ benɛ be ɔ su ɔ, nihi fuu ba e ngɔ ngɛ we mi he nɛ e ngɛ ɔ, nɛ e tsɔɔ mɛ Mawu Matsɛyemi ɔ he ni, kɛ níhi nɛ kɔɔ Yesu he kaa bɔ nɛ Mose kɛ Gbali ɔmɛ ngma ngɛ Ngmami Klɔuklɔu ɔ mi ɔ. Nɛ e kɛ mɛ tu munyu kɛ je mɔtu kɛ ya si gbɔkuɛ.<verse eid="ACT 28:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 28:24" />A ti ni komɛ he e munyu ɔ ye, se ni komɛ hu he we yi. <verse eid="ACT 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 28:25" />Enɛ ɔ ha we nɛ a nya nɛ pee kake, se loko ji a gbɛ ɔ, Paulo wo mɛ blɔ kɛ munyu ko ke, “Anɔkuale munyu nɛ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ tu kɛ gu Gbalɔ Yesaia nɔ ke,<verse eid="ACT 28:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 28:26" />‘Yaa de Yuda bi ɔmɛ ke, Nyɛ maa nu kɛ nyɛ tue nɛ nyɛ maa na kɛ nyɛ hɛ ngmɛ se nyɛ be sisi nue; <verse eid="ACT 28:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 28:27" />ejakaa nyɛ tsui ti, nɛ nyɛ tue wa, nɛ nyɛ ma nyɛ hɛ ngmɛ, ejakaa nyɛ sume kaa nyɛ maa na nɛ nyɛɛ nu konɛ nyɛɛ nu sisi nɛ nyɛɛ ba ye ngɔ nɛ ma tsa nyɛ.’ <verse eid="ACT 28:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 28:28" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, i ngɛ hae nɛ nyɛɛ le kaa a ngɔ Mawu yi wami hemi nɛ ɔ kɛ ya ha ma je li ɔmɛ hu, nɛ mɛɛ lɛɛ a ma he munyu ɔ atuu.” <verse eid="ACT 28:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 28:29" />Benɛ Paulo tu munyu nɛ ɔmɛ ɔ, mi gbami ba Yuda bi ɔmɛ a kpɛti nɛ a gbɛ. <verse eid="ACT 28:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 28:30" />Nɛ Paulo hi we mi he nɛ e ya to ɔ jeha enyɔ, nɛ e nyaa nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ ba slaa lɛ ɔ e he. <verse eid="ACT 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 28:31" />Nɛ e kɛ ka fiɛ Mawu Matsɛyemi ɔ he sane, nɛ e jaje Nutsɔ Yesu Kristo he munyu ɔ ngɔ tsɔɔ mɛ, nɛ nɔ ko tsi we e nya.<verse eid="ACT 28:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 28" />
</usx>